<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Nabi Esayi Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabi Esayi Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esayi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Esayi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabi Esayi Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Heburu xuini, Nabi Esayi xinla bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “Alatala nan marakisi tiin na.” Falani ito nan findixi Kitabun yireni ito falan xunna ra, bayo xaranni ito kui, en na a toma nɛn fa fala, a Alatala, Isirayilaa Ala mɔn yigin nun kisin fima a yamaan ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nabi Esayi a sɛbɛni ito yitaxunxi dɔxɔ saxan nan na lan Isirayila yamana fe taruxun waxatine ma. A yire singena keli sora 1 han 39, na lanxi feene nan ma naxanye danguxi keli ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solofere ɲɛɛ tonge naaninna ma han ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solofere benun Marigi Yesu xa bari. Na waxatini, Nabi Esayi nan yi Alaa falan nalima Yerusalɛn yi. Misiran yamanan sɛnbɛn yi gbo Isirayila sogeteden yiifanna ma. Asiriya yamanan sɛnbɛn yi gboma ayi a kɔmɛn fɔxɔni. Isirayila yi lu mangaya sɛnbɛma firinne longonna ra. Nayi, yɛngɛne yi lu kelɛ Isirayila nun Yuda nun yamana gbɛtɛye tagi. Tɔrɔ waxatini ito yi, Esayi yi a falama Isirayila kaane xa nɛn a e xa la Ala ra e yi e lannayaan sa a yi.</para>
  <para style="ip">A yire firindena keli sora 40 han 55, na xili nɛn waxatina nde yi a “Isirayila madɛndɛnna.” Ala xuiin naxanye mɛnne yi, ne yamaan madɛndɛnma nɛn a yi e sɛnbɛ so. A mi luxi alo a yire singena. Na waxatini, Asiriya kaane mi yi fa findixi yamanan sɛnbɛmaan na fɔ Babilɔn kaane. Ne yi Yerusalɛn taan suxu yɛngɛni ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ suulun ɲɛɛ tonge solomasɛxɛ nun solofere benun Marigi Yesu xa bari, e yi siga a dugurenne fɔxɔ kedenna ra konyiyani. Nabi Esayi yi muxu suxine ralimaniya Alaa falane xɔn. A naxa a Ala mɔn a yamaan naxɛtɛma nɛn a yamanani alo a to e ramini Misiran yi a fɔlɔni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito kui, waliyiya falana ndee tima lan “Alatalaa walikɛɛn” ma. (Na sɛbɛxi sora 42.1-7 nun 49.1-6 nun 50.4-9 nun 52.13 han 53.12 kui). Na kanna, waxatina nde a luxi nɛn alo Ala yɛtɛna, waxatina nde alo yamaan naxan Alaa falan suxi, waxatina nde yi mɔn, a luxi nɛn alo Perise mangan Kirusi. Na falana ndee Yesu fa feen yɛbaxi nɛn ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ wuyaxi benun a xa bari katarabi Esayi sora 53 ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Esayi yire saxandena sora 55 han 66, na lanxi muxu suxine xɛtɛ waxatin nan ma Yuda yamanani ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ suulun tonge saxan nun solomasɛxɛ benun Marigi Yesu xa bari. Na waxatini, Perisene yi nɔɔn sɔtɔ Babilɔn yamanani. Nayi, Yuda kaane yi fa nɔɛ xɛtɛ nɛn Yuda yi. Perisene manga Kirusi kɛdin sɛbɛ nɛn na waxatini naxan a ragidi a Isirayila kaane mɔn xa Ala Batu Banxi nɛnɛn ti. Muxu suxin xɛtɛna a konni, na mi findixi fe bɔrɔxɔxi ra bayo taan kalaxin nan yi a ra. Na nan na ra, Esayi yi xibaru faɲin nali tɔrɔ muxuni itoe ma naxanye bata tunnaxɔlɔ e ma. Marigi Yesu Esayi a falane nan tongoxi alogo a xa a yɛtɛ fa xunna yɛba. Na sɛbɛxi Luka 4.16-21 kui.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1"/>Feni itoe makɛnɛn Amɔsi a dii xɛmɛna Esayi nan xa lan Yuda nun Yerusalɛn ma, Yusiya nun Yotami nun Axasi nun Xesekiya Yuda mangane waxatine yi.<verse eid="ISA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yama murutɛxina fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2"/>Kore xɔnna, ito ramɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">Bɔxɔ xɔnna, i tuli mati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">Amasɔtɔ, Alatala falan tima, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">“N bata diine ragbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">n yi e maxuru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">koni e bata murutɛ n ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3"/>Ɲingena a kanna kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">sofanla a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">a kanna a dɛgema dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">koni Isirayila mi sese kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">n ma yamaan mi sese famuma.”<verse eid="ISA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4"/>Gbalon yama yulubitɔni ito xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">siyaan naxan hakɛne goronna binya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">fe ɲaxi rabane bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">dii tinxintareni itoe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">E bata Alatala rabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">e yi e mɛ Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">e xun xanbi so a yi.<verse eid="ISA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5"/>Ɛ wama a mɔn xa ɛ bɔnbɔ minɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">ɛ to luma murutɛ a ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">Ɛ xunna birin bata findi furen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">ɛ bɔɲɛn birin sɔxɔlɛxi.<verse eid="ISA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6"/>Keli ɛ sanna ma han ɛ xunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">sese mi kɛndɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">Maxɔlɔdene nun bɔnbɔ fɔxɔne nun fure dɛɛne ɛ fatin birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">muxe mi naxanye dandanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">muxe mi e maxidima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">muxe mi turen tima e dɛ.<verse eid="ISA 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7"/>Ɛ yamanan luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">alo tonbon ɲaxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">ɛ taane bata gan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">Xɔɲɛne ɛ yamanan sansine kalama ɛ yɛɛ xɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">Ɛ bɔxɔn bata halagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">a lu alo yaxune na dangu a yi.<verse eid="ISA 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8"/>Siyon taan nan keden pe luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">alo bubun manpa bili nakɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">alo gagen kɔkunba xɛɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">alo yaxune na taan nabilin a yɛngɛ xinla ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9"/>Xa Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:9">mi yi muxe lu a nii ra en konni nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:9">en yi luma nɛn nun alo Sodoma taana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:9">en liga alo Gomora taana.<verse eid="ISA 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10"/>Ɛ Alatalaa falan namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">Sodoma mangane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">Ɛ tuli mati en ma Alaa sariyan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">Gomora kaane!<verse eid="ISA 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11"/>Alatala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">“Ɛ saraxa wuyaxine tɔnɔn mundun n ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">Ɛ bata yɛxɛɛne gan n xa saraxan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">e nun xuruse raturaxine turena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">han n yi wasa na feene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">Turane nun yɛxɛɛ diine nun kɔtɔne wunla mi fa n kɛnɛnxi sɔnɔn!<verse eid="ISA 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12"/>Ɛ na fa n yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:12">nde a falaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:12">ɛ xa fa n batu banxin tanden mabodon gbansan?<verse eid="ISA 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13"/>Ɛ ba fɛ kiseene ra n xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">naxanye tɔnɔ mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">ɛ wusulanna tutin haramuxin na a ra n yɛɛ ra yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">Ɛ kike nɛnɛn sanle rabama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">e nun Matabu Lɔxɔne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">ɛ malanne tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">Ɛ hakɛn naxanye ligama malanne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">ne bata n yili.<verse eid="ISA 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14"/>Ɛ kike nɛnɛ sanle nun ɛ malanne bata n niin tɔrɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">Goronna nan e ra n xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">n bata xadan e bun.<verse eid="ISA 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15"/>Ɛ na ɛ yiine yite n maxandideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">n mi n yɛɛn tima ɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">Hali ɛ n maxandi han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">n mi n tuli matiyɛ ɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">Wunla ɛ yiin birin na.<verse eid="ISA 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16"/>Ɛ maxa, ɛ yɛtɛ rasariɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:16">ɛ yi ɛ kɛwali ɲaxine ba n yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:16">ɛ ba fe ɲaxine ligɛ.<verse eid="ISA 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17"/>Ɛ xaran fe faɲin ligan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">ɛ tinxinna fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">ɛ ɲaxankata tiine ti kira faɲin xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">Ɛ yi kiridine xun mayɛngɛ kitin bolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">ɛ kaɲa gilɛne xun mafala kitini.”<verse eid="ISA 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18"/>Alatala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">“Ɛ fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">en fa feene fɛsɛfɛsɛ en bode xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">Hali ɛ yulubine luxi alo wunla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">e fixama nɛn alo balabalan kɛsɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">Hali e to gbeeli iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">e mɔn sariɲanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">alo dugi fixɛna.<verse eid="ISA 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19"/>Xa ɛ xuru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:19">ɛ n ma falan namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:19">ɛ nɔɛ yamanan bogise faɲine donɲɛ nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20"/>Koni xa ɛ tondi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:20">xa ɛ lu murutɛ n xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:20">silanfanna nan ɛ faxama,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.20</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> Alatala dɛ xuiin nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21"/>Taa tinxinxin findixi taa yalunxin na di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">Kiti kɛndɛn yi Yerusalɛn yiren birin yi a fɔlɔni nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">Tinxin muxune nan yi dɔxi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">Koni iki, faxa tiine nan na yi.<verse eid="ISA 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22"/>Yerusalɛn kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:22">ɛ gbetin bata findi wuren gbiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:22">igen bata basan ɛ dɔlɔ faɲin na.<verse eid="ISA 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23"/>Muxu murutɛxine nan ɛ kuntigine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">e nun muɲadene bata malan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">Dimi yi seene rafan e ma mayifuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">e yi e gi kiseene fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">E mi kiridine xun mayɛngɛ kitin bolonma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">Kaɲa gilɛne kitine bɔtɛ mi e xa.<verse eid="ISA 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24"/>Nanara, Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">Isirayilaa Ala Sɛnbɛmana falan ni ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">a naxa, “Gbalona ɛ xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">N nan n yɛtɛ sɔtɔma nɛn n yɛngɛfane ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">N nan n gbeen ɲɔxɔma nɛn n yaxune ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25"/>Yerusalɛn kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">n kelima nɛn ɛ xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">N na ɛ rasariɲanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">alo wuren gbiin na ba tɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">a maxa safunna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">N yi ɛ fe ɲaxine birin ba ɛ yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">alo yɔxɔn bama wureni kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26"/>N mɔn kitisa faɲine fima ɛ ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">alo a fɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">ɛ kawandi muxune yi lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">alo a singene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">Na xanbi ra, a fa falama ɛ ma nɛn nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">a taa tinxinxina, lannaya yirena.”<verse eid="ISA 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27"/>Siyon taan xunbama nɛn kiti kɛndɛn xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:27">A muxun naxanye na fa Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:27">ne xunbama nɛn tinxinyaan xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28"/>Koni murutɛdene nun yulubitɔne halagima nɛn e bode xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:28">Naxanye na e mɛ Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:28">ne fe bata dan.<verse eid="ISA 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29"/>Nayi, ɛ yagima nɛn ɛ wudi binle fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:29">ɛ yi naxanye batuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:29">e nun ɛ nakɔ yiren naxanye sugandi ɛ kidene ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:30">alo wudin naxanye dɛ yolonma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:30">hanma alo ige mi nakɔɔn naxanye yi.<verse eid="ISA 1:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31"/>Ɛ sɛnbɛmane luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">alo sɛxɛ xarena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">e kɛwanle yi findi tɛɛ fuluxaan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">naxan tɛɛn soma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">e nun e wanle yi gan e bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">muxu yo mi na tɛɛn natu.<verse eid="ISA 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa geyana fe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MIC 4:1-3">Mike 4.1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1"/>Feni itoe makɛnɛn Amɔsi a dii xɛmɛna Esayi nan xa lan Yuda nun Yerusalɛn ma.<verse eid="ISA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2"/>Waxati famatɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">Alatala Batu Banxin geyaan naxan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">na danguma nɛn geyane birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">a lu geyane birin xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">siyane birin yi lu fɛ a ma han!<verse eid="ISA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3"/>Siya wuyaxine fama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">e a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">“Ɛ fa, en siga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">en te Alatalaa geyaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">Yaxubaa Alaa banxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">A xa en xaran a sigati kiine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">alogo en xa bira a kirane fɔxɔ ra.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">Amasɔtɔ sariyan minima nɛn Siyon yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">Alatalaa falan minima nɛn Yerusalɛn yi.<verse eid="ISA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4"/>A findima nɛn kitisaan na siyane tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">A yɛngɛne ɲanma nɛn yama wuyaxi tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">E e silanfanne bɔnbɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">e yi e rafala ɲinge kenne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">e tanbane yi rafala wɔlitɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">Siya yo mi fa silanfanna tongoma gbɛtɛ xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">Yɛngɛn mi fa maxaranɲɛ mumɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5"/>Yaxuba yixɛtɛne, ɛ fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:5">en sigan ti Alatalaa kɛnɛnni!<verse eid="ISA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alatalaa lɔxɔn findixi kitisa lɔxɔn nan na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6"/>Ala, i bata i mɛ i ya yamaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">bayo koron bɔnbɔne waraxi ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">naxanye sa kelixi sogeteden mabinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">yiimatone fan bata wuya ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">alo naxanye Filisitine konni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">I ya yamaan nun siya gbɛtɛne bata so feene yi.<verse eid="ISA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7"/>Yamanan nafexi gbeti fixɛn nun xɛmaan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">a nafunla mi nɔɛ yatɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">Yamanan nafexi soone nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">a yɛngɛ so wontorone mi nɔɛ yatɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8"/>Yamanan nafexi suxurene nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:8">Muxune e xinbi sinma e yii fɔxɔn nan bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:8">e tan yɛtɛɛn seen naxanye rafalaxi.<verse eid="ISA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9"/>Nayi, muxune birin e mafelenma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:9">e fe yi magodo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:9">Ala, i nama e rakeli de!<verse eid="ISA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10"/>Ɛ sa ɛ luxun fanyene bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">ɛ so bɔxɔn bun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">alogo ɛ xa ɛ gi Alatala bun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">naxan magaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">e nun a binye gbeen nɔrɔna!<verse eid="ISA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11"/>Adamadi yɛɛ rawasoxine xun sinma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:11">wasodene yi mafelen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:11">Alatala nan keden ma fe yitema na lɔxɔni.<verse eid="ISA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna lɔxɔn mamɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:12">a kelima wasodene nun yɛtɛ yigbone xili ma lɔxɔn naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:12">a yi ne ragodo naxanye e yɛtɛ yitema.<verse eid="ISA 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13"/>A kelima nɛn Liban suman kuyene birin xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:13">e nun Basan yamanan warine birin<verse eid="ISA 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14"/>e nun geya gbeene nun yire matexine birin,<verse eid="ISA 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15"/>e nun kore banxine nun makantan yinne birin,<verse eid="ISA 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16"/>e nun Tarasisi kaane kunki gbeene nun gise faɲine birin.<verse eid="ISA 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17"/>Wasodene mafelenma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17">yɛtɛ yigbone fe yi godo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17">Alatala nan keden ma fe yitema na lɔxɔni.<verse eid="ISA 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18"/>Suxurene birin yi lɔ ayi.<verse eid="ISA 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19"/>Muxune soma nɛn faranne nun yinle ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">alogo e xa e luxun Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">naxan magaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">e nun a binye gbeen nɔrɔna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">a na keli bɔxɔni maxadeni.<verse eid="ISA 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:20">muxune e suxure gbeti daxine nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:20">xɛma daxine rawolima ayi nɛn sulumɛne nun tuyɛne bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:20">e suxuren naxanye rafalaxi e batu seen na.<verse eid="ISA 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21"/>E soma nɛn fanye longonne nun yinle ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">alogo e xa e gi Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">naxan magaxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">e nun a binye gbeen nɔrɔna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">a na keli bɔxɔni maxadeni.<verse eid="ISA 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22"/>Nayi, ɛ xɛtɛ adamadiine fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:22">nii raxili keden peen nan fa e nun sayaan tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:22">Nayi, nanse e tan na?<verse eid="ISA 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ala Yuda rabeɲinma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1"/>Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna balon nun fɛrɛn birin bama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">Yerusalɛn kaane nun Yuda kaane birin yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">A donseene nun igene birin ba na<verse eid="ISA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2"/>e nun sofa kɛndɛne nun yɛngɛsone</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:2">nun kitisane nun nabine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:2">nun yiimatone nun fonne birin,<verse eid="ISA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3"/>e nun sofa kuntigine nun muxu gbeene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:3">nun kawandi tiine nun yii rafalane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:3">e nun woyimɛ yɛbaxine.<verse eid="ISA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4"/>Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:4">“N diidine findima nɛn e mangane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:4">naxanye mangayaan nabama e waxɔnna ra.”<verse eid="ISA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5"/>Muxune e bode ɲaxankatama nɛn yamani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">birin yi lu a dɔxɔ boden xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">diidine yi ɲaxu fonne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">fuyantenne yi ɲaxu muxu binyene ra.<verse eid="ISA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6"/>Muxuna nde a ngaxakedenna suxuma nɛn a fafe xabilani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">a yi a fala a xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">“Dugi faɲin mɔn i yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">findi en ma mangan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">i ti yama kalaxini ito yɛɛ ra!”<verse eid="ISA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7"/>Bodena a yabima nɛn na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">a naxa, “Ɛ mali fɛrɛn mi n xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">Donse mi n konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">marabɛri ba mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">I nama n findi yamaan mangan na de!”<verse eid="ISA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8"/>Yerusalɛn kalamatɔɔn ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">Yuda yamanan bata bira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">Amasɔtɔ e bata murutɛ Alatalaa binyen xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">e a matandima e falane nun e kɛwanle yi.<verse eid="ISA 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9"/>E yɛtagin kiin gbansanna e xun maxidima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">Kɛnɛn ma feen nan fa e yulubine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">alo Sodoma kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">e mi fa e fe luxunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">Gbalon na kanne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">amasɔtɔ e halagin nan yitɔnma e yɛtɛ xa na ra!<verse eid="ISA 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10"/>Ɛ nɔɛ a falɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:10">ɛ naxa, “Tinxin muxune nan hɛrini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:10">E kɛwanle tɔnɔn sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11"/>Koni gbalon muxu ɲaxine xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:11">Feene birin xɔdɔxɔma ayi nɛn e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:11">Amasɔtɔ, e saranma nɛn e kɛwanle ra.”<verse eid="ISA 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">“Diidine nan n ma yamaan ɲaxankata tiine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">ɲaxanle nan e xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">N ma yamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">ɛ yɛɛratine ɛ ralɔma ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">e yi ɛ kirani fu ɛ ma.”<verse eid="ISA 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala yɛɛratine makiti fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13"/>Alatala bata keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:13">a yitɔnxi kitin xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:13">a bata keli siyane makitideni.<verse eid="ISA 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14"/>Alatala a yamaan fonne nun a kuntigine makitima, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">“Ɛ tan nan n ma nakɔɔn kalaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">n ma yamana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">Ɛ yi ɛ banxine rafe yiigelitɔne seene ra.<verse eid="ISA 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15"/>Nanfera ɛ n ma yamani lunburunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:15">Nanfera ɛ yiigelitɔne ɲaxankatama?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:15">Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16"/>Alatala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">“Siyon sungutunne bata e yɛtɛ yite.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">E sigan tima e kɔɛni texin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">e muxune rakunfa e yɛɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">E sigan tima dɔɲin dɔɲinna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">e lu e san kɔɛ rasone xuiin naminɛ.”<verse eid="ISA 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17"/>Marigin Siyon kaa sungutunne findima nɛn teli kanne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:17">Alatala yi e xunne magenle lu.<verse eid="ISA 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18"/>Na lɔxɔni, Marigina e ratofan seene bama nɛn e yii: San kɔɛ rasone nun ɲɛrɛne nun maxidi seen naxanye digilin fɔlɔxi alo kikena <verse eid="ISA 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19"/>e nun tunla soone nun yii kɔɛ rasone nun kɔɛ mafilinne <verse eid="ISA 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20"/>e nun labaranne nun ɲɛrɛ yɔlɔnxɔnne nun tagixidi dɛnbɛxine nun latikɔnɔnne nun e kantan seene, <verse eid="ISA 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21"/>e nun yii soli rasone nun ɲɔɛ raso wurene, <verse eid="ISA 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22"/>nun sali dugi faɲine nun doma gbeene nun gubane nun gbeti sa seene e yii, <verse eid="ISA 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23"/>e nun mato kikene nun doma yelefuxin tofaɲine nun kɔɛ raxidine nun tungun mafelenne.<verse eid="ISA 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24"/>E latikɔnɔnne xirin masarama nɛn se kunxin xirin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">e tagi xidin yi masara lutin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">E xun dɛnbɛxi faɲine gbananma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">sunu dugine nun bɛnbɛnle yi ragodo e ma dugi faɲine funfuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">Yagin larune yi sa e ma tofanna funfuni.<verse eid="ISA 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25"/>Yerusalɛn kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:25">ɛ xɛmɛne faxama nɛn silanfanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:25">ɛ sofane yi faxa yɛngɛni.<verse eid="ISA 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26"/>Nayi, taan birin e wugama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:26">e sunu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:26">A muxune halagixin yi lu dɔxi bɔxɔni.<verse eid="ISA 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1"/>Na lɔxɔni, ɲaxalan solofere xɛmɛ kedenna suxuma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">e a fala a xa, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">“Nxu donseen nun marabɛri baan fenɲɛ nxu yɛtɛ xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">alogo tun nxu xa yatɛ i ya ɲaxanle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">i yi nxɔ yagin ba!”<verse eid="ISA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2"/>Na lɔxɔni, Alatala se faɲi nɔrɔxina nde rasolima nɛn yamani. Yamanan bogi seene yi findi Isirayila muxu dɔnxɛne kanba xunna nun binyen na. <verse eid="ISA 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3"/>Nayi, naxanye na lu Yerusalɛn yi, naxanye mɔn na lu e nii ra Siyon yi, a falama nɛn ne ma, a “Muxu Rasariɲanxine,” Ala bata naxanye birin xili sɛbɛ alogo e xa nii rakisin sɔtɔ Yerusalɛn yi. <verse eid="ISA 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4"/>Marigina Nii Sariɲanxin yi kiti kɛndɛn nun tɛɛn nafa Yerusalɛn yi, a ɲaxanle rasariɲan e fe xɔsixine ma. A Siyon taan nasariɲan faxa ti wuli funfune ma. <verse eid="ISA 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5"/>Na xanbi ra, Alatala kundaan nun tutin naminima nɛn Siyon geyaan nun a yama malanxin xun ma. Kɔɛɛn na, a findi tɛɛ dɛgɛ gbeen na. A nɔrɔn yi lu e birin xun ma alo xunna soona, <verse eid="ISA 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6"/>alo yigiyaden naxan nininna fima kuye wolon waxatini yanyin na e nun soden nun luxundena, tule gbeen na fa.<verse eid="ISA 4:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila yamanan luxi nɛn alo Alaa nakɔna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1"/>N xa sigin sa n xanuntenna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">n xɔyina manpa bili nakɔna fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">Manpa bili nakɔna nde yi n xanuntenna yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">geyaan sabati yireni.<verse eid="ISA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2"/>A bɔxɔn wali nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">a yi gɛmɛne ba a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">a yi sansi yɛbaxine si na yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">A yi gbengben ti kantan tiden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">A yi dɔlɔ ige baden ge fanyeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">A yengi yi manpa bogi faɲine nan ma a nakɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">koni a manpa bogi xɔlɛne nan sɔtɔxi.<verse eid="ISA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3"/>Nayi, n xanuntenna naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:3">“Ɛ tan naxanye dɔxi Yerusalɛn yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:3">ɛ tan Yuda kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:3">ɛ tan nan kitin sama nxu nun n ma nakɔɔn tagi.<verse eid="ISA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4"/>N yi lan nun n xa nanfe gbɛtɛ liga n ma nakɔɔn xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:4">n munma naxan liga a xa singen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:4">N yengi yi bogi faɲine nan ma nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:4">nanfera nayi, a bogine birin xɔlɔ?<verse eid="ISA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5"/>Iki, n xa a fala ɛ xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">n fama naxan ligadeni n ma manpa bili nakɔɔn na:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">N na a sansanna kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">xuruseene yi a madon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">N na a rabilinna yinna rabirama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">dangu muxune yi a yibodon.<verse eid="ISA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6"/>N na a findima bɔxɔ rabeɲinxin na nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">a mi fa masɛgɛ, a mi biyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">Sɛxɛ ɲaxine nun ɲanle minima nɛn a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">n yi tɔnna dɔxɔ kundane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">a e nama tulen nafa a ma.”<verse eid="ISA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna manpa bili nakɔɔn lanxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">Isirayila yamaan nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">Nakɔɔn naxan yi rafan a ma nun han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">Yuda yamaan nan yi na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">Alatala yengi yi kiti kɛndɛn nan ma a yamani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">koni a gbalon nan lixi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">A yengi yi tinxinyaan nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">koni a gbelegbele xuiin nan mɛxi na.<verse eid="ISA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8"/>Gbalon na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">naxanye banxine tima e bode fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">e xɛɛne tugun e bode ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">han e bɔxɔn birin tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">e yi dɔxɔ kedenyani yamanani.<verse eid="ISA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9"/>N tunla Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falani ito nan mɛxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">“N bata n kɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">banxi wuyaxini itoe kalama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">Banxi gbee faɲini itoe kui genla yi lu.<verse eid="ISA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10"/>Manpa bili nakɔɔn naxan gbo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">han ɲingen xi fu tiyɛ naxan bideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">na mi manpa litiri tonge naanin naminɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">Naxan na murutun kilo kɛmɛ bi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">na kilo fu nan tun xabama.”<verse eid="ISA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11"/>Gbalon na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">naxanye kurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">e e gi dɔlɔn fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">naxanye xima e yɛɛ ra yi dɔlɔ mindeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">han e xunna yi keli.<verse eid="ISA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12"/>E dɛgema e banden don ɲaxaɲaxane yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">bɔlɔn xuiin nun konden xuini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">e nun tanban xuiin nun xulen xuiin nun dɔlɔna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">Anu, e mi Alatala kɛwanle rakɔrɔsima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">e mi a wanle toma.<verse eid="ISA 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13"/>Nanara, Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">“N ma yamaan sigama nɛn konyiyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">bayo e mi waxi sese kolon feni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">E muxu gbeene faxama kamɛn nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">yamaan yi halagi ige xɔnla ma.”<verse eid="ISA 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14"/>Nanara, laxira a dɛni bima nɛn pon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">a yi a so dɛ gbeeni bi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">dan mi naxan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">muxu gbeene nun e yamaan birin yi godo mɛnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">e nun e sɔnxɔ ratene nun e mananmanantɔne birin.<verse eid="ISA 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15"/>Muxune birin mafelenma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:15">adamadiine fe yi godo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:15">wasodene yi e xun sin.<verse eid="ISA 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna fe yitema nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:16">a kiti kɛndɛn xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:16">Ala sariɲanxina a sariɲanna mayitama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:16">a tinxinyaan xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17"/>Nayi, taa kalaxini ito findima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:17">yɛxɛɛne rabaden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:17">e fa e dɛge na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:17">xɔɲɛne yi e balon sɔtɔ nafulu kanne banxi xɔnne yi.<verse eid="ISA 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18"/>Gbalon na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:18">naxanye hakɛne e xidixi wulen xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:18">alo lutina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:18">e bubu e fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:18">E e yulubin bandunma e fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:18">alo yɔlɔnxɔnna wontoron bandunma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19"/>E a falama, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">“Ala xa a mafura,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">a xa a wanla kɛ xulɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">alogo nxu xa a to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">A feen xa yiso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina fe ragidixine xa rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">nxu yi a fe kolon.”<verse eid="ISA 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20"/>Gbalon na kanne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">naxanye a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">a fe ɲaxin fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">a fe faɲin ɲaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">naxanye kɛnɛnna yatɛma dimin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">dimin yi yatɛ kɛnɛnna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">naxanye xɔlɛn yatɛma a ɲaxumɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">ɲaxunna yi yatɛ xɔlɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21"/>Gbalon na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:21">naxanye e yɛtɛ findixi fe kolonne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:21">e yi e yɛtɛ yatɛ xaxilimane ra!<verse eid="ISA 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22"/>Gbalon na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:22">naxanye tunnafan dɔlɔ mindeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:22">naxanye fatan dɔlɔ minseene basanɲɛ!<verse eid="ISA 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23"/>E fe kalan beɲinma se feen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:23">koni e mi tinma sɔntarena kitin sɛ.<verse eid="ISA 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24"/>Nanara, e luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">alo tɛɛn sɛxɛn naxan ganma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">alo sɛxɛ xaren naxan ɲanma tɛɛ dɛgɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">E salenne kunma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">e fugene yi siga ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">alo gbangbanna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">Amasɔtɔ e bata e mɛ Alatalaa sariyan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">E bata Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina falan nabeɲin.<verse eid="ISA 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25"/>Nanara, Alatala bata xɔlɔ a yamaan ma han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">A bata a yiini bandun e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">a yi e ɲaxankata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Geyane xuruxurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">binbine biraxi na xun xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">alo ɲaman kiraan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 5:25"/>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Koni hali na birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Alatalaa xɔlɔn mi ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">a yiin mɔn yi lu yitexi e xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26"/>Ala bata taxamasenni te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">alogo siya makuyene xa a to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">a yi siyana nde xili kolinni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">sa keli bɔxɔn danna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">Ɛ mi e to fɛ e giyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">E xulun de!<verse eid="ISA 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27"/>Muxu yo mi xadanxi e yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">e sese mi e madiganma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">xixɔnla mi muxu yo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">e birin bata xulun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">Sofa yo mi a tagixidin fulunxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">e sese a sankidi luti mi bolonxi.<verse eid="ISA 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28"/>E xalimakunle ɲɔɛne ralemunxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">e xanle birin bandunxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">E soone torone xɔdɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">alo gɛmɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">e wontorone sanne firifirima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">alo wuluwunla.<verse eid="ISA 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29"/>E sofane sɔnxɔ xuiin magaxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">alo yatana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">e wurundunma alo yata sɛnbɛmane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">e xaɲɛxin xɔɔyi seen suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">e yi a xali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">Muxu yo mi nɔɛ a bɛ e yii.<verse eid="ISA 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">e sɔnxɔni tema nɛn na yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">alo fɔxɔ igen na walanɲɛ ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">Nayi, naxan na a yɛɛn ti yamanan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">na dimin nun yigitɛgɛn nan toma a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">kundaan yi lu kɛnɛnna yɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ala yi Esayi findi a walikɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1"/>Manga Yusiya faxa ɲɛɛni, n Marigin to nɛn dɔxi mangaya gbɛdɛ matexini pon! A doma gbeen lenbene yi Ala Batu Banxin nafexi. <verse eid="ISA 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2"/>Maleka gubugubu kanne yi a xun ma. Gubugubu sennin nan yi e keden kedenna birin ma. Gubugubu firinna e yɛtagin yɛɛ maluxunxi, firinna e sanne yɛɛ maluxunxi, firin yi lu e tugan seen na. <verse eid="ISA 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3"/>E yi e xui raminima e bode ma, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">“A sariɲan, a sariɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna sariɲan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">Bɔxɔn birin nafexi a binyen nan na.”<verse eid="ISA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4"/>Ala Batu Banxin dɛɛn ti wudine nun a so dɛɛn lonna yɛtɛɛn yi lu xuruxurunɲɛ e xuiin ma, na yi rafe tutin na.<verse eid="ISA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5"/>N yi a fala, n naxa, “Gbalona n xa, n bata halagi! Amasɔtɔ muxun nan n na naxan dɛ haramuxi, n dɔxi yamaan yɛ, fala haramuxin minima naxanye dɛ. Anu, n bata mangan to n yɛɛn na, Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna.” <verse eid="ISA 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6"/>Koni maleka gubugubu kanna nde keden yi tugan, a fa n binni, tɛɛ wolonna suxi a yii, a naxan tongo saraxa ganden fari tɛɛ kɔ seen na. <verse eid="ISA 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7"/>A yi tɛɛ wolonna din n dɛɛn na, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Iki, bayo ito bata din i dɛɛn na, i hakɛn bata xafari, solonaan bata ti i yulubin ɲan feen na.”<verse eid="ISA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8"/>Nayi, n yi Marigin xuiin mɛ maxɔdinna tiyɛ, a naxa, “N na nde rasigama? Nde sigɛ nxu xa?” N yi a yabi, n naxa, “N tan ni i ra, n nasiga.”<verse eid="ISA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9"/>A mɔn yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">“Siga, i sa a fala yamani ito xa, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">‘Ɛ tuli matima nɛn han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">koni ɛ mi fefe famuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">Ɛ seen matoma nɛn han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">koni ɛ mi a yigbɛma.’<verse eid="ISA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10"/>E bɔɲɛn naxɔdɔxɔ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">i yi e tunle xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">i e yɛɛne raxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">Xanamu, e yɛɛne toon tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">e tunle yi falan mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">e xaxinle yi feen famu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">e yi xɛtɛ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">e kɛndɛyaan sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="ISA 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11"/>N yi maxɔdinna ti, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">“Marigina, han waxatin mundun yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:11">A yi n yabi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">“Han taane na halagi waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">e muxu yo mi lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">e banxine yi kui geli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">xɛɛne yi kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">e findi bɔxɔ rabeɲinxine ra,<verse eid="ISA 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12"/>han Alatala yi muxune masiga a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:12">han yamanan yi rabeɲin fefe!”<verse eid="ISA 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13"/>Xa muxune yatɛn yaganna ɲɔxɔn na lu yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">tɛɛn mɔn xɛtɛma nɛn na raxɔrideni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">Koni wudi gbeene dungine nun wari dungine luma bɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">kii naxan yi e na sɛgɛ waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">bɔnsɔn sariɲanxina nde fan luma yamanani na kii nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">alo wudi dungin naxan sa maɲingima.<verse eid="ISA 6:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7"/>
  <para style="s">Esayi yi Alaa falan nali Axasi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1"/>Yotami a dii xɛmɛna Axasi, Yusiya mamandenna, Yuda Mangan waxatini, Arami manga Resin nun Remaliyaa dii xɛmɛn Peka, Isirayila mangan yi siga Yerusalɛn yɛngɛ xinla ma, koni e mi a nɔ. <verse eid="ISA 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2"/>Muxune yi a fala Axasi xa Dawuda yixɛtɛna, e naxa, “Arami kaane nun Efirami bɔnsɔnna muxune bata e malan ɛ xili ma.” Mangan nun a yamaan bɔɲɛn yi maxa na feen ma alo foyen wudine yimaxama kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3"/>Nayi, Alatala yi a fala Esayi xa, a naxa, “Ɛ nun i ya dii xɛmɛn Seyari-Yasubu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.3</char> <char style="fk">Seyari-Yasubu</char> bunna nɛɛn Heburu xuini fa fala “Yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne xɛtɛma nɛn sa keli konyiyani.”</note> xa mini Axasi ralandeni ige ramaraden faxaraxiin xunna ra,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.3</char> Ige ramaraden naxan geyaan na.</note> dugi xane xɛɛ ma kiraan xɔn. <verse eid="ISA 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4"/>A fala a xa, i naxa, ‘A liga i yeren ma, i raxara, i nama gaxu. I nama tunnaxɔlɔ i ma muxu firinni itoe xɔlɔ gbeena fe ra, Resin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.4</char> Arami kaane mangan nan <char style="fk">Resin</char> na. </note> Arami kaan nun Remaliyaa dii xɛmɛna. Yegen tumatɔɔn nan tun ne firinna ra. <verse eid="ISA 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5"/>N na a kolon Arami kaane nun Efirami bɔnsɔnna muxune nun Remaliyaa dii xɛmɛn bata a nata a e xa fe ɲaxin liga i ra. E naxa, <verse eid="ISA 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6"/>“En siga Yuda yamanan xili ma! En sa mɛn kaane yigitɛgɛ! En yi e yamanani taxun, en yi Tabele a dii xɛmɛn dɔxɔ mangan na e xun na.” <verse eid="ISA 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7"/>Koni Marigina Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:7">Na mi lanɲɛ, na mi ligama.<verse eid="ISA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8"/>Amasɔtɔ Damasi findixi Arami manga taan nan tun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">Resin findixi Damasi mangan nan tun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">Benun ɲɛɛ tonge sennin e nun suulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">Efirami bɔnsɔnna kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">a mi fa yatɛ yamaan na.<verse eid="ISA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9"/>Samari findixi Efirami manga taan nan tun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:9">Remaliyaa dii xɛmɛn findixi Samari mangan nan tun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:9">Xa ɛ mi dɛnkɛlɛya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:9">ɛ mi tiyɛ!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Diin barima naxan xili Ɛmanuwɛli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10"/>Alatala mɔn yi falan ti Axasi xa, a naxa, <verse eid="ISA 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11"/>“Taxamasenna nde maxɔdin bɔxɔn bun hanma kore xɔnna ma Alatala ma, i ya Ala.” <verse eid="ISA 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12"/>Koni Axasi yi a yabi, a naxa, “N mi sese maxɔdinma, n mi Alatala bunbama.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.12</char> Na feen sɛbɛxi Sariyane 6.16 kui.</note><verse eid="ISA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13"/>Nayi, Esayi yi a fala Axasi xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tuli mati, Dawuda yixɛtɛne! Ɛ muxune tunnaxɔlɔma e ma, koni ɛ mi ɛ wasa soxi na yi. Ɛ mɔn n ma Ala fan tunnaxɔlɛ a ma ba? <verse eid="ISA 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14"/>Nayi, Marigin yɛtɛɛn taxamasenna yitɛ ɛ ra: sungutun nasɔlɔnxin fudikanma nɛn, a yi dii xɛmɛn bari. A yi xili sa ‘Ɛmanuwɛli,’ na bunna nɛɛn fa fala, ‘Ala en tagi.’ <verse eid="ISA 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15"/>A baloma fɛnɛn nun kumin nan na, han a yi nɔ fe ɲaxin nun a faɲin tagi rabɛ. <verse eid="ISA 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16"/>Anu benun na diin xa nɔ fe ɲaxin nun a faɲin tagi rabɛ, i gaxuxi manga firinna naxanye yɛɛ ra, ne yamanane rabeɲinma nɛn. <verse eid="ISA 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17"/>Koni Alatala ɲaxankata lɔxɔne rafama nɛn i tan xili ma, e nun i ya yamaan nun i babaa denbayaan xili ma. Na lɔxɔne ɲɔxɔn munma lu na singen xabu Isirayila nun Yuda yamanane fata. Na fatama Asiriya mangan nan na.”<verse eid="ISA 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:18">Alatala tugetugene xilima nɛn kolinni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:18">sa keli Nila baan biradeni fɔxɔ igen ma Misiran yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:18">e nun kumi ɲɛɲɛn naxanye Asiriya yamanani.<verse eid="ISA 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19"/>E birin fama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:19">e fa dɔxɔ folone ra xudene xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:19">e nun gɛmɛ bɔxine kanke ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:19">e nun wudi dungine nun darane birin yi.<verse eid="ISA 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:20">Marigina Asiriya mangan findima nɛn a walikɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:20">a findi dɛ xabe biin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:20">keli Efirati baan kidi ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:20">a yi ɛ xunne nun ɛ sanne mabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:20">hali ɛ dɛ xabene birin.<verse eid="ISA 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:21">muxuna nde ɲinge keden nun sii firin namarama nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22"/>E yi nɔnɔ gbegbe fi muxune ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:22">e fɛnɛn yi don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:22">Muxun naxanye birin na lu yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:22">ne baloma fɛnɛn nun kumin nan na.<verse eid="ISA 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:23">manpa bili wuli keden xɛɛn naxan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:23">naxanye sarama gbeti gbanan wuli keden na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:23">mɛnna findima ɲanle nun tansin xɛɛn nan na.<verse eid="ISA 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24"/>Muxune sigama nɛn mɛnni xanle nun xalimakunle ra e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:24">amasɔtɔ sɛxɛn nun ɲanle nan luma bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="ISA 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25"/>Muxune gaxuma nɛn ɲanle nun tansinne yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:25">muxu yo mi fa sigɛ geyane fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:25">dɛnaxanye yi bima ɲinge kenna ra nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:25">Mɛn yi findi ɲinge rabaden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:25">yɛxɛɛne yi na yibodon.<verse eid="ISA 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8"/>
  <para style="s">Asiriya yamanan yi findi Alaa walikɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Walaxa belebelena nde tongo, i yi sɛbɛnla ti a ma naxan nɔɛ xaranɲɛ, i naxa, ‘Nafunle Suxu Keden Na. A Tongo Mafurɛn.’ ” <verse eid="ISA 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2"/>N yi walaxan yita sereya tinxinxi firin na: Saraxarali Yuriya nun Sakari, Yeberekiyaa dii xɛmɛna.<verse eid="ISA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3"/>Na xanbi ra, n yi n ma ɲaxanla kolon ɲaxanla ra, nabi ɲaxalanmana. A yi fudikan, a yi dii xɛmɛn bari. Nayi, Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “A xili sa, ‘Nafunle Suxu Keden Na. E Tongo Mafurɛn.’ <verse eid="ISA 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4"/>Amasɔtɔ, benun i ya diin xa fatan a falɛ ‘baba’ hanma ‘n na,’ Asiriya mangana muxune Damasi taan nun Samari taan nafunle tongoma yɛngɛni nɛn.”<verse eid="ISA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asiriya kaane fama nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5"/>Alatala mɔn yi a fala n xa, a naxa:<verse eid="ISA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6"/>Yamani ito tondixi Silowa baa ige faɲin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:6">e tunnaxɔlɔxi e ma Manga Resin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.6</char> Arami kaane mangan nan <char style="fk">Resin</char> na. </note> yɛtagi e nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:6">Remaliyaa dii xɛmɛna.<verse eid="ISA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7"/>Nayi, Marigina Efirati baa ige walanxi gbeen nadinma nɛn e xili ma alo fufana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">Asiriya mangan nun a sɛnbɛ gbeen nan na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">Efirati baan fema nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">han a bɔxɔn a ma.<verse eid="ISA 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8"/>Fufaan danguma nɛn Yuda yamanan naxɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">a sa yiren birin xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">a te han a kɔɛɛn bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">A fa han</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">a sa ɛ yamanan yiren birin xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">Ala en tagi!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.8</char> Heburu xuini, a sɛbɛxi, “Ɛmanuwɛli.” Na feen mato Esayi 7.14 nun 8.10 kui.</note><verse eid="ISA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siyane mi nɔɛ sese ra Ala yamaan xili ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9"/>Siyane, ɛ gbelegbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">ɛ gaxu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">Ɛ tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">ɛ tan naxanye sa yamana makuyene yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">Ɛ yitɔn yɛngɛn xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">ɛ yigitɛgɛma nɛn!<verse eid="ISA 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10"/>Ɛ na yɛngɛ feene yitɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">e kalama nɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">Ɛ na falan ti, a mi kamalima!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">Amasɔtɔ Ala nxu tagi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.10</char> Heburu xuini, a sɛbɛxi, “Ɛmanuwɛli.” Na feen mato Esayi 7.14 nun 8.8 kui.</note><verse eid="ISA 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala yɛɛragaxun nan fan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11"/>Alatala bata a yii sɛnbɛ gbeen sa n ma, a yi n maxadi, a n nama yamani ito raliga. A yi a fala n xa, a naxa:<verse eid="ISA 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12"/>Yamani ito feen naxanye yatɛma yanfan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:12">ɛ tan nama ne birin yatɛ yanfan na de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:12">Ɛ nama gaxu e gaxu feene yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:12">ɛ nama xamin ne fe yi de!<verse eid="ISA 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13"/>Ɛ xa Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan tun kolon sariɲanden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:13">ɛ lan ɛ xa na nan binya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:13">ɛ lan ɛ xa gaxu a tan nan yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala findima nɛn yire sariɲanxin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">e nun gɛmɛna Isirayila yama firinne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">yamana e sanna radinma gɛmɛn naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">a findi e rabira gɛmɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">A findima nɛn luti ratixin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">Yerusalɛn kaane yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">a e suxu.<verse eid="ISA 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15"/>E wuyaxi e sanna radinma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:15">e bira, e fe yi kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:15">E suxuma nɛn lutin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:15">e mi nɔɛ e fulunɲɛ.<verse eid="ISA 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nabiin yigina fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16"/>N yi na sereyaan namara n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:16">n yi xaranni ito balan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:16">n na fala n ma xarandiine nan tun xa.<verse eid="ISA 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17"/>N na Alatala mamɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:17">naxan bata a yɛtagin luxun Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:17">N nan n yigi sama Ala nin.<verse eid="ISA 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18"/>Nxu nun n ma diine nan ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:18">Alatala naxanye fixi n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:18">Nxu findixi taxamasenne nun marakolon seene nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:18">Isirayila yi, fata Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:18">naxan dɔxɔden Siyon geyaan fari.<verse eid="ISA 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19"/>Ndee a falama, e naxa, “Ɛ barin kiine nun yiimatone maxɔdin, naxanye wundo feene kɔyɛkɔyɛnma, e falan ti e dɛ bun ma. A mi daxa yamaan xa e gbee alane maxɔdin ba? Muxune mi barinne xan maxɔdinma ɲɛɲɛ muxune xa ba?” <verse eid="ISA 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20"/>Ɛ ne yabima nɛn, ɛ naxa, “Fɔ en xa xɛtɛ Alaa sariyan nun a fala xuine nan ma.” Xa naxan mi falan tima na kiini, na kanna mi kɛnɛnna toma.<verse eid="ISA 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankata dimina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21"/>Muxune yigitɛgɛxin nun e kamɛtɔne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:21">e masiga tima nɛn yamanan xun xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:21">Kamɛn na e suxu ɲaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:21">e xɔlɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:21">e sa e mangan nun e Ala danga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:21">E yɛɛn tima nɛn koren na,<verse eid="ISA 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22"/>na xanbi ra e yi bɔxɔn mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:22">Koni e tɔrɔn nun dimin nun bɔɲɛ rafɔrɛ gbeen nan tun toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:22">E yi rawoli dimi gbeeni.<verse eid="ISA 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɛnɛn gbeen toma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 8:23"/>Anu, naxanye yi luxi na tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">ne dimin ɲanma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">Waxati danguxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">Ala yagin nan nagidi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">Sabulon yamanan nun Nafatali yamanan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">Koni waxati famatɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">kiraan naxan sigama baan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">Yurudɛn baan kidi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">a na rafema nɛn binyen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:23">e nun siya gbɛtɛne yamanana, Galile.<verse eid="ISA 8:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1"/>Yamaan naxan sigan tima dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:1">ne bata kɛnɛn gbeen to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:1">Naxanye dɔxi dimi gbeeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:1">kɛnɛnna bata mini ne ma!<verse eid="ISA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2"/>Ala i bata yamaan nawuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">i yi e sɛwan nagbo ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">E sɛwaxi i yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">alo muxune nɛma sɛwɛ se xaba waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">alo e ɲaxanma kii naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">e nɛma yɛngɛ yi se tongoxine yitaxunɲɛ.<verse eid="ISA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3"/>Amasɔtɔ i ya yamaan tɔrɔma goron tongo wudin naxan bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">e nun wure gbelemɛn naxan saxi e tungunna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">e nun e ɲaxankata muxune bosana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">i bata ne birin kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">alo i a liga kii naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">Midiyane nɔ lɔxɔni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.3</char> <char style="fk">Midiyane</char> nɔ feen mɔn sɛbɛxi Kitisane 6 han 8 kui.</note><verse eid="ISA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4"/>Yaxune sankidin naxanye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">birin yɛngɛ yirene yibodonma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">e nun dugin naxanye birin bata sin wunli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">ne birin ganma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">alo yegen tɛɛni.<verse eid="ISA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5"/>Amasɔtɔ diina nde bata bari en xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">dii xɛmɛn bata sɔtɔ en xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">Mangayaan luma nɛn a tan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">A xili bama nɛn a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">“Kabanako Kawandi Tiina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">Ala Sɛnbɛmana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">Habadan Fafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">Bɔɲɛ Xunbeli Mangana.”<verse eid="ISA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6"/>A mangayaan nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">sigama gboɛ ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">dan mi naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">A dɔxɔma nɛn Dawuda mangaya gbɛdɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">a yamanan xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">A yi a sɛnbɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">a yi a masuxu kiti kɛndɛn nun tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">keli to ma han habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna na ligama a xanuntenya gbeen nin.<verse eid="ISA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa xɔlɔna fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7"/>Marigin bata falan ti Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">na yi Isirayila yamaan sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8"/>Yamaan birin a kolonma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:8">Efirami bɔnsɔnna muxune nun Samari kaane birin yi falan tima wason nun yɛtɛ yigboni, e naxa,<verse eid="ISA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9"/>“Yinna bitikidine bata bira,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.9</char> <char style="fk">Bitikidin</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Birikidina</char>.”</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">en na a ti gɛmɛ masolixine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">Xɔdɛ binle bata kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">en na e masara sumanne ra.”<verse eid="ISA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10"/>Nayi, Alatala Asiriya kaane radinma nɛn Isirayila kaane ma, Manga Resin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.10</char> Arami kaane mangan nan <char style="fk">Resin</char> na. Asiriya kaane nan Manga Resin yaxune ra. Na feen sɛbɛxi Mangane Firinden 16.8-9 kui.</note> yɛngɛfane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:10">A bata e yaxune sɛnbɛ so.<verse eid="ISA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11"/>Arami kaan naxanye sogeteden binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">e nun Filisiti kaan naxanye sogegododen binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">ne nan Isirayila kaane raxɔrima feu!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:11"/>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">Koni hali na birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">Alaa xɔlɔn mi ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">a yiin mɔn yi lu yitexi e xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12"/>Nayi, Alatala bata a yamaan ɲaxankata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">koni e mi e xun xɛtɛxi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">e mɔn mi Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna fenxi.<verse eid="ISA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13"/>Nayi, Alatala Isirayila yamanan birin naxɔrima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:13">lɔxɔ keden peeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:13">fɔlɔ a xunna ma han a xunla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:13">fɔlɔ tugu binle ma han gbalane.<verse eid="ISA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14"/>Fonne nun kuntigine nan a xunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:14">nabiin naxanye wule xaranna tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:14">ne nan a xunla ra.<verse eid="ISA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15"/>Yamani ito yɛɛratine nan e ralɔma ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:15">e muxun naxanye matinxinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:15">ne fan yifuxi.<verse eid="ISA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16"/>Nanara, Marigin mi sɛwaxi a foningene ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">a mi kininkininma a kiridine nun a kaɲa gilɛne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">Amasɔtɔ Ala kolontarene nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">muxu ɲaxine nan e birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">e fala ɲaxin nan tun tima.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:16"/>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">Koni hali na birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">Alaa xɔlɔn mi ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">a yiin mɔn yi lu yitexi e xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17"/>Ɲaxuyaan muxune ganma yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">alo tɛɛn naxan ɲanle nun sɛxɛne birin ɲanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">a yi tɛɛn so fɔtɔnna ɲansanne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">e tutin yi lu tɛ kore.<verse eid="ISA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna xɔlɔ gbeen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">bata tɛɛn so yamanan birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">A luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">alo tɛɛn yamaan nan ganma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">muxu yo mi kininkininma a ngaxakedenna ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19"/>Muxune donseen tongoma yiifanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">kamɛn mi ba e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">E yi e balon fen e kɔmɛnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">e mi wasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">Birin baloma a lanfaan nan na.<verse eid="ISA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20"/>Manase bɔnsɔnna baloma Efirami bɔnsɔnna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">Efirami bɔnsɔnna baloma Manase bɔnsɔnna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">e tan bɔnsɔn firinne yi keli Yuda bɔnsɔnna xili ma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:20"/>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">Koni hali na birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">Alaa xɔlɔn mi ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">a yiin mɔn yi lu yitexi e xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10"/>
  <para style="s">Gbalon Yuda taane xili ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1"/>Gbalon na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:1">naxanye tɔnne dɔxɔma hakɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:1">naxanye sariyane sɛbɛma bodene tɔrɔ xinla ma,<verse eid="ISA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2"/>e tondi sɛnbɛtarene xun mayɛngɛ kitin sɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">Yiigelitɔɔn naxanye n ma yamaan yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">e mi ne kitin sama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">E kaɲa gilɛne kansunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">e kiridine muɲa.<verse eid="ISA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3"/>Ɛ fe saranna na ɛ sɔtɔ lɔxɔ naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">gbalon na fa sa keli wulani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">ɛ nanse ligama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">Ɛ ɛ gima siga nde kon yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">alogo ɛ xa maliin sɔtɔ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">Ɛ nafunle luma minɛn?<verse eid="ISA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4"/>Fɔ ɛ mafelen kasorasane tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">hanma ɛ bira bɔxɔni binbine yɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 10:4"/>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">Koni hali na birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">Alaa xɔlɔn mi ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">a yiin mɔn yi lu yitexi e xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gbalona Asiriya kaane xili ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5"/>Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:5">“Gbalona Asiriya yamanan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:5">naxan findixi bosaan na n yii n ma xɔlɔna fe ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:5">N ma fitinan dunganna a tan nan yii.<verse eid="ISA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6"/>N na a sofane rasigama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">Ala kolontare siyaan xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">N yi e radin yamaan xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">naxanye n naxɔlɔma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">e xa sa mɛn kaane yii seene suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">e yi e nafunle tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">e yi e yibodon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">alo borona kiraan xɔn!<verse eid="ISA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7"/>Koni Asiriya kaane mi na feen to na kiini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">E tan e miri na fe ma kii gbɛtɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">E tan yi waxi halagi nan tun ti feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">e yi siya wuyaxine raxɔri fefe!<verse eid="ISA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8"/>Amasɔtɔ e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:8">‘N ma sofa kuntigine mi findixi mangane xan na ba?<verse eid="ISA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9"/>N mi Kalano taan suxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">alo Karakemisi taan ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">N mi Xamata taan ligaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">alo Arapada taan ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">N mi Samari taan ligaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">alo Damasi taan ba?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.9</char> Asiriya kaane bata yi taani itoe suxu. E sɛbɛ kiina a yitaxi, a e luma e masoɛ Yerusalɛn taan nan na.</note><verse eid="ISA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10"/>N bata suxure batu yamanani itoe suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:10">naxanye suxurene yi fisa Yerusalɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:10">nun Samari yamanan gbeene xa.<verse eid="ISA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11"/>N naxan liga Samari yamanan nun a suxurene ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:11">n mi nɔɛ na ligɛ Yerusalɛn nun a suxurene ra ba?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12"/>Koni Marigin na yelin a wanle birin nakamalɛ Siyon geyaan fari e nun Yerusalɛn yi, a Asiriya mangan fan saranma nɛn a yɛtɛ yiteen nun a yɛɛ rawason na. <verse eid="ISA 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13"/>Amasɔtɔ na mangan yi a falama nɛn, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">“N feni itoe birin ligaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">n fangan nun n ma fe kolonna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">amasɔtɔ xaxilimaan nan n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">N bata yamanane danne kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">n yi e nafunle muɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">n mangane ba e dɔxɔdene yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">alo sɛnbɛmaan yɛtɛna.<verse eid="ISA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14"/>N bata siyane nafunle tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">alo muxun xɔli tɛɛn tongon kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">N bata bɔxɔ xɔnna seene birin malan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">alo muxun xɔli xɛlɛ rabeɲinxine matongon kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">E sese mi nɔxi e gabutɛni tɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">hanma e dɛ xanli bi, e wuga.”<verse eid="ISA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15"/>Bunbin nɔɛ a yɛtɛ matɔxɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">dangu a rawali muxun na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">Sɛrana a yɛtɛ matɔxɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">dangu a rawali muxun na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">Bosaan nɔɛ a tongo muxun nawalɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">Dunganna nɔɛ muxun tongɛ ba?<verse eid="ISA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16"/>Nanara, Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:16">yama hiyabuxini ito radoyenma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:16">Halagi ti tɛɛ gbeen yi so e binyen na.<verse eid="ISA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17"/>Isirayilaa kɛnɛnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">Ala yɛtɛɛn findima nɛn tɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">E sariɲantɔɔn yi findi tɛɛ dɛgɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">a Asiriya yamanan ɲanle</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">nun a sɛxɛne birin gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">e ɲan lɔxɔ kedenni.<verse eid="ISA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18"/>A fɔtɔn gbeene raxɔrima nɛn fefe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:18">e nun wudin naxanye birin bogima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:18">A yamanan halagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:18">alo furemaan nɛma doyenɲɛ.<verse eid="ISA 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19"/>Wudi dɔnxɛn naxanye na lu Asiriya fɔtɔnne yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:19">hali dii ɲɔrɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:19">a nɔɛ e yatɛn sɛbɛ nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20"/>Na lɔxɔni, Isirayila yamaan muxu dɔnxɛn naxanye na lu e nii ra Yaxuba bɔnsɔnni, ne mi fa e lannantenyaan sama e ɲaxankata muxune yi sɔnɔn. E fa e lannayaan sama Alatala nin, Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina. <verse eid="ISA 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21"/>Yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne xɛtɛma nɛn Ala sɛnbɛmaan ma, Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna muxu dɔnxɛne. <verse eid="ISA 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22"/>Anu, Isirayila kaane, hali ɛ yamaan wuya ayi alo mɛɲɛnsinna naxan fɔxɔ igen dɛ, hali na, e dɔnxɛdin nan tun xɛtɛma. Halagin bata ragidi, naxan gboma ayi, a mɔn tinxin. <verse eid="ISA 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23"/>Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna bata halagin naxan nagidi, a na rakamalima nɛn yamanan birin yi.<verse eid="ISA 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala a yamaan xunbama nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24"/>Nanara, Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “N ma yamana, ɛ tan naxanye dɔxi Siyon yi, ɛ nama gaxu Asiriya kaane yɛɛ ra! E ɛ bɔnbɔma nɛn dunganna ra, e yi gbengbetenni te ɛ xili ma alo Misiran kaane yi a ligama kii naxan yi nun. <verse eid="ISA 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25"/>Koni benun waxati, n ma xɔlɔn ɲanma nɛn ɛ xili ma. N fitinaxin yi keli e kaladeni.” <verse eid="ISA 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna bosaan tongoma nɛn Asiriya kaane xili ma, alo a keli Midiyan kaane xili ma kii naxan yi Orebi fanye yireni. A a dunganni bandunma nɛn baan xun ma, alo a liga Misiran yamanani kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:27">a goronna bama nɛn ɛ tungunna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:27">e goron tongo wudin naxan sa ɛ kɔɛ ma konyiyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:27">ɛ xungboma nɛn han na yi gira, a bira.<verse eid="ISA 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxune yi maso Yerusalɛn ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28"/>E bata Ayati taan li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:28">E danguma Migiron nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:28">e yi e goronne lu Mikimasi taani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.28</char> Yaxune ganla yi fɛ nɛn Yerusalɛn yɛngɛdeni kirani ito xɔn. A bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Yaxune bata maso.”</note><verse eid="ISA 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29"/>E danguma geya longori ra kiraan nan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">e a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">“En xi Geba yi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">Rama kaane xuruxurunma gaxuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">Sɔli a taan Gibeya muxune bata e gi.<verse eid="ISA 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30"/>Galin kaane, ɛ gbelegbele!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:30">Layisa kaane, ɛ tuli mati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:30">Anatɔti kaane, ɛ makininkinin de!<verse eid="ISA 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31"/>Madimena kaane bata xuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:31">Gebimi kaane e luxunden fenma.<verse eid="ISA 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32"/>To, yaxune sa tima nɛn Nobi yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:32">e yi e yiini te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:32">e yi e kɔnkɔ Siyon taa faɲin geyaan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:32">Yerusalɛn geyana.<verse eid="ISA 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33"/>Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">wudi yii gbeene sɛgɛma nɛn sɛnbɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">Wudi kuyene yi rabira bɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">Naxanye kondeye mate han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">a ne ragodoma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34"/>A fɔtɔnna ɲansanne sɛgɛma nɛn bunbin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:34">Liban fɔtɔnne yi bira Sɛnbɛ Kanna bun.<verse eid="ISA 10:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11"/>
  <para style="s">Manga nɛnɛn Dawuda bɔnsɔnni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1"/>Dii xɛmɛn minima nɛn Yese bɔnsɔnni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.1</char> <char style="fk">Yese</char> nan Dawuda fafe ra. Na sɛbɛxi Samuyɛli Singena 16.18-19 kui.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:1">alo wudi ɲingin minima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:1">wudi dungin ma kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:1">Na sabatima nɛn fata a salenne ra.<verse eid="ISA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2"/>Alatalaa Nii Sariɲanxin luma nɛn a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">fe kolonna nun xaxilimayaan sɔtɔma niin naxan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">kawandi kɛndɛn nun sɛnbɛn sɔtɔma niin naxan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">Alatala kolonna nun a yɛɛragaxun sɔtɔn niin naxan xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3"/>A niin sama nɛn Alatala yɛɛragaxun fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:3">A mi kitin sama yɛtagin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:3">A mi feene ragidima muxune fala xuiin xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4"/>Koni a sɛnbɛtarene makitima nɛn tinxinni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">Yiigelitɔɔn naxanye yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">a yi ne feene ragidi ɲɛnige faɲini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">A yamanan muxune garinma nɛn falan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">alo bosana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">A fala xuine yi muxu ɲaxine faxa.<verse eid="ISA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5"/>Tinxinyaan nun tɔgɔndiyaan luma nɛn a yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:5">alo tagi xidin muxun tagi waxatin birin.<verse eid="ISA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6"/>Nayi, kankon nun yɛxɛɛ diin luma nɛn e bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">burunna ɲarin nun siin yi e sa yire kedenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">turadin nun yatan nun xuruse turaxin yi lu e bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">diidina nde yi ti e yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7"/>Ɲinge gilɛn nun kanko gbeena e dɛgema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:7">e diine yi sa e sa yire kedenni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:7">Yatan yi sɛxɛn don alo ɲingena.<verse eid="ISA 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8"/>Dii ɲɔrɛn sabaan soma nɛn saɲin soden dɛxɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:8">diin yi nɔ a yiin nasoɛ koson yinla ra.<verse eid="ISA 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9"/>Fe ɲaxi mi fa luma na, gbalo mi na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">Alatalaa geya sariɲanxin birin fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">Amasɔtɔ Alatala kolonna yamanan nafema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">alo fɔxɔ igena a folon nafema kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:10">diin naxan minixi Yese bɔnsɔnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:10">na luma tixi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:10">alo taxamasenna yamane yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:10">Siyane fama nɛn a fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:10">a dɔxɔden yi lu mayilenɲɛ binyeni.<verse eid="ISA 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxu suxine xɛtɛ fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:11">Marigin mɔn a yiini bandunma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:11">alogo a xa a yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne xunba:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:11">naxanye na lu e nii ra Asiriya yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:11">e nun Misiran yamanan lanbanna nun a faxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:11">e nun Kusi nun Elan nun Babilɔn yamanane yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:11">e nun Xamata yamanan nun fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne yi.<verse eid="ISA 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12"/>A taxamasenna tima nɛn siyane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">a Isirayila kaane malan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">naxanye yi suxi yɛngɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye xuyaxi ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">dunuɲa xun xɔn, a yi ne malan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">sa keli bɔxɔn tongon naaninne birin yi.<verse eid="ISA 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13"/>Nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">Efirami bɔnsɔnna mi fa Yuda bɔnsɔnna maxɔxɔlɔnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">Yuda bɔnsɔnna yaxune raxɔrima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">Efirami mi fa Yuda maxɔxɔlɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">Yuda mi fa findima Efirami yaxun na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14"/>E birin sigama nɛn yɛngɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">sogegododen binni Filisitine geyane fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">e sa sogeteden binna muxune nafunle tongo yɛngɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">Edɔn nun Moyaba yamanane yi lu e sɛnbɛn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">Amonine yi xuru e ma.<verse eid="ISA 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15"/>Alatala igen ɲanma nɛn Misiran fɔxɔ ige yireni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">a yi a yiini bandun Efirati baan xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">a yi na baani taxun xude solofere ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">a dɛ foye gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">muxune yi nɔ a gidɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">e mi e sankidine ba.<verse eid="ISA 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16"/>Kiraan luma nɛn a yamaan xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:16">naxanye na lu e nii ra Asiriya yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:16">A luma nɛn alo a liga e benbane xa kii naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:16">e to mini Misiran yamanani.<verse eid="ISA 11:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yama rakisixin yi Ala tantun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1"/>I a falama nɛn na lɔxɔni, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">“Alatala, n ni i tantunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">I yi xɔlɔxi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">koni i ya xɔlɔn bata xɛtɛ n fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">i yi n madɛndɛn.<verse eid="ISA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2"/>Ala nan n nakisixi yati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">N na n yigi sama a tan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">n mi fa gaxuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">Alatala nan n fangan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">Alatala nan n ma bɛti ba xunna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">N nakisimana a tan nan na.”<verse eid="ISA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3"/>Ɛ kisin sɔtɔma nɛn sɛwani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:3">alo ɛ igen bama tigi yinla ra kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4"/>Na lɔxɔni, ɛ a falama nɛn, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">“Ɛ tantunna fi Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">ɛ xui ramini a ma a xinli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">ɛ a kɛwanle rali siyane tagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">ɛ a rabira muxune ma a xinla gbo kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5"/>Ɛ bɛtin ba Alatala xa bayo a bata fe gbeene rakamali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:5">Ɛ e fe fala dunuɲa muxune birin xa!”<verse eid="ISA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6"/>Siyon kaane, ɛ sɔnxɔ sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:6">ɛ gbelegbele ɲaxanni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:6">Amasɔtɔ, Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:6">naxan ɛ tagi!<verse eid="ISA 12:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13"/>
  <para style="s">Babilɔn taan naɲanna bata maso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1"/>Waliyiya falan ni ito ra naxan makɛnɛn Amɔsi a dii xɛmɛna Esayi xa lan Babilɔn taan ma.<verse eid="ISA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2"/>Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">“Ɛ taxamasenna ti geya mabaxin fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">Ɛ gbelegbele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">alogo ɛ xa sofane rakolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">Ɛ yiine maliga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">alogo e xa so taan muxu gbeene so dɛɛne ra.<verse eid="ISA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3"/>N tan nan yamarin fixi muxune ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">naxanye rasariɲanxi n xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">N bata n ma sofa yɛbaxine xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">naxanye sɛwama n ma nɔ sɔtɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">alogo e xa n ma xɔlɔn mayita.”<verse eid="ISA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4"/>Ɛ tuli mati sɔnxɔ xuini ito ra geyane fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">yama gbeen nan xui a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">Ɛ tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">yamanane bata yimaxa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">alo siyane na e malan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">a ganli tɔnma yɛngɛ so xinla ma.<verse eid="ISA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5"/>Alatala fama e nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">ganla naxan a xɔlɔn naxuyama ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">sa keli bɔxɔn yire makuyeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">sa keli kore xɔnna danna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">E yamanan birin kalama nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6"/>Ɛ gbelegbele sununi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:6">amasɔtɔ Alatalaa lɔxɔn bata maso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:6">A fama alo halagi ti gbalona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:6">fata Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna ra.<verse eid="ISA 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7"/>Nanara, birin bata xadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:7">muxune bata tunnaxɔlɔ e ma.<verse eid="ISA 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8"/>Gaxun bata e suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">xɔlɛn sifan birin e fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">Muxune e fatine yimaxama xɔlɛn bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">alo ɲaxanla tinna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">E birin xaminxina e bode matoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">E yɛtagine yifɔrɔxi.<verse eid="ISA 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9"/>A mato, Alatalaa lɔxɔn fama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">kininkinintare lɔxɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">fitinan nun xɔlɔ gbeen naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">alogo bɔxɔ xɔnna xa raxɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">a findi tonbonna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">a yi yulubitɔne halagi a yi.<verse eid="ISA 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10"/>Saren naxanye kore e nun e sare kurune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">ne mi fa dɛgɛn sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">Sogen nɛɛn fa te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">a bata yidimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">kiken mi fa dɛgɛma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11"/>Ala naxa, “N dunuɲa muxune</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">kɛwali ɲaxine saranma e ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">n yi muxu ɲaxine hakɛne saran e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">N yi yɛtɛ yitene wason dan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">n yi nɔ kanne yandan kala.<verse eid="ISA 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12"/>N muxune xuruma nɛn bɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:12">han e mi fa toma xulɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:12">alo xɛma faɲina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:12">e to raxɔlɔma ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:12">alo xɛmaan naxan sa kelima Ofiri yamanani.”<verse eid="ISA 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13"/>Nanara, n kore xɔnni maxama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">bɔxɔ xɔnna yi xuruxurun, a ba a funfuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna fitinana fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">a xɔlɔn na keli lɔxɔn naxan yi alo tɛɛna.<verse eid="ISA 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14"/>Nayi, muxune birin sigama nɛn e konne yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">birin yi a gi siga a yamaan fɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">alo xɛnla naxan sagatanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">alo xuruse raba mi yɛxɛɛn naxanye fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="ISA 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15"/>E na muxu yo to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:15">na kanni sɔxɔnma nɛn tanban na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:15">E na naxan yo suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:15">na kanna faxama nɛn silanfanna ra.<verse eid="ISA 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16"/>E dii futene yi yibutuxun e yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:16">e banxi kui seene yi tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:16">muxune yi fu e ɲaxanle ma e yɛtagi.<verse eid="ISA 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17"/>Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:17">“N Mede kaane rakelima nɛn e xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:17">gbetin bɔtɛ mi siyaan naxan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:17">e mɔn mi sɛwama xɛmaan na.<verse eid="ISA 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18"/>E banxulanne yi faxa Mede kaane xalimakunle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:18">e mi kininkininma dii futene ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:18">e ɲaxu diidine ra.”<verse eid="ISA 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19"/>Babilɔn naxan findixi taa tofaɲin na yamanane yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">naxan findixi Babilɔn kaane binyen nun e kanba xunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">Ala na taan halagima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">alo Sodoma taan nun Gomora taana.<verse eid="ISA 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20"/>Muxu yo mi fa dɔxɔma a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">a yigenla luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">han mayixɛtɛ nun mayixɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">Hali Arabu sigatine yati mi danguɛ a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">hali xuruse rabane mi fa e xuruseene xalima na.<verse eid="ISA 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21"/>Koni burunna subene nan dɔxɔma na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">xutunxunbane yi e banxine rafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">Dangaranfulene yi lu na yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">kɔtɔne yi na findi e bodonden na.<verse eid="ISA 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22"/>Kankone wuga xuiin yi lu minɛ a yire makantanxine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">barekodane yi so a manga banxine kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">Babilɔn gbee waxati saxin bata maso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">A siimayaan mi fa xunkuya.<verse eid="ISA 13:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane xɛtɛ fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1"/>Alatala kininkininma nɛn Yaxuba yixɛtɛne ma. A mɔn Isirayila yamaan sugandima nɛn, a mɔn yi e radɔxɔ e bɔxɔni. Xɔɲɛne yi sa e fari, e findi Yaxubaa yamaan na.<verse eid="ISA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2"/>Siyaan bonne fama nɛn Isirayila kaane tongodeni, e siga e ra Alatalaa yamanani. Isirayila yamaan yi siyane findi e konyine ra, xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla. Na kiini, muxun naxanye e findi konyine ra, e fan yi ne findi e konyi ra, e findi e ɲaxankata muxune kanne ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Babilɔn mangan saya sigina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3"/>Isirayila kaane, lɔxɔna nde, Alatala matabun fima nɛn ɛ ma ɛ tɔrɔne nun ɛ lanbaranne nun ɛ konyiya xɔdɛxɛn ɲan xanbini. <verse eid="ISA 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4"/>Na waxatini, ɛ sigi ɲaxumɛni ito sama nɛn, ɛ Babilɔn mangan magele, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:4">Ee! En ɲaxankata muxun mi fa na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:4">A gbalon bata ɲan!<verse eid="ISA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5"/>Alatala bata muxu ɲaxine bosaan sɛnbɛn kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:5">A bata nɔ sɔtɔ dunganna kala<verse eid="ISA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6"/>naxan yi siyane mabɔnbɔma xɔlɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">a yɛ wuyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">dan mi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">naxan fitinaxin yi nɔɔn tima yamanane xun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">a gbalon sa e fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">naxan dan mi na.<verse eid="ISA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7"/>Iki, yamanan birin bata lu bɔɲɛ xunbenli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:7">muxune gbelegbelema sɛwani.<verse eid="ISA 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8"/>Hali fɔfɔne nun Liban sumanne sɛwaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">i kala feen na, e a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">e naxa, “Xabu i binbin maluxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">muxu yo mi fa fama nxu sɛgɛdeni.”<verse eid="ISA 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9"/>Faxa muxune e ramaxama nɛn bɔxɔn bun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">fa i ralandeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">i nɛma fɛ waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">dunuɲa ito muxu gbeene birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">Naxanye yi siyane mangane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">ne birin kelima nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10"/>E falan ti, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">“I fan bata findi fangataren na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">alo nxu tan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">Iki, i bata lu alo nxu tan!”<verse eid="ISA 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11"/>E bata ɛ nun i ya wason</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">nun i ya bɔlɔn xuiin birin nagodo gaburun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">Kɔnɛne nan i saden na i bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">kunle yi findi i ya bitinganna ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12"/>Ee! I bata bira sa keli kore</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">i tan tagalan saren naxan dɛgɛma subaxani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">I bata woli bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">i tan naxan yi siyane rabirama!<verse eid="ISA 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13"/>I yi a falama i yɛtɛ ma, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">“N tema nɛn kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">n sa n ma mangaya gbɛdɛn dɔxɔ mɛnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">Alaa sarene faxa ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">N sa dɔxɔ alane tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">e malanma geyaan naxan ma sogeteden kɔmɛnna ma.<verse eid="ISA 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14"/>N tema nɛn kundane fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:14">N yi lu alo Kore Xɔnna Ala.”<verse eid="ISA 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15"/>Koni e bata sa i sa fɔ gaburun xɔnna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:15">i lu laxira yili tilinxin na.<verse eid="ISA 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16"/>Naxanye na i to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">ne i matoma nɛn ki faɲi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">E miri i ya fe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">e yi a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">“Xɛmɛni ito xa mi yi bɔxɔn naxuruxurunma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">a yi yamanane yimaxa?<verse eid="ISA 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17"/>Ito xa mi dunuɲa findi tonbonne ra ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:17">a yi taane kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:17">a tondi kasorasane beɲinɲɛ?”<verse eid="ISA 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18"/>Ɲɔndin na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:18">siyane birin mangane maluxunxi binyen nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:18">e keden kedenna birin yi lu e gaburune ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19"/>Koni i tan bata woli ayi i ya gaburun fari ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">alo wudi yii xaren biraxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">Faxa muxune bata sa i yɛɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">naxanye faxaxi silanfanna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">naxanye bata sa gɛmɛne fari yinla ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">I bata lu alo binbi yibodonxina.<verse eid="ISA 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20"/>Koni i tan mi maluxunma alo ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">amasɔtɔ i bata i ya yamanan kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">i yi i ya yamaan naxɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">Bɔnsɔn ɲaxina fe mi fa falama habadan.<verse eid="ISA 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21"/>Ɛ a diine faxa feni tɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">lan e benbane gbalo feene ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">E nama fa keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">e yi bɔxɔn birin findi e gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">e dunuɲa rafe e taane ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan ni ito ra, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">“N kelima nɛn Babilɔn taan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">n yi a xinla ralɔ ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">e nun a muxun naxanye na lu e nii ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">e nun e diine nun e yixɛtɛne birin.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23"/>N taani ito findima nɛn dara yiren na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">gbalane dɛnaxan yi e nun sagalene dingirana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">N yi Babilɔn taan makɔ halagi ti silanden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna bata a kɔlɔ, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">“N bata feen naxan yitɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">na ligama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">N bata naxan nagidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">na kamalima nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25"/>N Asiriya kaane halagima nɛn n ma yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">n yi e raxɔri n ma geyane fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">E konyiyaan bama nɛn n ma yamaan xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">e goronna yi ba e tungunna fari.”<verse eid="ISA 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26"/>Ala na nan nagidixi dunuɲa birin xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:26">a yiini texi siyane birin xili ma na kii nin.<verse eid="ISA 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27"/>Xa Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna fena nde ragidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:27">nde nɔɛ a yikalɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:27">A na a yiini te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:27">nde nɔɛ a raxɛtɛ a funfuni?<verse eid="ISA 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Waliyiya falana Filisitine xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28"/>Waliyiya falani ito tixi Manga Axasi faxa ɲɛɛn nan na.<verse eid="ISA 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29"/>Ɛ tan Filisitine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">e yi ɛ bɔnbɔma bosaan naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">na bata kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">koni ɛ nama sɛwa na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">Amasɔtɔ koson minima nɛn saɲi faxaxin bɔnsɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">ninginangan yi mini koson bɔnsɔnni naxan tuganma.<verse eid="ISA 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30"/>Tɔrɔ muxu gbeene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">ne donseen sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">sɛnbɛtarene yi e matabu bɔɲɛ xunbenli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">Koni ɛ tan Filisitine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">n na ɛ bɔnsɔnna halagima fitina kamɛn nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">Naxanye na lu e nii ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">ne birin yi faxa.<verse eid="ISA 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31"/>Ɛ tan taa makantanxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">ɛ wuga xuini te!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">Taan muxune, ɛ gbelegbele!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">Filisiti yamaan bata tunnaxɔlɔ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">amasɔtɔ tɛɛ tutin fama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">sa keli sogeteden kɔmɛnna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">Muxu yo mi baxi yaxune ganla safane ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32"/>Filisitine xɛrane yabin findin nanse ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">“Alatala nan Siyon taan tixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">a yamaan yiigelitɔne yigiyade faɲin sɔtɔma dɛnaxan yi.”<verse eid="ISA 14:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15"/>
  <para style="s">Waliyiya falan Moyaba xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1"/>Waliyiya falana Moyaba yamanan xili ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">Ari taan bata raxɔri Moyaba yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">a kala kɔɛ kedenna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">Kiri taan bata raxɔri Moyaba yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">a kala kɔɛ kedenna ra.<verse eid="ISA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2"/>Dibon kaane tema e suxure kide matexine yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">e wugama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">Moyaba kaane gbelegbelema Nebo nun Medeba taane yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">Muxune birin bata e xunne nun e dɛ xabene bi sununi.<verse eid="ISA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3"/>Sunu dugine nun bɛnbɛnle ragodoxi e ma kirane xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">E gbelegbelema e banxine fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">e nun e yama malandene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">e birin wugama han!<verse eid="ISA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4"/>Xɛsibɔn nun Eleyale kaane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">gbelegbelema mali muxu feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">E xuiin sa mɛma fɔ Yahasi taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">Nanara, Moyaba sofane gbelegbelema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">e bata tunnaxɔlɔ e ma.<verse eid="ISA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5"/>N gbelegbelema Moyaba kaane fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">A muxune bata e gi siga han Soyari taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">siga han Egilati-Selisiya taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">E tema wugɛ Luxiti geyaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">E wuga xuini tema e kalana fe ra Xoronayin kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6"/>Nimirimi daraan bata xɔri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:6">sɛxɛne bata xara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:6">ɲɔxɔndene bata ɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:6">Sese xinde mi fa na.<verse eid="ISA 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7"/>Nanara, muxune e se dɔnxɛne tongoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:7">naxanye luxi e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:7">e nɔxi naxanye ramarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:7">e yi siga e ra Wudi Tofaɲin Xuden kidi ma.<verse eid="ISA 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8"/>Sɔnxɔ xuiin minima Moyaba yamanan birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:8">E wuga xuiin minima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:8">sa keli fɔ Egilayimi taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:8">sa keli fɔ Elimi xɔɲin yireni.<verse eid="ISA 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9"/>Xuden naxan danguma Dimɔn yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">na bata findi wunla ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">“N mɔn gbalo nɛnɛne rasigama nɛn Dimɔn yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">N yatana nde rafama nɛn Moyaba muxu gixine xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">e nun naxanye na lu e yamanani.”<verse eid="ISA 15:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16"/>
  <para style="s">Moyaba Yerusalɛn xandima nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1"/>Moyaba mangane yi a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">“Ɛ yɛxɛɛne rasiga Yuda yamanan mangan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">sa keli Sela tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">siga Siyon geyaan fari.”<verse eid="ISA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2"/>Moyaba ɲaxanle bata baan gididen li Arinon yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:2">E luxi nɛn alo xɔliin naxanye e gixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:2">naxanye kedixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:2">e makuya e tɛɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3"/>Moyaba kaane yi a fala Yerusalɛn kaane xa, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">“Nxu maxadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">i fena nde ragidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">Yanyi tagi sogen bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">i nininna xa so nxu xun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">alo kɔɛna, i nxu kantan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">Nxɔ muxu gixine luxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">i nama gi muxune yanfa de!<verse eid="ISA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4"/>A lu nxɔ muxu gixine xa e dɔxɔ ɛ konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">dɔxɔden so e yii e ratangɛ halagi tiin ma dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">Naxan nxu ɲaxankatama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">na mi luma habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">halagin fama nɛn a dandeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">Naxan nxu yɛngɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">na kelima nɛn yamanani.<verse eid="ISA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5"/>Nayi, i ya mangayaan sɛnbɛn sɔtɔma nɛn hinanna xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">Dawuda yixɛtɛna nde yi mangayaan naba lannayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">kitisaan naxan kiti kɛndɛn fenma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">naxan sɔbɛ soxi tinxinna ma.”<verse eid="ISA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn mi nɔɛ Moyaba maliyɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JER 48:29-36">Yeremi 48.29-36</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6"/>Nxu bata Moyaba kaane wasona fe mɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">naxan gbo han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">e nun e yɛtɛ yigboon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">nun e wason nun e yɛtɛ yitena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">Koni e yɛtɛ matɔxɔma fuun nin.<verse eid="ISA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7"/>Nanara, Moyaba kaane gbelegbelema sununi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">e yamanana fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">e birin e wuga xuini tema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">E kutunma nimisani Kiri-Haresɛti taa kalaxina fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">E bata tunnaxɔlɔ e ma fefe!<verse eid="ISA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8"/>Xɛsibɔn xɛɛne bata kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">alo Sibima manpa binle.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">Siyane mangane bata manpa bili yɛbaxine yibodon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">naxanye bogine yi sigama han Yaasɛri taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">e xuya tonbonna xun xɔnna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">e yiine yi sigaxi han Fɔxɔ Daraan kidi ma.<verse eid="ISA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9"/>Nanara, n wugama Yaasɛri kaane xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">Sibima manpa binle fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">Ee! Xɛsibɔn taan nun Eleyale taana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">N na n yɛɛgen nagboma ayi nɛn ɛ ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">Yɛngɛn xuiin bata mini ɛ manpa bili nakɔne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">e nun ɛ se xaba daxine yi.<verse eid="ISA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10"/>Sɛwan nun ɲaxaɲaxan bata ɲan wudi bili nakɔne yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Sigi sa xuiin nun sɛwa xuiin mi fa mɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">nxɔ manpa bili nakɔne yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Muxu yo mi fa manpa bogine igen bama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">n bata danna sa sɛwa xuiin na.<verse eid="ISA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11"/>Nanara, n bɔɲɛn wugama Moyaba fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:11">N ma mawuga xuiin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:11">alo bɔlɔn xuina sununi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:11">N kutunma Kiri-Haresɛti taana fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12"/>Nxu Moyaba yamaan toma xadanɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">e suxure kide matexine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">e yi so e suxure banxine yi maxandi tideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">koni na tɔnɔ yo mi na.<verse eid="ISA 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13"/>Alatala bata yi na fala Moyaba kaane xili ma. <verse eid="ISA 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14"/>Iki Alatala naxa, “Benun ɲɛɛ saxan yatɛ xa dangu, Moyaba muxu gbeene nun a yama gbeen yarabima nɛn, fangatare dando gbansan yi lu e nii ra ne yɛ.”<verse eid="ISA 16:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17"/>
  <para style="s">Damasi nun Isirayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1"/>Waliyiya falana Damasi taan xili ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:1">Damasi taan kalamatɔɔn ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:1">a taa xɔnna yi lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:1">alo gɛmɛne e bode fari.<verse eid="ISA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2"/>Aroyeri yamanan taane luma nɛn nabeɲinxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">e findi xuruseene konna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">E luma nɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">muxu yo mi e yigbɛtɛnma.<verse eid="ISA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3"/>Taa makantan yin yo mi fa luma Efirami yamanani sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Mangayaan bama nɛn Damasi taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Arami yamanan muxu dɔnxɛn naxanye luma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">ne binyen mi danguɛ Isirayila kaane binyen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4"/>Nayi, na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:4">Yaxubaa binyen xurunma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:4">A yamaan yi lu doyenɲɛ.<verse eid="ISA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5"/>A luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">alo sansine na yelin malanɲɛ se xaba waxatini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">alo a xaba muxun na a tɔnsɔn xabaxine malan a yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">alo e na tɔnsɔnne makentun Refa lanbanni.<verse eid="ISA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6"/>A tɔnsɔn dɔnxɛna ndee luma nɛn a kentun daxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">alo oliwi bogine na rayolon tamin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">a xɔri firin saxan yi lu a kondeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">naanin suulun ɲɔxɔn yi lu a yii bogixine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">Alatalaa falan nan na ra, Isirayilaa Ala.<verse eid="ISA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:7">muxune yɛɛne luma e da mangan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:7">e yɛɛ rafindi Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin ma.<verse eid="ISA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8"/>E mi fa e yɛɛ rasigɛ suxure kidene yi mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:8">e naxanye rafalaxi e yiine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:8">E mi fa Asera kide gbindonne matoɛ mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:8">e nun e wusulan gandene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:8">e yɛtɛ yii fɔxɔne.<verse eid="ISA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9"/>Na lɔxɔni, e taa makantanxin naxanye rabeɲinma Isirayila kaane bun, ne birin yigenla luma nɛn alo fɔtɔnna hanma geyaan kondena.<verse eid="ISA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10"/>Amasɔtɔ i bata ɲinan Ala xɔn i rakisimana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">I mi i yengi dɔxi i kantan fanyen xɔn, i ya Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">Nanara, i bata nakɔɔn nafala a faɲin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">i yi sansi xɔɲɛne si.<verse eid="ISA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11"/>I e si lɔxɔn naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">hali e na soli na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">na xɔtɔnna yɛtɛni i ya si seen yi fuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">koni a xaba waxatin na a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">a lɔma ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">furen nun sɔxɔlɛ ɲantaren na fa lɔxɔn naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12"/>Ee! Siya wuyaxine sɔnxɔma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">alo fɔxɔ igen xuxu xuiin kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">Ee! Yamanane muxune xaɲɛma ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">alo baa ige gbeen na walanɲɛ ayi.<verse eid="ISA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13"/>Siyane sɔnxɔ xuiin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">alo fɔxɔ ige gbeen xuxu xuina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">Marigin na a kɔnkɔ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">e e gi, siga yire makuyeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">E kedima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">alo foyen na se dagin xali geyaan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">alo sɛxɛ xaren kala ti foyeni.<verse eid="ISA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14"/>Gaxu gbeen na a ra ɲinbanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">benun xɔtɔnni, e mi fa na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">Na nan na muxune sɔtɔma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">naxanye nxɔ seene birin tongoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">Na nan e sɔtɔma naxanye fuma nxu ma.<verse eid="ISA 17:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18"/>
  <para style="s">Falan Kusi yamanan xili ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1"/>Gbalon yamanan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:1">tuguminne gabutɛne xuiin gbo dɛnaxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:1">Kusi yamanan baane xun ma!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">18.1</char> <char style="fk">Kusi</char> yamanan yi Misiran yamanan nan faxa ra Nila baan dɛ fati fɔrɛne bɔxɔni.</note><verse eid="ISA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2"/>Mɛn kaane xɛrane rasigama baan xɔn kunkine kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">naxanye rafalaxi gbala xidine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">Ɛ siga ɛ konne yi ɛ tan xɛra sɔnɔyaxine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">Ɛ siga ɛ siyaan fɛma naxan muxuye kuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">e fatin mayilenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">naxan magaxu be nun yiren birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">siya sɛnbɛmani ito naxan nɔɔn tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">baane wuya naxan ma yamanayi.<verse eid="ISA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3"/>Ɛ tan dunuɲa muxune birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">ɛ tan naxanye bɔxɔ xɔnna fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">e na taxamasenni te geyaan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">ɛ a mato!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">Ɛ na xɔtaan fe xuiin mɛ waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">ɛ tuli mati!<verse eid="ISA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala bata a fala n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">a naxa, “N waxi feene rakɔrɔsi feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">n lu raxaraxi n dɔxɔdeni ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">alo wuyenna naxan minima yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">alo xiila wuyenna bɔxɔn ma kuye wolon waxatini.”<verse eid="ISA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5"/>Amasɔtɔ benun se xaba waxatin xa a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">fugene yolonma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">e yi findi tɔnsɔnne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">ne yi mɔ fɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">muxune yi e yii bogitarene xaba filɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">e nun e sonle nun e dɛɛne.<verse eid="ISA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6"/>Kusi kaane fan nabeɲinma na kii nin xɔline xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">geyane fari e nun burunna subene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">Sɛgɛne e yibɔma nɛn soge furen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">sube xaɲɛne fan yi e don ɲɛmɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7"/>Nayi, muxune fama nɛn finmaseene ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">keli siyaan fɛma naxan muxuye kuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">e fatin mayilenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">e magaxu be nun yiren birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">siya sɛnbɛmani ito naxan nɔɔn tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">baane wuya naxan ma yamanayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">E fama nɛn na finmaseene ra Siyon geyaan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna xinla binyama dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 18:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19"/>
  <para style="s">Falan Misiran yamanan xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1"/>Waliyiya falana Misiran yamanan xili ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">Alatala ni i ra, a fama kundani Misiran yi mafurɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">Misiran kaane suxurene xuruxurunma nɛn a yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">Misiran kaane yi tunnaxɔlɔ e ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2"/>Ala naxa, “N Misiran kaane radinma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">e bode xili ma nɛn, e yi e bode yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">birin yi keli a ngaxakedenmaan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">birin yi keli a xɔyin xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">taane yi keli e bode xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">mangayane yi keli mangayane xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3"/>Misiran kaane tunnaxɔlɔma e ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">n yi mayifuun bira e feene yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">E suxurene maxɔdinma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">e nun barinne nun yiimatone nun kɔɛramuxune.<verse eid="ISA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4"/>N Misiran sama nɛn kininkinintarena nde sagoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:4">manga yɛɛ xɔdɛxɛn yi lu a xun na.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:4">Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5"/>Nila baan xɔrima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:5">baan wunla yi xara fefe!<verse eid="ISA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6"/>Baane xirin yi mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:6">xudene yi xurun Misiran yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:6">e birin yi xara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:6">Gbalane lisima a ra nɛn,<verse eid="ISA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7"/>sɛxɛne yi xara Nila baan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">han a biradena fɔxɔ igen ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">Xɛɛn naxanye bixi Nila baan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">ne xarama ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">foyen yi siga e ra, sese mi fa luma.<verse eid="ISA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8"/>Yɛxɛ suxune kutunma nɛn, e sunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:8">naxanye birin kɔnna birama Nila baani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:8">Yala wonle fan sɛnbɛn yi ɲan.<verse eid="ISA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9"/>Naxanye gɛsɛne wurundunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:9">ne yagima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:9">Naxanye dugine rafalama e nun naxanye e sɔxɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:9">ne yigitɛgɛma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10"/>Yamanan muxu kɛndɛne fangan ɲanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:10">walikɛne yi kɔntɔfili.<verse eid="ISA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11"/>Xaxilitaren nan Soyan taan kuntigine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">Misiran mangan kawandi muxune</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">a kawandima xaxilitareyaan nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">e naxa, “Fekolonna nde nan ma dii n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">a singe ra mangane diina nde.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">E nɔɛ susɛ na falɛ mangan xa di?<verse eid="ISA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12"/>Nayi, Misiran mangana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">i ya xaxilimane minɛn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna naxan nagidixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">lan i ya yamanan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">e xa i xaran na ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13"/>Xaxilitaren nan Soyan taan kuntigine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">Nofi taan mangane tantanma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">Misiran yamana kanne nan a ralɔma ayi.<verse eid="ISA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14"/>Alatala bata niina nde raso e yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">naxan e xun magima e ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">alogo Misiran kaane xa tantan e feen birin yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">alo dɔlɔ minna na dingenɲɛ ayi baxundeni.<verse eid="ISA 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15"/>Misiran muxu gbeen nun a muxudina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">muxu yo mi fa sese ligama naxan fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">a na findi muxu binyen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">hanma a binyetarena.<verse eid="ISA 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Misiran yamanan naɲanna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16"/>Na lɔxɔni, Misiran kaane luma nɛn alo ɲaxanle. E xuruxurunma nɛn gaxuni, Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna na a yiini te e xili ma waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="ISA 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17"/>Yuda yamanana fe findima fe magaxuxin nan na Misiran kaane xa. Muxune na a fe fala e yɛɛ xɔri, e gaxuma nɛn na feen yɛɛ ra Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna bata naxan nagidi e ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18"/>Na lɔxɔni, Heburu xuiin fama nɛn faladeni Misiran taa suulunna ndee yi, e muxune yi e kɔlɔ a e bata findi Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna gbeen na. Na taan keden xili bama nɛn a Taa Halagixina.<verse eid="ISA 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19"/>Na lɔxɔni, saraxa ganden fama nɛn ludeni Alatala xa Misiran yamanan tagini, gɛmɛ gbeena nde yi dɔxɔ yamanan danna ra naxan Alatalaa fe rabirama muxune ma. <verse eid="ISA 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20"/>Na nan findima taxamasenna nun seren na fa fala Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna Misiran yi. Misiran kaane na e xui ramini Alatala ma e ɲaxankata muxune fe ra waxatin naxan yi, a Marakisi Tiin nafama nɛn e ma, naxan e xun mayɛngɛma a yi e xunba. <verse eid="ISA 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21"/>Alatala a yɛtɛ yitama nɛn Misiran kaane ra. Na lɔxɔni, Misiran kaane Alatala kolonma nɛn. E yi a batu, e saraxane nun bogise saraxane ba a xa. E yi dɛ xuine tongo Alatala xa, e yi e rakamali. <verse eid="ISA 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22"/>Alatala Misiran kaane ɲaxankatama nɛn fitina fena nde xɔn, koni a e yiyalanma nɛn, e yi xɛtɛ Alatala ma, a yi e maxandi xuiin namɛ, a yi e yiyalan.<verse eid="ISA 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23"/>Na lɔxɔni, kiraan kelima nɛn Misiran yi siga Asiriya yamanani. Asiriya kaane sigama nɛn Misiran yi, Misiran kaane yi siga Asiriya yi. E birin yi Ala batu e bode xɔn. <verse eid="ISA 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24"/>Na lɔxɔni, Isirayila findima nɛn Misiran nun Asiriya yamanane saxanden na dunuɲa duban sɔtɔma naxanye xɔn. <verse eid="ISA 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna dubama nɛn e xa, a naxa, “N bata barakan sa n ma yamaan Misiran ma fe yi, e nun Asiriya yamanana, n yii fɔxɔna e nun Isirayila, n ma bɔxɔna.”<verse eid="ISA 19:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20"/>
  <para style="s">Falan Misiran nun Kusi xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1"/>Asiriya mangan Sarigon a sofa kuntigin nasiga ɲɛɛn naxan na Asadodi taan xili ma Filisiti yamanani, a yi a yɛngɛ, a yi a tongo, <verse eid="ISA 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2"/>na waxatin yɛtɛni, Alatala yi falan ti Esayi xa Amɔsi a dii xɛmɛna, a naxa, “Sunu dugin naxan xidixi i tagi, na ba, i yi i ya sankidine ba.” Esayi yi a falan suxu, a magenla yi lu sigan tiyɛ, sankidi mi a sanni.<verse eid="ISA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3"/>Alatala mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “A ɲɛɛ saxanna ni i ra n ma walikɛna Esayi sigan tima a magenla, sankidi mi a sanni. Taxamasenna nan na ra e nun marakolonna Misiran yamanan nun Kusi yamanan xa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">20.3</char> <char style="fk">Kusi</char> yamanan yi Misiran yamanan nan faxa ra Nila baan dɛ fati fɔrɛne bɔxɔni.</note> <verse eid="ISA 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4"/>fa fala Asiriya mangan Misiran kaane nun Kusi kaane suxuma nɛn yɛngɛni, a e xali konyiyani. A dii ɲɔrɛne nun fonne magenle nan xalima, sankidi mi e sanni, e xɔrɛ magenle yi findi yagin na e xa. <verse eid="ISA 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5"/>Nayi, muxun naxanye e yigi saxi Kusi yi hanma naxanye yi Misiran matɔxɔma, ne gaxuma nɛn, e yagi. <verse eid="ISA 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6"/>Na lɔxɔni, muxun naxanye dɔxi fɔxɔ igen dɛ, ne a falama nɛn, e naxa, ‘Nxu yi yigi saxi naxanye fari, a mato naxan ligama ne ra. Nxu yi waxi siga feni nxu luxundeni e konni, alogo nxu xa maliin sɔtɔ, nxu yi xunba Asiriya mangan ma. Nayi, nxu fa nɔɛ kisɛ di?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 20:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21"/>
  <para style="s">Falan Babilɔn yamanan xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1"/>Waliyiya falan ni i ra tonbonna xili ma fɔxɔ igen dɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">21.1</char> <char style="fk">Tonbonna:</char> A Babilɔn nan ma fe falama na ra.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">Yaxun fama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">sa keli tonbonni yamana magaxuxini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">alo kala ti foyen nɛma fɛ yiifari ma tonbonna makɔɛ.<verse eid="ISA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2"/>Ala bata fe magaxuxin yita n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Yanfantenna bata keli yanfa sodeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Halagi tiin bata halagin ti fɔlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Elan kaane, ɛ siga yɛngɛni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Mede kaane ɛ taan nabilin!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">21.2</char> <char style="fk">Elan kaane nun Mede kaane</char> yi Babilɔn kaane xɔyine nan na benun e xa e yɛngɛ, e yi e nɔ.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Muxune yi kutunma e bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">koni n fa danna sama nɛn na ma!<verse eid="ISA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3"/>Nanara, n tagin xuruxurunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">N ɲaxankataxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">alo ɲaxanla tinna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">N naxan mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">na bata n gaxu ki faɲi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">N naxan toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">na bata n kɔntɔfili.<verse eid="ISA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4"/>Wɛkilɛ mi fa n yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">n xuruxurunma gaxuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">N yi ɲinbanna nan mamɛma nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">alogo n xa bɔɲɛ xunbeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">koni kɔɛɛn fan bata magaxu ayi.<verse eid="ISA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5"/>Donseen bata rafala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">dagine bata yisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">muxune dɔxi e dɛgedeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">e minma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">Kuntigine, ɛ keli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">Ɛ yɛngɛ so seene yitɔn.<verse eid="ISA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6"/>Marigina ito nan falaxi n xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:6">“Sa kantan tina nde ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:6">a na naxan to, a na fala i xa.<verse eid="ISA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7"/>Xa a yɛngɛ so wontorone to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">soone naxanye bandunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">soo ragine dɔxi sofanle fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">ndee fan dɔxi ɲɔgɔmɛne fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">a xa a liga a yeren ma ki faɲi.”<verse eid="ISA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8"/>Kantan tiin xa sɔnxɔ, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:8">“N Marigina, n tixi yinna xuntagi fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:8">N nan n ma kantan tideni kɔɛna ngaan na.<verse eid="ISA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9"/>Ɛ a mato, xɛmɛna nde fama yɛngɛ so wontoron kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">soo firin naxan bandunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">Na yi a xuini te, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">‘Babilɔn taan bata kala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">A bata kala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">E ala sawurane birin bata bira</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">e xuya ayi bɔxɔni.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10"/>N ma yamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">ɛ tan naxan bata bɔnbɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">alo murutun lonna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">n na nan mɛxi Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ra, Isirayilaa Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">n yi a rali ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Falana Edɔn yamanan xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11"/>Waliyiya falan ni i ra Duma taan xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">Xuina nde minima Seyiri yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">a naxa, “Kantan tina, kɔɛɛn di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">Kantan tina kɔɛɛn di?”<verse eid="ISA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12"/>Kantan tiin yi a yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">a naxa, “Xɔtɔnna a lima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">kɔɛɛn fan yi so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">Xa i mɔn waxi maxɔdinna ti feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">maxɔdinna ti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">Waxati gbɛtɛ, i mɔn yi fa.”<verse eid="ISA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa falana Arabi xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13"/>Waliyiya falan ni i ra Arabi yamanan xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:13">Ɛ xima nɛn Arabi burunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:13">Dedan bɔnsɔnna, sigatiine tonbonni.<verse eid="ISA 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14"/>Ɛ tan Tema kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:14">ɛ sa fa igen na muxune xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:14">min xɔnla naxanye ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:14">ɛ fa balon na muxu gixine xa.<verse eid="ISA 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15"/>Muxune bata e gi silanfanna bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:15">silanfanne yi texi e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:15">xanle bandunxi e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:15">e gixi yɛngɛn gbalon bun.<verse eid="ISA 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16"/>Marigina ito nan falaxi n xa, a naxa, “Benun ɲɛɛ keden yatɛ, Kedari bɔnsɔnna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">21.16</char> <char style="fk">Kedari</char> findixi Sumayilaa diin nan na. Na feen sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 25.13 kui.</note> binyen birin ɲanma nɛn. <verse eid="ISA 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17"/>Muxu wuyaxi mi fa luma e nii ra e xali wonle yɛ, Kedari yɛngɛsone.” Alatala, Isirayilaa Ala nan na falaxi.<verse eid="ISA 21:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn taana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1"/>Waliyiya falan ni i ra Lankɛnɛmaya Lanbanna xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:1">Yerusalɛn kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:1">nanfera ɛ tema banxine xuntagi?<verse eid="ISA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2"/>Nanfera sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔn bata keli ɛ taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">a yimaxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">sumunna taan naxan yi yɛyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">Ɛ faxa muxune mi faxaxi silanfanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">e mi faxaxi yɛngɛni.<verse eid="ISA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3"/>Ɛ kuntigine birin bata e gi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">xalimakuli wonle yi e findi kasorasane ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">Ɛ muxune birin bata yi e gi yaxune yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">e yi e birin suxu, e yi e xali.<verse eid="ISA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4"/>Nanara, n yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">“Ɛ yɛɛn ba n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">ɛ n lu na, n xa wuga xɔlɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">N ma yamaan bata kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">koni hali ɛ mi kata n masabarideni.”<verse eid="ISA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5"/>Amasɔtɔ to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">bata magaxun nun mantɔrɔn nun mayibasanna rafa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">en ma Lankɛnɛmaya Lanbanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">Taan nabilinna yinna bata kala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">Xili ti xuiin minima malina fe ra geyaan ma.<verse eid="ISA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6"/>Elan yamanan ganle bata xalimakunle tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:6">e nun yɛngɛ so wontorone nun soone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:6">Kiri yamanan sofane e yɛ masansan wure lefane yitɔnma.<verse eid="ISA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7"/>Ɛ mɛrɛmɛrɛn faɲine bata rafe yɛngɛ so wontorone ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:7">soo ragine yitɔnxi e xa yɛngɛn fɔlɔ ɛ taan so dɛɛne ra.<verse eid="ISA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8"/>Yuda yamanan mi fa makantanxi sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 22:8"/>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:8">Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:8">i yɛɛ raxɛtɛma nɛn yɛngɛ so seene ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:8">banxini naxan xili “Fɔtɔn Yi Banxina.”<verse eid="ISA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9"/>Ɛ yi yalenne to Dawudaa Taan makantan yinna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:9">ɛ yi igen namara ige ramarade xurini yɛngɛn yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10"/>Ɛ Yerusalɛn taan banxine yatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:10">ɛ ndee rabira</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:10">alogo ɛ xa makantan yinna sɛnbɛ so.<verse eid="ISA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11"/>Ɛ yi ige ramaraden nafala yin firinne longonna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">ige ramarade fonna igen xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">Koni naxan na feene birin xunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">ɛ mi ɛ yɛɛ rafindixi na ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">A yi e yitɔnma to mi na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">koni ɛ mi yi na kanna toma.<verse eid="ISA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12"/>Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:12">a falaxi na lɔxɔn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:12">a ɛ xa wuga, ɛ gbelegbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:12">ɛ yi ɛ xunne bi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:12">ɛ yi kasa bɛnbɛli dugine so sununi.<verse eid="ISA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13"/>Anu, sɛwan nun ɲaxaɲaxan nan be iki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">Muxune ɲingene kɔɛ raxabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">e yɛxɛɛne faxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">e suben donma, e manpaan minma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">Ɛ a falama, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">“En na en dɛge, en yi en min,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">bayo en faxan nɛn tila!”<verse eid="ISA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14"/>N tunla Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falani ito nan mɛxi, a naxa, “Ɛ hakɛni ito mi xafarima han ɛ faxa!” Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna na nan falaxi.<verse eid="ISA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marakolonna lan Sebena fe ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15"/>Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “Siga, i sa mangana muxuni ito li, Sebena, naxan manga banxina feene xun na, i yi a fala a xa, i naxa,<verse eid="ISA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16"/>‘Nanse i xa be?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:16">I ya muxun mundun be,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:16">i to gaburun gema i yɛtɛ xa be?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:16">I matabude dɔnxɛn nafalama i yɛtɛ xa geyaan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:16">i gaburun ge i yɛtɛ xa fanyeni!<verse eid="ISA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17"/>I tan sɛnbɛmana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:17">Alatala i wolima ayi nɛn pon!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:17">A yi i suxu ken,<verse eid="ISA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18"/>a yi siga i mafilinfilinɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">alo se radigilinxina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">a i woli yamana gbeeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">I sa faxama mɛnna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">ɛ nun i ya wontoro faɲine yi lu na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">i tan naxan i kanna denbayaan nayagima!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19"/>Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:19">“N ni i kedima nɛn i ya walideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:19">n yi i ba i tideni.<verse eid="ISA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:20">n nan n ma walikɛna Eliyakimi xilima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:20">Xiliki a dii xɛmɛna.<verse eid="ISA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21"/>N ni i ya dugine ragodo a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:21">n ni i ya tagi xidin xidi a tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:21">n ni i sɛnbɛn so a yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:21">A findima nɛn Yerusalɛn kaane fafe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:21">Yuda yamaan birin yɛ.<verse eid="ISA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22"/>N Dawudaa manga banxin dɛɲinna soma nɛn a yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:22">A na naxan nabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:22">muxu yo mi nɔɛ a balanɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:22">A na naxan balan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:22">muxu yo mi nɔɛ a rabiyɛ.<verse eid="ISA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23"/>N na a bitinma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:23">alo bitin wudina yire kɛndɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:23">a yi binyen fi a fafe a denbayaan ma.<verse eid="ISA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24"/>A denbayaan muxu binyene birin luma nɛn singanxi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:24">alo wudi yiin singanxi a binla ra kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:24">alo goron xunxurine nun baramane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:24">nun ige sa seene dɔxɔma e bode fari kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="ISA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan ni ito ra, a naxa, “Na lɔxɔni, gbangban wudin talama nɛn naxan yi bitinxi yire kɛndɛni. A kalama nɛn, a yi bira. Nayi, goronna naxan yi singanxi a ra, na yi halagi.” Alatala na nan falaxi.<verse eid="ISA 22:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23"/>
  <para style="s">Tire nun Sidɔn halagi fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1"/>Waliyiya falana Tire taan xili ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">Ɛ tan Tarasisi kaan naxanye kunkine kui fɔxɔ igen xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">ɛ gbelegbele sununi amasɔtɔ Tire taan bata kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">banxi yo mi fa na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">kunki tide mi fa na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">E bata na xibarun mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">fata Sipiri fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔn na.<verse eid="ISA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2"/>Ɛ dundu, ɛ tan naxanye dɔxi fɔxɔ igen dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:2">ɛ tan naxanye bata fɔxɔ igeni siga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:2">ɛ Sidɔn taan yulane findi nafulu kanne ra.<verse eid="ISA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3"/>Sansiin naxanye yi bima baan dɛ Sihori yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">fɔxɔ igen kidi ma pon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">e fa ne ra e taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">Sansiin naxanye yi xabama Nila baan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">ne yi findixi Sidɔn taan tɔnɔn nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">Na yamanan bata yi findi siyane lɔxɔ tiden na.<verse eid="ISA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4"/>Sidɔn kaane, ɛ yagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">baan xɔn yire makantanxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">Bayo fɔxɔ igen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">23.4</char> <char style="fk">Fɔxɔ igen</char> yi findixi Sidɔn kaane gbee ala ɲaxalanmana nde nan na.</note> bata a mɛ ɛ ra, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">“N mi dii barin tɔrɔyane sɔtɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">n mi dii barixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">N mi dii xɛmɛye ragboxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">n mi dii tɛmɛ maxuruxi.”<verse eid="ISA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5"/>Xibaruni ito na Misiran yamanan li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:5">e yigitɛgɛma nɛn Tire taana fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6"/>Ɛ fɔxɔ igeni gidi han Tarasisi taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:6">ɛ gbelegbele sununi ɛ tan fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔ yidɔxɔne.<verse eid="ISA 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7"/>Ɛ ɲaxaɲaxa taan nan ito ra ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">naxan masɛgɛ xabu waxati xunkuyene yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">naxan muxuye bata yi siga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">e sa dɔxɔ yire makuyene yi?<verse eid="ISA 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8"/>Nayi, nde na feen nataxi Tire taan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">naxan yi mangayane yitaxunma yamanane yi nun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">Kuntigin nan yi a yulane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">xili kan gbeene dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="ISA 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan na ragidixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">alogo a xa ne fe magodo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">naxanye wasoxi e tofanna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">alogo a xa bɔxɔn muxu yitexine rayagi.<verse eid="ISA 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10"/>Nayi, Tarasisi kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:10">ɛ bɔxɔn bi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:10">alo e a ligama Nila baan dɛ kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:10">amasɔtɔ kunki tide mi fa na ɛ kunkine xa.<verse eid="ISA 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11"/>Alatala bata a yiini te baan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">a bata yamanane yimaxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">A bata yamarin fi Kanan yamanan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">a taa makantanxine xa kala.<verse eid="ISA 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12"/>A bata a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">“Ɛ tan Sidɔn kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">ɛ sumunna bata ɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">Yaxune bata fu ɛ taa tofaɲin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">Keli, ɛ fɔxɔ igeni gidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">siga Sipiri fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">Hali na, matabu yo mi ɛ xa.”<verse eid="ISA 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13"/>Babilɔn yamanan mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">yamaan naxan mi yi sese ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">Asiriya kaane bata yi naxan findi burunna subene gbeen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">E e sanganso makantanxine ti nɛn a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">e yi a banxine kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">a findi taa xɔnna ra.<verse eid="ISA 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14"/>Ɛ tan Tarasisi kaan naxanye kunkine kui fɔxɔ igen xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:14">ɛ gbelegbele sununi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:14">amasɔtɔ ɛ yire makantanxin bata kala.<verse eid="ISA 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15"/>Na waxatini, ɲinan tima nɛn Tire taan xɔn ɲɛɛ tonge solofere, na lanxi mangana nde nan ma siimaya ma. A ligama Tire taan na nɛn alo a liga yalunden na kii naxan yi sigini ito yi, a naxa,<verse eid="ISA 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16"/>Bɔlɔnna tongo, i a maxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">i sigi wuyaxi sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">i taani siga i tan ɲaxalan maɲinanxina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">alogo i ya fe xa rabira muxune ma.<verse eid="ISA 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17"/>Ɲɛɛ tonge solofere na dangu, Alatala Tire taana fe ragidima nɛn. A mɔn yi a saran haramuxin sɔtɔ fɔlɔ, a yalunyaan naba bɔxɔ xɔnna yamanane birin xɔn. <verse eid="ISA 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18"/>Koni a sɔtɔ seen nun a saren haramuxin luma Alatala nan xa. E mi malanma, e mi ramarama. E soma muxune nan yii naxanye luma Alatala yɛtagi alogo e xa balo gbeen nun marabɛri ba faɲin sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 23:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24"/>
  <para style="s">Alatala bɔxɔn birin halagima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1"/>Alatala bɔxɔn birin halagima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:1">a yi a raxɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:1">A bɔxɔ xɔnna kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:1">a yi a muxune birin naxuya ayi.<verse eid="ISA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2"/>Na maraɲan ki kedenna nan saraxaraliin nun a yamaan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">e nun kuntigin nun a walikɛɛn xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">e nun banxi kanna nun a walikɛ ɲaxanla xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">e nun sare matiin nun sare soon xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">e nun doli tongo nun doli soon xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">e nun donla naxan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">e nun seen soma naxan yii.<verse eid="ISA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3"/>Bɔxɔ xɔnna kalama nɛn fefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:3">a yigenla yi lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:3">amasɔtɔ Alatala bata na fala.<verse eid="ISA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4"/>Bɔxɔn sunuxi, a xaraxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:4">Dunuɲa sigama kalɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:4">a muxu gbeene fan yi doyen.<verse eid="ISA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5"/>Adamadiine bata bɔxɔ xɔnna raharamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">E mi Alaa sariyane suxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">e yi a tɔnne beɲin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">E bata habadan layirin kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">e nun Ala tagi.<verse eid="ISA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6"/>Nanara, Alaa dangan bata bɔxɔ xɔnna suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">a muxune yi e yulubin yanginna sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">A muxune ganma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">e wuyaxi mi lu.<verse eid="ISA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7"/>Manpa nɛnɛn bata xara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:7">manpa binle yi lisi a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:7">Naxanye bɔɲɛ yi sɛwaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:7">ne wugama.<verse eid="ISA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8"/>Sɛwan tanban xuine bata dan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:8">ɲaxaɲaxa xuine bata ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:8">sɛwan bɔlɔn xuine bata dan.<verse eid="ISA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9"/>Muxune mi fa manpaan minma sigini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:9">Manpane bata xɔlɔ ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:9">e min muxune dɛ.<verse eid="ISA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10"/>Taa rabeɲinxin bata kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:10">Banxine birin nagalixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:10">muxu yo mi fa nɔɛ soɛ.<verse eid="ISA 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11"/>Muxune gbelegbelema manpa feen na kirane xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:11">Sɛwan bata findi bɔɲɛ rafɔrɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:11">Ɲaxaɲaxan bata ɲan yamanani.<verse eid="ISA 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12"/>Banxi xɔnne nan tun fa luxi taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:12">taan so dɛɛn bata kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:12">a biraxin yi lu na.<verse eid="ISA 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13"/>A ligama na kii nin bɔxɔni siyane tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">se wuyaxi mi luma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">alo oliwi bogine na yelin malanɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">alo manpa binle xɔri bolon waxatini.<verse eid="ISA 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa muxune ɲaxanma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14"/>Naxanye luxi e nii ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:14">ne e xuini tema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:14">e sɔnxɔ sɛwani e Alatalaa binyen nali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:14">E gbelegbelema ɲaxaɲaxani keli sogegododen binni.<verse eid="ISA 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15"/>E naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">“Sogeteden binna yamanane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">ɛ Alatala binya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">Ɛ Alatala xinla tantun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">Isirayilaa Ala!”<verse eid="ISA 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16"/>Nxu bɛti xuine mɛma nɛn bɔxɔn danne birin yi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">“Binyena Ala tinxinxin xa!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Koni n tan naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">“N bata lɔ ayi, n bata lɔ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">gbalona n xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Yanfantenne yanfan soma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Yanfana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Yanfantenne yanfan soma!”<verse eid="ISA 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17"/>Gaxun nun yili gbeen nun luti ratixine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:17">ɛ tan bɔxɔ xɔnna muxune yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18"/>Naxan na a gi gbelegbele xuiin bun gaxuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">na yi sin yinla ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">Xa naxan te yinla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">na yi a suxu lutin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">Kore xɔnna dɛɛne birin nabima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">tulen yi fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">bɔxɔ xɔnna bunne birin yi xuruxurun.<verse eid="ISA 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19"/>Bɔxɔ xɔnni bɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:19">a xuya ayi, a yolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:19">bɔxɔn bata yimaxa fefe!<verse eid="ISA 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20"/>Bɔxɔn dingenma ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">alo dɔlɔ minna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">a tintin alo gagen foye gbeen bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">A bira a Ala matandine goronna bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">a mi fa nɔɛ kelɛ.<verse eid="ISA 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:21">Alatala sɛnbɛma ganla saranma e kɛwanle ra nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:21">naxanye bɔxɔn nun kuyen lan tagini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:21">e nun bɔxɔ xɔnni ito mangane.<verse eid="ISA 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22"/>E malanma nɛn yili gbeen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">alo kasorasane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">E balan kasoon na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">Waxati xunkuye na dangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">e fa e dɛntɛgɛ.<verse eid="ISA 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23"/>Kiken nun sogen yagima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">Amasɔtɔ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">findima nɛn mangan na Yerusalɛn yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">Siyon geyaan fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">A binyen yi makɛnɛn taan fonne birin yɛtagi.<verse eid="ISA 24:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25"/>
  <para style="s">Wali faɲi kolon bɛtina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1"/>Alatala! N ma Ala ni i ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">N ni i tantunma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">n yi i xinla binya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">I bata i ya kabanako feene rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">i naxanye ragidixi i ya tinxinyani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">xabu to mi na ra.<verse eid="ISA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2"/>I bata taan lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">alo gɛmɛ malanxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">i bata taa makantanxin findi taa xɔnna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">Taa mi fa xɔɲɛne taa fangamaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">a mi fa tima sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3"/>Nanara, yama sɛnbɛmane i binyama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:3">siya gbalotɔne taane yi gaxu i yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4"/>Luxunden nan i tan na yiigelitɔne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">sɛnbɛtarene luxundena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">e na bira lanbaranni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">e nun yigiyadena tule gbeen bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">e nun nininna soge xɔlɛn bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">Muxu ɲaxine xɔlɔn luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">alo tule foye gbeen na dɔxɔ sansanni,<verse eid="ISA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5"/>alo sogen wuyenna tonbonna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">I xɔɲɛne sɔnxɔ xuiin danma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">alo kundaan nininna wuyenni suxuma kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">i gbalotɔne nɔ sɔtɔ sigin danma na kii nin.<verse eid="ISA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛwa bandena siyane birin xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ɲaxaɲaxani tɔnma geyani ito fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:6">a lu alo sube turaxi donna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:6">nun manpa faɲi minna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:6">suben nun manpa fisamantenne yɛtɛna.<verse eid="ISA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7"/>Geyani ito fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:7">a sunu dugin bama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:7">yamanane muxune birin yɛtagin xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:7">e nun kasangenna naxan siyane birin ma.<verse eid="ISA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8"/>A sayaan halagima nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">Marigina Alatala yi muxune birin yɛɛgen fitan e yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">A yi yagin ba a yamani bɔxɔn yiren birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">Alatala nan na falaxi.<verse eid="ISA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moyaba yamanan kalana fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9"/>Na lɔxɔni, e a falama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">e naxa, “En ma Ala ni i ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">En na en xaxili tixi a tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">a yi en nakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">Alatala ni i ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">En xaxili tixi a tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">En ɲaxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">en sɛwa a marakisina fe ra!”<verse eid="ISA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10"/>Alatala bata a yengi lu geyani ito xɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:10">Anu, Moyaba yamanan bata kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:10">alo sɛxɛn naxan yibodonxi ɲɛɲɛ yinla ra.<verse eid="ISA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11"/>Mɛn kaane yiine yitexi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:11">alo muxun naxan a bama igeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:11">Koni hali e to kataxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:11">Marigina e ragodoma nɛn e wasoni.<verse eid="ISA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12"/>Moyaba kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:12">Marigina ɛ yamanan makantan yinne rabirama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:12">a e rabirama nɛn bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:12">a yi e findi burunburunna ra.<verse eid="ISA 25:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26"/>
  <para style="s">Ala tantun bɛtina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1"/>Na lɔxɔni, Yuda yamanan muxune bɛtin bama nɛn, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">“Nxu bata taa makantanxi faɲin sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">Ala bata a rabilin marakisin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">alo yinna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">a xa nxu makantan.<verse eid="ISA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2"/>Ɛ taan so dɛɛne rabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:2">yama tinxinxin xa so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:2">naxanye luxi tɔgɔndiyani.<verse eid="ISA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3"/>Naxanye yugon fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:3">i tan Ala nan bɔɲɛ xunbeli kɛndɛn nagidima ne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:3">amasɔtɔ e yigi saxi i tan nin.<verse eid="ISA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4"/>Ɛ yigi sa Alatala yi habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:4">bayo Alatala nan ɛ habadan kantan fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:4">ɛ Alatala.<verse eid="ISA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5"/>Muxun naxanye dɔxi yire matexini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">a ne ragodoma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">a yi e taa matexin kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">a yi a halagi bɔxɔ xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">a a findi burunburunna ra.<verse eid="ISA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6"/>Sɛnbɛtarene a yibodonma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:6">a lu yiigelitɔne san tidene bun.”<verse eid="ISA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7"/>Tinxin muxuna kiraan tinxin nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:7">I tan Ala faɲin kiraan malaxunma nɛn tinxin muxun xa.<verse eid="ISA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8"/>Alatala, nxu xaxili tixi i tan nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:8">i ya kiti saxine kiraan xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:8">Nxu niin makoon naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:8">nxu lu i xinla falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:8">nxu lu nxu mirɛ i ma.<verse eid="ISA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9"/>I xɔnla n niin yɛtɛɛn suxuma kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">n ni i fenma n sɔndɔmɛn birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">I na kiti kɛndɛn sa bɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">dunuɲa muxune yi tinxinyaan kolon.<verse eid="ISA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10"/>Xa i hinan muxu ɲaxine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">e mi tinxinyaan kolonɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">Hali yamana faɲini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">e tinxintareyaan nan nabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">e mi Alatalaa gboon toma.<verse eid="ISA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11"/>Alatala, i yiini texi e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">koni e mi a toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">Anu, e i ya xanuntenya gbeen toma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">i ya yamaan xa, e yi yagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">Tɛɛn naxan i yaxune raxɔrima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">na xa e gan.<verse eid="ISA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12"/>Alatala i bɔɲɛ xunbenla fima nxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:12">i tan nan nxɔ feene birin nakamalima nxu xa.<verse eid="ISA 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13"/>Alatala, nxɔ Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">kari gbɛtɛne nxu nɔ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">naxanye mi findixi i tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">koni nxu i tan nan keden pe xili binyama.<verse eid="ISA 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14"/>Ne bata faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">e mi fa xɛtɛma sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">E bata findi yiyane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">e mi fa kelima sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">I bata e kɛwanle saran e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">i yi e halagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">i yi e funfun birin naxɔri.<verse eid="ISA 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15"/>Alatala, i bata nxɔ bɔxɔn fari sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">i bata a fari sa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">I bata i ya binyen mayita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">i yi yamanan danne masiga.<verse eid="ISA 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16"/>Alatala, muxune e yɛɛ rafindima i tan nan ma tɔrɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:16">I na e xuru mantɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:16">e yi xɛtɛ i xandɛ e dɛ bun.<verse eid="ISA 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17"/>Alatala, nxu lu nɛn i yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:17">alo ɲaxanla nɛma wugama sɔxɔlɛni tinna ma.<verse eid="ISA 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18"/>Nxu fan na sɔxɔlɛn sifan sɔtɔxi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">nxu wuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">koni nxu foyen nan tun barixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">Nxu mi kisin fixi bɔxɔ xɔnna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">nxu mi muxu nɛnɛne raminixi dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="ISA 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faxa muxune kelima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19"/>Ɛ faxa muxune niin birama e yi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">e yi keli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">Ɛ tan naxanye saxi burunburunni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">ɛ xulun, ɛ sɔnxɔ sɛwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">Marigina, i xiila rafama bɔxɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">alo kɛnɛnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">faxa muxune yi keli gaburun na.<verse eid="ISA 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20"/>N ma yamana, ɛ so ɛ konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">ɛ dɛɛn balan ɛ fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">Ɛ luxun waxatidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">han Alaa xɔlɔn yi dangu.<verse eid="ISA 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan minima a dɔxɔdeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">a yi bɔxɔn muxune hakɛne saran e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">Bɔxɔ xɔnna muxu faxaxine wunla makɛnɛnma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">a yi ba muxune wunla luxunɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">naxanye faxaxi a fari.<verse eid="ISA 26:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27"/>
  <para style="s">Nɔ sɔtɔna ige yi sube ɲaxin fari</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1"/>Na lɔxɔni, Alatala a silanfan wure xɔdɛxɛn tongoma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">naxan gbo, a sɛnbɛn gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">a yi keli ige yi sube ɲaxin xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">ige yi sube ɲaxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">saɲin naxan a gima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">ige yi sube ɲaxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">saɲi tinxintarena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">A yi fɔxɔ ige yi ninginanga gbeen faxa.<verse eid="ISA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marigin nun a nakɔna fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2"/>Ɛ manpa bili nakɔɔn matɔxɔma nɛn sigini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:2">na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:2">naxan bogiye ɲaxun han!<verse eid="ISA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3"/>“N tan, Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">n tan nan manpa bili nakɔni ito kantan muxun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">N na a ige sama nɛn waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">n yi a kantan kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">alogo muxu yo nama fe ɲaxin liga a ra.<verse eid="ISA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4"/>N mi fa xɔlɔxi a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">Koni xa n tansinne nun ɲanle li na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">n na e yɛngɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">n yi e gan.<verse eid="ISA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5"/>Koni xa naxan a yigiyaden fen n tan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:5">na kanna xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla raso nxu nun a tan tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:5">a xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla yatin naso nxu nun a tan tagi!”<verse eid="ISA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala fama nɛn a yamaan mafeludeni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6"/>Waxati famatɔne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">Yaxubaa yamana a salenne raminima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">Isirayila bɔnsɔnna yi a sonle nun a fugene ramini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">A dunuɲa rafe a bogine ra.<verse eid="ISA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7"/>Ala a yamaan bɔnbɔxi nɛn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">alo a e bɔnbɔ muxune bɔnbɔxi kii naxan yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">A a yamaan faxaxi nɛn ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">alo a na kanne faxa kii naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">naxanye yi e faxama nun?<verse eid="ISA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8"/>Ɛn-ɛn de, koni a e makitixi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:8">a yi e kedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:8">a siga e ra konyiyani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:8">A e kedi a kala ti foyen nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:8">alo sogeteden foye gbeena.<verse eid="ISA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9"/>Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna hakɛn mafeluma ikii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">ito nan Isirayila bɔnsɔnna yulubi xafarin mayitama:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">e na e kide saraxa gandene birin findi burunburunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">e Asera kide gbindonne nun wusulan gandene ba tixi.<verse eid="ISA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10"/>Muxu yo mi fa luma taa makantanxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">A luma nɛn nabeɲinxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">alo tonbonna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">Ɲinge diine yi fa e dɛ madondeni a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">e yi na findi e matabuden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">E yi a wudi ɲingine madon.<verse eid="ISA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11"/>Wudi yiine na xara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">e girama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">ɲaxanle yi e gan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">Amasɔtɔ yama xaxilitaren nan ito ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">Nanara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">e da mangan mi fa kininkininma e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">Ala naxan e daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">na mi hinanma e ra.<verse eid="ISA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila suxu muxune xɛtɛ fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:12">Alatala a sansi xabaxine bɔnbɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:12">keli Efirati baan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:12">han sa dɔxɔ Misiran xuden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:12">ɛ birin yi malan keden keden yɛɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:12">ɛ tan Isirayila kaane.<verse eid="ISA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:13">xɔta xui gbeen minima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:13">Muxun naxanye lɔxi ayi Asiriya yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:13">e nun naxanye kedi Misiran yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:13">ne birin fama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:13">e fa Alatala batu geya sariɲanxin fari Yerusalɛn yi.<verse eid="ISA 27:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28"/>
  <para style="s">Gbalon Samari kaane xili ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1"/>Gbalon Samari taan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">naxan maligaxi manga kɔmɔtin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">naxan findixi Efirami yamanan dɔlɔ minne xunna kenla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">naxanye nɔrɔn luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">alo se fugen yolonmatɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">taan naxan mɛrɛmɛrɛ ɲingixin xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">dɔlɔn bata naxan muxuye kala.<verse eid="ISA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2"/>A mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">Marigina walikɛ sɛnbɛmaan fama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">alo balabalan kɛsɛne foye gbeeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">alo tulen foye kala tiin naxan fama fufaan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">a yi taan nagodo bɔxɔni a fangani.<verse eid="ISA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3"/>Taan naxan luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:3">alo mangaya kɔmɔtina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:3">naxan findixi Efirami dɔlɔ minne xunna kenla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:3">na yibodonma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4"/>Taan naxan nɔrɔn luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">alo fugen yolonmatɔna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">naxan tixi mɛrɛmɛrɛ ɲingixin xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">na luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">alo xɔdɛ bogi singen naxan mɔma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">benun se xaba waxatin xa a li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">Muxu yo na a to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">na kanna a bama nɛn kedenna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">a yi a don sa!<verse eid="ISA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:5">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan findima manga kɔmɔtin na a yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:5">naxanye na lu e nii ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:5">alo mangaya taxamaseri nɔrɔxina.<verse eid="ISA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6"/>A xaxinla fima nɛn kitisane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:6">alogo e xa kiti kɛndɛn sa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:6">A yi fangan fi muxune ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:6">naxanye yaxune kedima taan so dɛɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dɔlɔ minne yi Nabi Esayi magele</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7"/>Hali e saraxaraline nun e nabine tantanma dɔlɔn xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">Manpaan bata e xunna firifiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">Manpaan bata e ratantan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">Dɔlɔn bata e xaxinli fu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">manpaan yi e xunna firifiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">E nɛma fe toon tima alo xiyena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">e tantanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">e nɛma kitin sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">e a feni fu.<verse eid="ISA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8"/>E tabanle birin nafexi e baxunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:8">e yiren birin xɔsixi.<verse eid="ISA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9"/>Na dɔlɔ minne maxɔdinna tima, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">“Esayi ito waxi nde xaran feyi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">A a falane yɛbama nde xa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">Diidin naxanye baxi xiɲɛn na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">Dii futen naxanye dɛɛn baxi badeni xiɲɛn na ba?<verse eid="ISA 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10"/>Bayo a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">‘Tɔnne tɔnne fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">tɔnne tɔnne fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">Sɔnne sɔnne fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">sɔnne sɔnne fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">Ndee be, ndee na.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11"/>Awa, nayi, Ala fa falan tima yamani ito xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:11">xɔɲɛne falane nun xui gbɛtɛne nan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:11">e mi naxanye famuma.<verse eid="ISA 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12"/>Anu, a bata yi a fala e xa nun, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">“Matabuden nan be ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">xa naxan xadanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">na xa fa a matabu be.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Bɔɲɛ xunbeli yiren nan be ra.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Koni e tondixi e tuli matiyɛ.<verse eid="ISA 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13"/>Nayi, Alatala falan tima e xa na kii nin yati, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">“Tɔnne tɔnne fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">tɔnne tɔnne fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">Sɔnne sɔnne fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">sɔnne sɔnne fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">Ndee be, ndee na,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">alogo e nɛma sigan tiyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">e xa bira e xanbiramaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">e maxɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">e yi e suxu lutin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">e sa kasoon na.<verse eid="ISA 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marigin yi banxin bɛtɛn sa Yerusalɛn yi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14"/>Ɛ tan magele tiin naxanye Yerusalɛn yamaan xunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:14">ɛ tuli mati Alatalaa falan na!<verse eid="ISA 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15"/>Ɛ a falama, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">“Nxu bata layirin xidi nxu nun sayaan tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">nxu bata lanna raso nxu nun laxira tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">Xa gbalon fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">a mi nxu konna lima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">amasɔtɔ nxu bata wulene findi nxu yigiyaden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">nxu yi mayifu falane findi nxu luxunden na.”<verse eid="ISA 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16"/>Nanara, Marigina Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">“N bata gɛmɛna nde dɔxɔ Siyon taani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">alo banxin tongon gɛmɛ faɲi yɛbaxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">na mi yimaxɛ mumɛ!”<verse eid="ISA 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17"/>N kiti kɛndɛn nun tinxinyaan findima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">n ma banxin ti se tinxinxine nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">koni balabalan kɛsɛne ɛ yigiyaden makɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">ɛ wulene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">igen yi sa ɛ luxunden xun ma.<verse eid="ISA 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18"/>Layirin naxan ɛ nun sayaan tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">na yi kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">Lanna naxan ɛ nun laxira tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">na mi fa luma na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">Gbalon na fa waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">a yi ɛ halagi.<verse eid="ISA 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19"/>A na fa waxati yo yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">a ɛ xalɛ a yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">bayo a danguma nɛn xɔtɔnna nun yanyin nun kɔɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">Gaxun nan tun a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">a xuiin bunna na famu waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20"/>Saden xurunma ayi nɛn saden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:20">bitinganna yi dungi ayi mafelenna ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21"/>Alatala mɔn kelima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">alo a liga kii naxan yi Perasimi geyaan fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">A bɔɲɛn tema nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">alo a liga kii naxan yi Gabayon lanbanni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">28.21</char> Dawuda Filisitine nɔ nɛn yɛngɛni Ala sɛnbɛn xɔn <char style="fk">Perasimi</char> geyaan fari e nun <char style="fk">Gabayon</char> yi. Na feen sɛbɛxi Samuyɛli Firinden 5.20 kui.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">alogo a xa a wanle rakamali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">naxanye makabɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">a kɛwali magaxuxine.<verse eid="ISA 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22"/>Awa iki, ɛ magelen dan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">Xanamu, ɛ xidi yɔlɔnxɔnne mɔn gbɛtɛnma nɛn ɛ yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna na nan falaxi n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">a bata a ragidi a xa yamanan birin halagi.<verse eid="ISA 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɛɛ bi feen sandane</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23"/>Ɛ tuli mati n xuiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:23">Ɛ xaxili lu n ma falane xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24"/>Xɛɛ biin na wa sansiin si feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:24">a luun bɔxɔn biin nan tun fari waxatin birin yi ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:24">A luma a bɔxɔn nawalɛ nɛn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:24">a buxa dan mi naxan na?<verse eid="ISA 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25"/>Koni a na yelin a bɔxɔni tɔnɲɛ waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">a mi sabi dɛ daxine xan sima na xanbi ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">A mi sabi seene siyɛ ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">e nun sorontonna?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">A mi maala nun fundenna wolɛ e xɛɛne yi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">a sansi gbɛtɛye si xɛɛn dɛ?<verse eid="ISA 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26"/>A Ala nan na tagi raba kiin yitaxi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:26">a yi a xaran a liga kiin ma.<verse eid="ISA 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27"/>Sabidɛ daxine mi bodonma ɲingen xɛɛ ra bɔnbɔ seen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:27">muxu yo mi wontoron sanne radanguɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:27">sabi se xun xurine fari e bɔnbɔ seen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:27">koni ndee bɔnbɔma gbelemɛn nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:27">muxune yi nde bodon.<verse eid="ISA 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28"/>Fɔ sansi kɛsɛne xa din nɛn e findi fuɲin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">benun burun xa sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">Nayi, muxun mi luma a bɔnbɛ han habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">Hali e wontoron nun a bandun soone radangu a fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">na mi a kɛsɛne findɛ a fuɲin na.<verse eid="ISA 28:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29"/>Na feene fataxi Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:29">kabanako kawandi tiin naxan ma fe kolonna gbo han!<verse eid="ISA 28:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔn nun yigin Yerusalɛn xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1"/>Gbalona Ariyele taan xa, Ariyele!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">29.1</char> <char style="fk">Ariyele</char> findixi Yerusalɛn taan xili gbɛtɛ nan na be. Dawuda Yerusalɛn taan yɛngɛ feen sɛbɛxi Samuyɛli firinden 5.6-9 kui.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:1">Manga Dawudaa ganla taan naxan nabilin yɛngɛni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:1">Ɛ sanle birin nabama e kiini ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ,<verse eid="ISA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2"/>koni n na Ariyele taan yɛngɛma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">Ɛ wugama nɛn, ɛ sunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">ɛ taan yi lu n xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">alo saraxan ganma dɛnaxan fari.<verse eid="ISA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3"/>N nan n ma ganla tima nɛn ɛ taan nabilinni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:3">N yi ɛ mini kiraan bolon ɛ ma yɛngɛ so seene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:3">N yi yire makantanxine yitɔn ɛ xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4"/>Ɛ fe yigodoma nɛn han a lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">alo ɛ xuiin kelima bɔxɔn nan bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">Ɛ xuiin yi xurun mini burunburunni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">Ɛ xuiin luma minɛ nɛn bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">alo barinne ɲunuɲunun xuiin bɛndɛn bun.<verse eid="ISA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5"/>Ɛ yaxu yamaan luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:5">alo xubena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:5">ɛ tɔrɔ muxune ganla luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:5">alo foyen sɛxɛn naxan xalima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:5">Sanɲa ma kedenni, mafurɛn,<verse eid="ISA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna fama i malideni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:6">galan xuiin nun bɔxɔ xuruxurunna nun xui gbeen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:6">nun kala ti foyen nun tule foye gbeen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:6">nun halagi ti tɛɛ dɛgɛ gbeen nin.<verse eid="ISA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7"/>Ariyele kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">yamanan naxanye ganle ɛ yɛngɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">ne danguma nɛn alo xiyena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">Naxanye birin yi fuma ɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">e ɛ taan nabilin yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">ne ɲanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">alo xiyen kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8"/>Kamɛn muxun naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">na xiye sama nɛn, a dɛgema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">koni a na xulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">a lima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">kamɛn mɔn a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">Min xɔnla muxun naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">na xiye sama nɛn, a minma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">koni a na xulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">a a li, a kɔɛ yinla raxaraxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">a fanga mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">A ligama na kii nin yamanane muxune xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">naxanye Siyon geyaan yɛngɛma.<verse eid="ISA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamaan mi xaxili sɔtɔxi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9"/>Ɛ kabɛ, ɛ ɛ dundu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">Ɛ findi danxutɔne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">ɛ nama seen to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">Ɛ xunna xa firifiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">koni hali ɛ mi manpaan min.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">Ɛ dingenɲɛ ayi siga tideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">koni hali a mi findi dɔlɔn funfun na.<verse eid="ISA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala bata ɛ xaxinli fu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:10">a mi tinxi ɛ nabine xa fe toon ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:10">a dugin so ɛ fe toone xun na.<verse eid="ISA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11"/>Fe makɛnɛnxini itoe birin bata lu ɛ tan xa alo fala sɛbɛxine kɛdi mafilinxini, naxan balanxi taxamasenna ra. Ɛ a so muxu xaranxina nde yii, ɛ yi a fala a xa, ɛ naxa, “Ito xaran nxu xa yandi.” A ɛ yabima nɛn, a naxa, “N mi nɔɛ a xaranɲɛ, kɛdin balanxin na ra.” <verse eid="ISA 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12"/>Hanma ɛ xa a so xarantarena nde yii, ɛ naxa, “Ito xaran nxu xa yandi!” A ɛ yabima nɛn, a naxa, “N mi nɔɛ sɛbɛnla xaranɲɛ!”<verse eid="ISA 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13"/>Marigin naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">“Yamani ito maso n na e falane xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">E n binyama e dɛɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">koni e bɔɲɛn makuya n na pon!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">Binyen naxan e yi lan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">na fataxi adamadiine yamari xaranxine nan gbansan na!<verse eid="ISA 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14"/>Nanara, n mɔn luma nɛn yamani ito ratɛrɛnɛ kabanako feene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">E fe kolonne fe kolonna tununma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">e xaxilimane xaxinla yi lɔ ayi.”<verse eid="ISA 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15"/>Gbalon na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">naxanye kata gbeen tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">alogo e xa e fe yitɔnxine luxun Alatala ma wundoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">E wanle kɛma dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">e yi a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">“Nde nɔɛ en toɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">Nde en ma fe kolonɲɛ?”<verse eid="ISA 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16"/>Anu, ɛ bata tantan fefe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Nde fɛɲɛ rafalan yatɛ fɛɲɛ bɛndɛn na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Muxun yii fɔxɔna a falɛ a rafala muxun ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">a naxa, “I tan mi n nafalaxi”?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Fɛɲɛna a falɛ fɛɲɛ rafalan ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">a naxa, “I mi sese kolon”?<verse eid="ISA 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala a yamaan kiin masarama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17"/>Benun waxatidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:17">Liban fɔtɔnna findima nɛn bogise wudi bili nakɔɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:17">na bogise wudi bili nakɔne yi lu alo fɔtɔnna.<verse eid="ISA 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:18">naxan sɛbɛxi kɛdin kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:18">tuli xɔrine na mɛma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:18">Danxutɔne yi mini dimi gbeeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:18">e yi seen to.<verse eid="ISA 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19"/>Tɔrɔ muxune sɛwa gbeen sɔtɔma nɛn Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:19">yiigelitɔne yi ɲaxan Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxini.<verse eid="ISA 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20"/>Amasɔtɔ gbalotɔne tununma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:20">magele tiine yi lɔ ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:20">Naxanye katama hakɛn ligadeni bonne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:20">ne halagima nɛn,<verse eid="ISA 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21"/>naxanye wulen sama muxune xun ma kitisadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:21">e yi lutin nati muxune yɛɛ ra kitini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:21">e yoo kanna tɔɲɛgɛ.<verse eid="ISA 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22"/>Nanara, Alatala naxan Iburahima xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">na ito nan falaxi Yaxubaa yamaan xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">“Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna mi fa rayarabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">a mi fa yagima sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23"/>Amasɔtɔ e tan nun e diine n kɛwanle toma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">e yi n xili sariɲanxin binya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">e yi n tan Yaxubaa Ala Sariɲanxina sariɲanna kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">e gaxu n yɛɛ ra, n tan Isirayilaa Ala.<verse eid="ISA 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24"/>Naxanye yi lɔxi ayi e miriyane xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:24">ne xaxinla sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:24">matandi tiine yi xaranna sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="ISA 29:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane nama e yigi sa Misiran kaane yi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1"/>Alatalaa falan ni ito ra, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">“Gbalona ɛ tan dii murutɛxine xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">Ɛ feene yitɔnma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">naxanye mi kelixi n tan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">Ɛ layirine xidima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">naxanye mi fataxi n ma Nii Sariɲanxin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">Ɛ yulubine sama e bode fari.<verse eid="ISA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2"/>Ɛ sigama Misiran yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">koni ɛ mi n maxɔdinma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">A xɔnla ɛ ma Misiran mangan xa ɛ kantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">ɛ yi yigiyaden fen Misiran sɛnbɛn bun alo nininna!<verse eid="ISA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3"/>Koni Misiran Mangana makantanna findima ɛ xa yagin nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:3">Ɛ yigiyaden naxan fenma Misiran kaane fɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:3">na yi ɛ yigin kala.<verse eid="ISA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4"/>Kuntigine bata sa Soyan taan li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:4">xɛrane bata Xanɛsi taan li.<verse eid="ISA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5"/>Koni e birin nayagima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">bayo na yamanan tɔnɔ yo mi e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">Misiran kaane mi ɛ malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">e mi munanfan yo fima ɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">E yagin nun yarabin nan tun nalima ɛ ma.”<verse eid="ISA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila xɛrane Misiran yi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6"/>Waliyiya falana subene xili ma Negewi tonbonni:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">E xɛrane danguma gbalo yiren nun tɔrɔ yiren nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">yata xɛmɛne nun yata gilɛne dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">e nun fɔdɔgɔne nun saɲi ɲaxin naxanye tuganma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">E nafunle maxalima sofanle nan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">e nun e sɔtɔ seene ɲɔgɔmɛne fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">sanbane nan ne ra na yamanan xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">naxan tɔnɔ mi na.<verse eid="ISA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7"/>E sigama Misiran yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:7">naxan ma maliin findima fe fuun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:7">sese mi a ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:7">Nanara, n na a xili bama Ninginanga Narixina.<verse eid="ISA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marakolonna lan waxati famatɔna fe ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8"/>Marigin yi a fala Esayi xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">“Iki, feni itoe sɛbɛ kɛdina nde kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">Yerusalɛn kaane yɛtagi e nun walaxan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">alogo a xa lu na waxati famatɔne yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">habadan han habadan.”<verse eid="ISA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9"/>Yama murutɛxin nan ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:9">diidi wule falane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:9">diidin naxanye tondima Alatala sariyan namɛ.<verse eid="ISA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10"/>E a falama fe toone xa, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">“Ɛ nama fa fe toon ti sɔnɔn!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">E a falama nabine xa, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">“Ɛ nama ɲɔndin makɛnɛn nxu xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">Ɛ fe faɲin nan ma fe fala nxu xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">Ɛ nxu rafan feene fala nxu xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">hali a findi wulen na.<verse eid="ISA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11"/>Ɛ keli kira faɲin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:11">ɛ a beɲin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:11">Ɛ ba Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina fe yɛbɛ nxu xa!”<verse eid="ISA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12"/>Nanara, Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">“Ɛ to ɛ mɛma n ma falane ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">ɛ yi ɛ yigi sa ɛ muxu ɲaxankata feene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">nun ɛ muxu mayanfa feene yi,<verse eid="ISA 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13"/>nayi, na hakɛn luma ɛ xa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:13">alo taan makantan yin matexin na bɔ fɔlɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:13">Mɛnna na tintin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:13">a birama nɛn sa!<verse eid="ISA 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14"/>A yibɔma nɛn a xunxurin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">alo fɛɲɛ goronna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">a yensenɲɛ ayi kininkinintareyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">hali a dungi xungbena a mi toɛ a dungine yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">naxan findɛ tɛɛ kɔ seen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">hanma ige sɛgɛ sena.”<verse eid="ISA 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yigi sana Ala yi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15"/>Marigina Alatala Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">“Ɛ na ɛ xun xɛtɛ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">ɛ raxara, ɛ kisin sɔtɔma na nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">Ɛ na ɛ sabari, ɛ yigi sa n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">ɛ sɛnbɛn sɔtɔma na nin.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">Koni na xɔli mi ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16"/>Ɛ a falama, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">“Nxu nxu gima nɛn soone fari!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">Nayi, ɛ ɛ gima nɛn yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">Ɛ naxa, “Nxu nxu gima nɛn soo xulumɛne fari!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">Nanara, ɛ sagatan muxune fan xulunma ayi nɛn kati!<verse eid="ISA 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17"/>Ɛ muxu wuli kedenna e gima nɛn ɛ yaxun muxu kedenna bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">yaxun muxu suulun pe na e kɔnkɔ ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">ɛ birin ɛ gima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">Naxanye na lu ɛ tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">ne luma nɛn kedenyani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">alo taxamaseri dugin wudi kuyen ɲɔɛ ra geyaan xuntagi.<verse eid="ISA 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marakisi waxatina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18"/>Anu, Alatala ɛ mamɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">alogo a xa hinan ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">a kelima nɛn a yi a kininkininna yita ɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">Ala naxan kiti kɛndɛn sama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">na nan Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">Sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">naxanye e xaxili tima a ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19"/>Ɛ tan Siyon kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">ɛ tan naxanye dɔxi Yerusalɛn yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">ɛ mi fa wugama sɔnɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">Ɛ na ɛ xui ramini a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">a hinanma ɛ ra nɛn han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">A na ɛ xuiin mɛ tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">a ɛ yabima nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20"/>Marigin tɔrɔyaan nun mayigbɛtɛnna ragidi nɛn ɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:20">ɛ donseen nun ɛ min igen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:20">Koni ɛ karamɔxɔ mi fa a luxunma ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:20">ɛ a toma nɛn ɛ yɛɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21"/>I na siga yiifanna ma hanma kɔmɛnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:21">i fala xuiin mɛma nɛn i xanbi ra, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:21">“Kiraan ni ito ra, siga a xɔn!”<verse eid="ISA 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22"/>Ɛ suxure gbeti daxine nun a xɛma daxine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:22">yatɛma nɛn se haramuxine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:22">e woli ayi alo ɲamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:22">i yi a fala e ma, i naxa, “Xɔsina.”<verse eid="ISA 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23"/>Nayi, Ala tulen nafama nɛn i ya sansi sixine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:23">bɔxɔn yi balo faɲi gbeen fi i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:23">Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:23">i ya xuruseene sa e dɛ madonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:23">xuruse rabade gbeene yi.<verse eid="ISA 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24"/>Ɲingene nun sofanla naxanye xɛɛn bima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:24">ne yi balo ɲaxumɛn don</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:24">fɔxɔn saxi naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:24">naxan sama e bun se kɔ seen nun sansi yife seen na.<verse eid="ISA 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25"/>Faxa gbeen tima lɔxɔn naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:25">taan makantan sangansone na bira waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:25">folone nun xudene rafema nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:25">geya gbeene nun yire matexine birin yi.<verse eid="ISA 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26"/>Kiken dɛgɛma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">alo sogena na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">sogen dɛgɛn yi gbo ayi dɔxɔ solofere</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">dangu a ki fonna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">Alatala a muxune maxɔlɔdene dandanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">a yi e fure dɛɛne yiyalan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">a tan yɛtɛɛn naxanye maxɔlɔ.<verse eid="ISA 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala Asiriya yɛngɛma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27"/>A mato, Alatala sɛnbɛn fama sa keli wulani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">a fama xɔlɔ gbeen nun ɲaxankatan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">a fitinaxin yi falan ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">alo tɛɛn naxan halagin tima.<verse eid="ISA 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28"/>A nii raxinla luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">alo baan na walanɲɛ ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">naxan bɔxɔnma a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">a te han muxun kɔɛɛn bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">Nayi, a siyane yimaxama nɛn a halagi ti segedenna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">A yi karafen bira xɔɲɛ yamane dɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">naxan e rasigama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">yireni dɛnaxan xɔli mi e ma.<verse eid="ISA 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29"/>Ɛ tan Yerusalɛn kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">ɛ bɛtin bama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">alo sali lɔxɔn kɔɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">Ɛ bɔɲɛn sɛwama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">alo muxune nɛma sigɛ xulen xuini Alatalaa geyaan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">Isirayila kantan fanyena Ala.<verse eid="ISA 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30"/>Alatala a xui gbeen naminima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:30">a yi a sɛnbɛ gbeen makɛnɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:30">A yi a xɔlɔ gbeen nagodo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:30">alo halagi ti tɛɛ gbeena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:30">tule ige gbeen nun galanna nun balabalan kɛsɛne yi godo.<verse eid="ISA 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31"/>Asiriya kaane na Alatala xuiin mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:31">e xuruxurunma nɛn gaxuni a bosaan bun ma.<verse eid="ISA 30:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32"/>Alatala ne xuruma bosaan yɛɛn naxanye birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:32">ne ligama tanbanna nun bɔlɔn xuiin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:32">a nɛma e yɛngɛma a sɛnbɛni.<verse eid="ISA 30:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33"/>Tɛɛni tɔnxi xabu to mi na ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">A yitɔnxi mangan xili yi yili gbee tilinxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">yege gbeen nun tɛɛ gbeen naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">Alatala nii raxinla nan minima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">alo dole tɛɛn xudena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">a na tɛɛn nadɛgɛ.<verse eid="ISA 30:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane nama e yigi sa Misiran kaane yi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1"/>Gbalon ne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">naxanye sigama Misiran yi maliin fendeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">naxanye xaxili tixi soone ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">naxanye e yigi sama yɛngɛ so wontorone yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">bayo e wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">e nun soo ragine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">bayo e sɛnbɛn gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">koni e mi e yɛɛ rafindima Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">e mi Alatala fenma!<verse eid="ISA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2"/>Anu, a tan fan fe kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">a nɔɛ gbalon nafɛ nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">A mi a falan maxɛtɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">A kelima nɛn muxu ɲaxine yamaan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">hakɛ kanne mali muxune.<verse eid="ISA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3"/>Misiran kaane findixi adamadiine nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">Ala mi e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">E soone mi findixi niin xan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">subene nan tun e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">Alatala na a yiini te naxan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">naxan na na kanna mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">na salaxunma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">a fan naxan malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">na kanna yi bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">e firinna birin yi halagi e bode xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marigin Yerusalɛn kantanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4"/>Alatala bata a fala n xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">“N tan Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna godoma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">n yi yɛngɛn so Siyon geyaan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">e nun a yire matexine yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">alo yatan wurundunma a se suxin ma kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">alo yata sɛnbɛmaan na xuruseen suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">Hali xuruse rabane birin keli a xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">a mi gaxuma e sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔn yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">hali e to wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">a mi tunnaxɔlɔma a ma.<verse eid="ISA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna Yerusalɛn kantanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">alo xɔliin naxanye e firifirima e tɛɛn xun ma a kantandeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">A a kantanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">a yi a xunba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">A a ratangama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">a yi a xɔrɔya.”<verse eid="ISA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6"/>Ɛ tan Isirayila kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:6">ɛ xun xɛtɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:6">ɛ murutɛxi a tan naxan ma fefe!<verse eid="ISA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:7">ɛ birin ɛ mɛma nɛn ɛ suxure gbeti daxine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:7">nun a xɛma daxine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:7">ɛ tan yulubitɔne yii fɔxɔne.<verse eid="ISA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8"/>Asiriya kaane faxama nɛn silanfanna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">naxan mi findixi muxun gbeen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">Silanfanna naxan mi fataxi adamadi yo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">na e raxɔrima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">E gima nɛn silanfanna bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">e banxulanne yi findi konyine ra.<verse eid="ISA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9"/>Naxan e kantanma, na gaxuxin yi a gi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">E kuntigine gaxuma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">e na e yaxune taxamasenna to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">Alatalaa falan nan na ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">naxan ma tɛɛn dɛgɛma Siyon yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">sulun tɛɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">31.9</char> <char style="fk">Sulun tɛɛn</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Furu tɛɛna</char>.”</note> naxan yii Yerusalɛn yi.<verse eid="ISA 31:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32"/>
  <para style="s">Mangaya tinxinxina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1"/>A mato, mangana nde mangayaan nabama nɛn tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:1">kuntigine yi kuntigiyaan liga kiti kɛndɛn xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2"/>E muxune birin luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">alo yigiyaden foyen bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">alo luxunden kala ti foyen bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">alo igena kiraan tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">alo gɛmɛ gbeen nininna bɔxɔ yixareni.<verse eid="ISA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3"/>Yɛɛ kanne yɛɛne mi fa luma raxixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:3">tuli kanne yi e tuli mati.<verse eid="ISA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4"/>Muxun naxanye xaxili mi dɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:4">ne xaxinla nun kolonna sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:4">dɛ masuxune yi falan ti a tinxinni e dɛ mafuraxin na.<verse eid="ISA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5"/>Nayi, a mi fa falama xaxilitarene ma a xaxilimane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:5">fe ɲaxi rabane mi fa yatɛma muxu gbeene ra.<verse eid="ISA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6"/>Amasɔtɔ xaxilitaren xaxilitareya falan nan tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">E hakɛ feene yitɔnma e bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">e lu Ala kolontareya wanle kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">e lu fala ɲaxine tiyɛ Alatala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">E kamɛtɔne luma kamɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">min xɔnla naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">e na kuma igeni.<verse eid="ISA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7"/>Fe ɲaxi rabane wanle ɲaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">E fe ɲaxine yitɔnma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">alogo e xa yiigelitɔne halagi wulene xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">hali yoon tɔrɔ muxune xa e kitini.<verse eid="ISA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8"/>Koni muxu faɲine fe faɲine nan yitɔnma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:8">e yi lu e ɲɛnige faɲiyani.<verse eid="ISA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marakolonna lan ɲaxanle ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9"/>Ɛ tan ɲaxanla naxanye luxi xaxili sani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:9">ɛ keli, ɛ tuli mati n na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:9">Ɛ tan sungutunna naxanye xaxili ragidixi feu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:9">ɛ tuli mati n ma falan na!<verse eid="ISA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10"/>Benun ɲɛɛ keden e nun nde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">ɛ tan naxanye xaxili ragidixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">ɛ yimaxama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">bayo se bogi bolon daxine ɲanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">sansi xaba daxine yi dasa se xaba waxatini.<verse eid="ISA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11"/>Nayi, ɛ gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">ɛ tan ɲaxanla naxanye xaxili sani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">ɛ kɔntɔfili, ɛ tan sungutunna naxanye xaxili ragidixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">Ɛ dugine ba ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">ɛ yi kasa bɛnbɛli dugine xidi ɛ tagi sununi.<verse eid="ISA 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12"/>Ɛ kanken makudun, ɛ wuga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:12">xɛɛ tofaɲine nun manpa bili sabatixine fe ra,<verse eid="ISA 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13"/>e nun n ma yamana bɔxɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">firin ɲali kanne nun tansinne bata sabati dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">Ɛ wuga banxi faɲine fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">sɛwan yi dɛnaxanye yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">e nun sumunna yi taan naxan yi yɛyɛ.<verse eid="ISA 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14"/>Amasɔtɔ manga banxin nabeɲinma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">taa yimaxaxini ito yigelima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">a yire makantanxine nun sangansone yi findi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">banxi xɔnne ra han habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">e nun burunna sofanle magidena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">e nun xuruseene dɛ madondena,<verse eid="ISA 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15"/>han Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin yi godo nxu ma keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">tonbonna yi findi wudi bili nakɔɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">wudi bili nakɔɔn yi findi fɔtɔnna ra.<verse eid="ISA 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16"/>Nayi, kiti kɛndɛn luma nɛn tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:16">tinxinna yi lu wudi bili nakɔni.<verse eid="ISA 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17"/>Tinxinyaan yi bɔɲɛ xunbenla raso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:17">Tinxinyaan tɔnɔn yi findi sabarin nun makantanna ra habadan.<verse eid="ISA 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18"/>N ma yamaan dɔxɔma nɛn bɔɲɛ xunbeli yireni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:18">dɔxɔde makantanxine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:18">matabu faɲin dɛnaxanye yi.<verse eid="ISA 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19"/>Hali balabalan kɛsɛne fɔtɔnna kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:19">taan mumɛɛn yi fɔn,<verse eid="ISA 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20"/>sɛwan luma nɛn ɛ tan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:20">Ɛ tan ɛ sansine sima nɛn xudene birin dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:20">ɛ yi ɛ ɲingene nun sofanle lu e sagoni.<verse eid="ISA 32:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33"/>
  <para style="s">Gbalon halagi tiin xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1"/>Gbaloni i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">i tan naxan halagin tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">i tan naxan munma halagin sɔtɔ singen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">i tan naxan bonne yanfama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">muxe munma i tan naxan yanfa singen!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">I na yelin halagin tiyɛ waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">i fan yi halagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">I na yanfantenyaan dan waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">muxune yi i fan yanfa.<verse eid="ISA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2"/>Alatala, hinan nxu ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">Nxu xaxili tixi i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">Findi nxu fangan na xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">i nxu rakisi tɔrɔ waxatini!<verse eid="ISA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3"/>Siyane na i xuiin mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:3">e yi e gi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:3">I nɛɛn fa keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:3">yamanane muxune bata xuya ayi.<verse eid="ISA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4"/>Ɛ tan siyane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">ɛ seen naxanye tongoxi yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">muxune bata fu na ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">alo tuguminne na so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">Muxune dutunma ne ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">alo suɲɛ sɛtɛna.<verse eid="ISA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5"/>Alatala na feene birin xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:5">bayo a dɔxi kore xɔnna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:5">A bata sariyan nun tinxinna raso Siyon taan yiren birin yi.<verse eid="ISA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6"/>I tan, Alatalaa yamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">i luma nɛn makantanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">Xaxilimayaan nun Ala kolonna findixi kisin nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">e nun Marigin binyana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">na nan findixi i ya nafunla ra.<verse eid="ISA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala kelima nɛn yaxune xili ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7"/>Sofa wɛkilɛxine nan gbelegbele xui ito ra kirane xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:7">Bɔɲɛ xunbenla rali muxune yi xɛtɛ wugɛ xɔlɛni.<verse eid="ISA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8"/>Kirane bata rabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">muxu yo mi fa danguma kirane xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">Yaxun bata layirin kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">a yi taane raɲaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">a mi muxu yo binyaxi.<verse eid="ISA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9"/>Yamanan bata lu sununi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">a kalama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">Liban yamanan bata yagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">a fɔtɔnna bata xara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">Sarɔn mɛrɛmɛrɛn luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">alo tonbonna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">Basan nun Karemele yamanane wudine dɛɛne yi yolon.<verse eid="ISA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10"/>Alatala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:10">“Iki, n bata keli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:10">Iki, n na n ma binyen mayitama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:10">Iki, n na n ma fe yitema nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11"/>Ɛ feen naxanye yitɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">ne luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">alo se dagina hanma sɛxɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">Ɛ yɛtɛɛn yengin yi findi tɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">naxan ɛ raxɔrima.<verse eid="ISA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12"/>Siyane ganma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:12">e lu alo xuben sulun tɛɛni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">33.12</char> <char style="fk">Sulun tɛɛn</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Furu tɛɛna</char>.”</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:12">alo tansinne na masɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:12">e gan.”<verse eid="ISA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13"/>Ɛ tan naxanye makuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:13">ɛ tuli mati n naxan ligaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:13">Ɛ tan naxanye maso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:13">ɛ n sɛnbɛn yatɛn kolon.<verse eid="ISA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14"/>Yulubitɔne bata gaxu Siyon yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">xuruxurunna bata so Ala kolontarene yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">E maxɔdinna tima, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">“Nde luyɛ halagi tɛɛni ito dɛxɔn en yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">Nde nɔɛ luyɛ habadan tɛɛ wolonni ito dɛxɔn en yɛ?”<verse eid="ISA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15"/>Fɔ naxan sigan tima tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">a ɲɔndin fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">naxan a mɛma tɔnɔne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">naxanye sɔtɔxi gbaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">naxan mi tinma dimi yi seen nasuxɛ mayifuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">a tunla ba muxune ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">naxanye faxa ti feene yitɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">a yɛɛn ba fe ɲaxine ra.<verse eid="ISA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16"/>Na kanna fe luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">alo a na dɔxɔ yire matexini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">geyaan faran makantanxin yi findi a luxunden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">A donseen nun igen mi dasama.<verse eid="ISA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn yi xunba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17"/>I mangan toma nɛn i yɛɛn na a nɔrɔ gbeeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:17">i yi yamanan danne to masigaxi pon!<verse eid="ISA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18"/>Nayi, i mirima nɛn i ya ɲaxankata danguxine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">i yi a fala, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">“Na kuntigine minɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">naxanye yi mudun nasuxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">e nun naxanye yi makantan yinna xun matoma a ra?”<verse eid="ISA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19"/>I mi fa na yama wasoxin toma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:19">xɔɲɛn naxanye fala xuine mi nɔɛ famunɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:19">xɔɲɛn naxanye fala xui mi mɛma a faɲin na.<verse eid="ISA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20"/>Siyon taan mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">en sanle rabama taan naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">Ɛ yɛɛn tima nɛn Yerusalɛn ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">bɔɲɛ xunbeli yirena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">a lu alo bubun naxan mi fa wayanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">naxan wudiye mi fa talama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">naxan lutiye mi fa fulunma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21"/>Alatala a yɛtɛ yitama en na Ala Sɛnbɛmaan na mɛnna nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">Xudene nun baa gbeene luma nɛn mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">yɛngɛ so kunkine mi danguɛ dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">Kunki gbeene mi danguɛ na mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan en ma kitisaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">Alatala nan en ma sariyasaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">Alatala nan en ma mangan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">A tan nan en nakisima.<verse eid="ISA 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23"/>Koni yaxune luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">alo kunkin naxan lutiye bata fulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">foyen kunkin nasigama dugin naxanye xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">ne mi fa xidixi sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">ne fan singanxi wudi kuyen naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">na mi fa suxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">Nayi, e se tongoxi gbeen yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">na yitaxunma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">hali sankalatɔne e gbeen xalima nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24"/>Nayi, Yerusalɛn kaa yo mi a falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:24">e naxa, “N mi yalan.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:24">Na taan muxune hakɛne mafeluma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 33:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34"/>
  <para style="s">Edɔn makitina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1"/>Siyane, ɛ maso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">ɛ yi ɛ tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">Siyane, ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">Bɔxɔ xɔnna xa a mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">e nun a yi seene birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">e nun dunuɲa nun naxanye birin minima a yi.<verse eid="ISA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatalaa xɔlɔn godoma nɛn siyane birin fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:2">a fitinan yi godo e ganle birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:2">A bata halagin nagidi e birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:2">A tinma nɛn e birin yi faxa.<verse eid="ISA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3"/>E faxa muxune luma nɛn biraxi bɔxɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:3">e binbine xirin yi mini han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:3">e wunle yi sa e geyane birin ma.<verse eid="ISA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4"/>Sare kurune<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">34.4</char> Mɛn kaane yi <char style="fk">sarene</char> batuma na waxatini.</note> birin kalama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">alo se kunxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">kuyen yi mafilin alo kɛdina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">sare ganla birin yi yolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">alo manpa binla dɛ xarene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">alo xɔdɛ bili bogi xaraxine.<verse eid="ISA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5"/>Ala naxa, “N ma silanfanna bata sarene wunla ramini han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">A godoma nɛn Edɔn kaane ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">a yi e makiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">n halagin nagidixi yamaan naxan ma.”<verse eid="ISA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6"/>Wunla bata so Alatalaa silanfanna yiren birin ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">a madole muxu turen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">A luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">alo kontonne nun kɔtɔne wunla saraxabadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">alo e turen naxan e gbingini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">Bayo Alatala saraxa gbeen bama nɛn Bosara taani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">Edɔn kaa wuyaxi yi faxa yɛngɛni.<verse eid="ISA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7"/>E yɛɛratine fangan gbo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">alo burunna ɲingene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">koni e fan faxama nɛn bonne xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">e nun ɲingene nun turane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">E yamanan nafema nɛn wunla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">e turen yi radin bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="ISA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8"/>Bayo, gbeeɲɔxɔ lɔxɔn nan na ra Alatala xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:8">gbeeɲɔxɔn ɲɛɛn nan na ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:8">Siyon taan xun mayɛngɛna fe yi.<verse eid="ISA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9"/>Edɔn yamanan baane findima nɛn dolen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:9">A xuben yi maxɛtɛ dole tɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:9">e bɔxɔn yi findi dolen ganmatɔɔn na.<verse eid="ISA 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10"/>Kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">a tɛɛn mi tuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">a tutin yi lu tɛ kore habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">E yamanan yi lu rabeɲinxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">han mayixɛtɛ nun mayixɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">muxun mi fa danguɛ na yi mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11"/>Na yi findi xutunxunbane nun sagalene konna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">toxorone nun xaxane yigiyadena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">Ala yi a lu a yitɔntaren nun a yigenla ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">alo a dunuɲa da waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12"/>A muxu gbeene mi fa luma na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:12">naxanye mangan dɔxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:12">a kuntigine birin ɲanma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13"/>Wudi ɲali kanne solima e manga banxine kui nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:13">sɛxɛ ɲaxine nun tansinne yi a yire makantanxine rasuxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:13">a findi kankone nun dangaranfulene konna ra,<verse eid="ISA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14"/>burunna subene nun kankone naralandena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:14">burunna kɔtɔne yi lu wugɛ e bode ma mɛnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:14">Kɔɛ ra yinnan Liliti yi dɔxɔ na bɔɲɛ xunbenli.<verse eid="ISA 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15"/>Saɲin fan a soden toma na nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">a yi a xɛlɛne bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">a yi e rasɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">a a diine malan a nininna bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">Sɛgɛne fan e malanma na nin.<verse eid="ISA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16"/>Xa ɛ Alatalaa kɛdin kui to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">ɛ ito xaranma nɛn na, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">“Subeni itoe sese mi dasama na yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">birin nun a lanfaan nan fama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">bayo Ala bata na yamarin fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">A Nii Sariɲanxin nan e malanma.<verse eid="ISA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17"/>A tan nan e dɔxɔdene ragidima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">A tan nan e yirene maliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">a yi e yitaxun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">Na yamanan findima nɛn e gbeen na han habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">e yi lu na han mayixɛtɛn nun mayixɛtɛ.”<verse eid="ISA 34:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn xunba fena konyiyani</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1"/>Tonbonna nun bɔxɔ xaren sɛwama nɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:1">Burunna ɲingima nɛn sɛwani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:1">a fuga alo gabala fugena.<verse eid="ISA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2"/>Fugene luma nɛn burunna yiren birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">Burunna ɲingine yiriwama nɛn ɲaxanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">A sɔnxɔ sɛwani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">Liban yamanan nɔrɔn sifan bata fi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">e nun Karemele geyaan nun Sarɔn mɛrɛmɛrɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">Nayi, muxune nɔɛ Alatalaa binye gbeen toɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">en ma Alaa nɔrɔna.<verse eid="ISA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3"/>Ɛ muxu xadanxine rawɛkilɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:3">Naxanye xinbiye xuruxurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:3">ɛ ne sɛnbɛ so.<verse eid="ISA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4"/>Naxanye bɔɲɛ bata mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">ɛ a fala ne xa, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">“Ɛ wɛkilɛ, ɛ nama gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">ɛ Ala famaan ni i ra ɛ gbeen ɲɔxɔdeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">Ala ɛ yaxune saranna fima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">a tan yɛtɛɛn yi fa ɛ rakisideni.”<verse eid="ISA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5"/>Nayi, danxutɔne seen toma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:5">tuli xɔrine yi feen mɛ.<verse eid="ISA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6"/>Nayi, sankalatɔne yi tuganɲɛ ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">alo xɛnle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">bobone yi sɔnxɔn nate sɛwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">Amasɔtɔ tigi ige gbeen minima nɛn tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">baane yi mini bɔxɔ xareni.<verse eid="ISA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7"/>Ɲɛmɛnsin wolonxin findima nɛn daraan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">min xɔli yiren yi masara tigi yirene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">Kankone yi xima dɛnaxanye yi nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">gbalan nun tanbinna yi sabati mɛnni.<verse eid="ISA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8"/>Kira gbeen luma mɛnna nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">naxan xili bama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">a “Sariɲanna Kirana.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">Muxu haramuxine mi sigan tima a xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">fɔ a xa findi ne nan gbee ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">naxanye na bira a fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">Xaxilitare yo mi na xɔn sigɛ.<verse eid="ISA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9"/>Yatane mi luma mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:9">sube xaɲɛne mi fɛ na mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:9">E mi toɛ na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:9">Alaa muxu xunbaxine nan sigan tima mɛnni.<verse eid="ISA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10"/>Alatala na naxanye xɔrɔya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">ne fama mɛnna nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">E fama nɛn gbelegbelɛ ɲaxaɲaxani Siyon taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">habadan sɛwan yi e yɛtagini yalan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">Ɲaxaɲaxan nun sɛwan luma nɛn e yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">sunun nun kutunna yi ɲan fefe!<verse eid="ISA 35:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36"/>
  <para style="s">Asiriya mangan yi a kɔnkɔ Yerusalɛn xili ma</para>
  <para style="r">Mangane Firinden 18.13,17-37 e nun Taruxune Firinden 32.9-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1"/>Xesekiyaa mangayaan ɲɛɛ fu nun naanindeni, Asiriya mangan Sɛnakɛribi yi siga Yuda taa makantanxine xili ma, a yi e birin suxu. <verse eid="ISA 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2"/>Asiriya mangan yi a sofa kuntigin nun a gali sɛnbɛmaan nasiga Manga Xesekiya ma Yerusalɛn yi keli Lakisi taani. Sofa kuntigin yi fa Yerusalɛn yi, a sa ti ige ramaraden faxaraxiin dɛxɔn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">36.2</char> Ige ramaraden naxan geyaan na.</note> dugi xane xɛɛ ma kiraan na.<verse eid="ISA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3"/>Nayi, Xiliki a diina Eliyakimi, manga banxi kuntigin yi mini a ralandeni e nun sɛbɛli tiin Sebena nun Asafi a dii xɛmɛn Yowa, mangana yenla. <verse eid="ISA 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4"/>Sofa kuntigin yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ a fala Xesekiya xa, ɛ naxa, ‘Asiriya manga gbeena ito nan falaxi, a naxa: I yigi saxi nanse ma? <verse eid="ISA 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5"/>I yengi a ma a fɛrɛn nun sɛnbɛna i yii, i yɛngɛn so, koni fala fuun nan na ra. Nayi, i ya lannayaan saxi nanse yi han i murutɛ n xili ma? <verse eid="ISA 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6"/>I ya lannayaan saxi Misiran nin, a mɛn kaane xa ɛ mali. Na luxi nɛn alo muxun na la xayen na a dunganna ra naxan girama, a yi a yiin xaba. Naxan na a digan a yi, na a maxɔlɔma nɛn. Misiran mangan na kii nin muxune xa naxanye e taxuma a ra. <verse eid="ISA 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7"/>Waxatina nde ɛ falama nɛn n xa, ɛ naxa, “Alatala, nxɔ Ala, nxu nxu taxuxi na nan na.” Koni, Xesekiya bata yi Ala batudene kala geyaan fari, a yi a fala Yuda kaane nun Yerusalɛn kaane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xinbi sinma nɛn yire sariɲanxini ito yɛtagi.” <verse eid="ISA 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8"/>Iki, ɛ nun n kanna Asiriya mangan xa lan fena nde ma, n soo wuli firin soɛ ɛ yii, xa ɛ nɔɛ soo ragine sɔtɛ. <verse eid="ISA 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9"/>Ɛ mi n kanna walikɛɛn keden peen nɔɛ, hali naxan xurun e birin xa. Ɛ lannayaan saxi Misiran yi soo ragine nun wontorone nan ma fe ra. <verse eid="ISA 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10"/>A yɛtɛna, n faxi yamanani ito kaladeni Alatala sagoon nan xanbi ba? Alatala yɛtɛɛn nan a falaxi n xa, a n xa sa yamanani ito yɛngɛ, n yi a raxɔri.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11"/>Nayi, Eliyakimi nun Sebena nun Yowa yi a fala sofa kuntigin xa, e naxa, “Falan ti nxu xa Arami xuini, amasɔtɔ nxu a mɛma, nxu mi falan tima Heburu xuini yamaan yi a mɛ naxanye yinna xuntagi.” <verse eid="ISA 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12"/>Sofa kuntigin yi e yabi, a naxa, “N kanna n nafaxi ɛ tan nun ɛ kanna nan ma falani itoe tideni ba? Muxun naxanye dɔxi yinna xuntagi, ne fan xa a mɛ nɛn bayo ne fan e gbiin donma nɛn, e yi e xɔnla min ɛ xɔn yɛngɛni.”<verse eid="ISA 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13"/>Nayi, sofa kuntigin to a maso, a yi a xuini te Heburu xuini, a naxa, “Ɛ manga gbeen xuine ramɛ, Asiriya mangana! <verse eid="ISA 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14"/>Mangana ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Ɛ nama tin Xesekiya xa ɛ mayenden, a mi nɔɛ ɛ rakisɛ n ma mumɛ. <verse eid="ISA 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15"/>Xesekiya nama a liga ɛ yi ɛ lannayaan sa Alatala yi, a yi a falɛ a Alatala ɛ ratangama nɛn, a taani ito mi sama Asiriya mangan sagoni. <verse eid="ISA 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16"/>Ɛ nama ɛ tuli mati Xesekiya xuiin na mumɛ, amasɔtɔ Asiriya mangana ito nan falaxi, a naxa: Ɛ bɔɲɛ xunbenla fen n na, ɛ xɛtɛ n ma, birin a yii se nun a bogise donɲɛ, birin yi a ige ramaraden igen min, <verse eid="ISA 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17"/>han n yi fa, n yi ɛ xali yamana gbɛtɛ yi alo ɛ gbeena, murutun nun manpa bili nakɔne yamanan naxan yi, bogiseen nun burun yamanan naxan yi. <verse eid="ISA 36:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18"/>Nayi, ɛ nama tin Xesekiya xa ɛ mayenden, a fala a Alatala ɛ xunbama nɛn. Siya gbɛtɛne alane Asiriya mangani kala nɛn e yamanan suxu feen ma ba? <verse eid="ISA 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19"/>Xamata taan nun Arapada taana, ne alane minɛn? Sefarawayimi alane minɛn? E Samari xunba nɛn n yii ba? <verse eid="ISA 36:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20"/>Yamanane alane yɛ, nde a yamanan xunba n yii? Alatala xa Yerusalɛn xunba n yii di?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21"/>Naxanye birin yi na, ne yi dundu, e mi yabi keden peen ti, amasɔtɔ Manga Xesekiyaa yamarin nan yi na ra. <verse eid="ISA 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22"/>Xiliki a dii xɛmɛna Eliyakimi, mangana banxi kuntigin nun sɛbɛli tiin Sebena nun Asafi a dii xɛmɛn Yowa, mangana yenla, ne yi fa Xesekiya fɛma, e dugine yibɔxi e ma sununi, e sofa kuntigina falane yɛba a xa.<verse eid="ISA 36:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37"/>
  <para style="s">Xesekiya yi Nabi Esayi maxɔdin</para>
  <para style="r">Mangane Firinden 19.1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1"/>Manga Xesekiya to na mɛ, a yi a dugine yibɔ a ma, a kasa bɛnbɛli dugin nagodo a ma sununi, a siga Alatala Batu Banxini. <verse eid="ISA 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2"/>A yi Eliyakimi rasiga, mangana banxi kuntigina e nun Sebena, sɛbɛli tiina e nun saraxarali fonne, kasa bɛnbɛli dugin nagodoxi e ma sununi siga Nabi Esayi konni, Amɔsi a dii xɛmɛna. <verse eid="ISA 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3"/>E yi a fala nabiin xa, e naxa, “Xesekiya naxa iki: ‘Kɔntɔfinla nun tɔrɔn nun yagi lɔxɔn nan to ra nxu xa, diin bari waxatin bata a li, koni fanga mi a nga ra a yi a bari. <verse eid="ISA 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4"/>Alatala, i ya Ala bata Asiriya sofa kuntigina falane birin namɛ, naxan kari a rafaxi habadan Alatala konbideni. Xa Ala tin, Alatala, i ya Ala a ɲaxankatama nɛn a falane fe ra a naxanye tixi. Nayi, i tan Esayi xa Ala maxandi yama dɔnxɛna fe ra.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5"/>Manga Xesekiyaa xɛrane to siga Esayi fɛma, <verse eid="ISA 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6"/>Esayi yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ ito nan falama ɛ kanna xa, ɛ naxa, ‘Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa: I falan naxanye mɛxi i nama gaxu ne fe ra, Asiriya mangana walikɛne n nayelefu falan naxanye tixi. <verse eid="ISA 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7"/>N xaxinla nde rasoma a yi nɛn, a na xibarun mɛ waxatin naxan yi, a xɛtɛma nɛn a yamanani. N yi sa a faxa silanfanna ra mɛnni.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asiriya mangan mɔn yi a kɔnkɔ Yerusalɛn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8"/>Asiriya sofa kuntigin yi a mɛ a kanna bata yi keli Lakisi taani siga Libina yɛngɛdeni, a fa a li mɛnna nin. <verse eid="ISA 37:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9"/>Nayi, Asiriya mangan yi a mɛ a Misiran mangan Tirihaka, Kusi kaan fama a yɛngɛdeni. A na fe mɛxina, a yi xɛrane rasiga Xesekiya ma, a naxa, <verse eid="ISA 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10"/>“Ɛ sa ito fala Yuda mangan Xesekiya xa, ɛ naxa, ‘I laxi i ya Ala ra ɲaxi ra, i yengi a ma a nɔɛ nɛn n tan Asiriya mangani kalɛ Yerusalɛn yɛngɛdeni. I nama tin Ala yi i mayenden. <verse eid="ISA 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11"/>I bata a mɛ Asiriya mangane feen naxanye ligaxi yamanan bonne ra, e e raxɔrixi kii naxan yi. I yengi a ma a i xunbɛ nɛn na ma ba? <verse eid="ISA 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12"/>N benbane siyaan naxanye alane raxɔri, ne e xunba nɛn ba, Gosan nun Xarani nun Resefi yamanane, e nun Eden kaan naxanye Telasara taani? <verse eid="ISA 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13"/>Manga Xamata nun Manga Arapada nun Sefarawayimi taa mangana hanma Hena, hanma Iwa, ne mangane minɛn yi?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xesekiyaa Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="r">Mangane Firinden 19.14-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14"/>Xesekiya yi kɛdi sɛbɛxin nasuxu xɛrane yii, a yi a xaran. Na xanbi ra, a te Alatala Batu Banxini, a sa kɛdin sa Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="ISA 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15"/>Xesekiya yi Alatala maxandi, a naxa, <verse eid="ISA 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16"/>“Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna, Isirayilaa Ala, naxan dɔxi maleka sawurane tagi! I tan Ala keden peen nan bɔxɔ xɔnna mangayane birin xun na, i tan nan bɔxɔn nun kuyen daxi. <verse eid="ISA 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17"/>Alatala, i tuli mati n na, i n xuiin namɛ. Alatala, i yɛɛne rabi, i n mato. I Sɛnakɛribi a falani itoe birin namɛ, a sofa kuntigin naxanye rafaxi habadan Ala konbideni. <verse eid="ISA 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18"/>Alatala, ɲɔndin na a ra! Asiriya Mangan bata siyane raxɔri, a yi e bɔxɔne kala. <verse eid="ISA 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19"/>E bata e alane woli tɛɛni, bayo Ala mi yi e ra nun mumɛ, muxune yii funfune nan yi e ra, wudine nun gɛmɛ masolixine nan tun yi e ra. <verse eid="ISA 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20"/>Iki, Alatala, nxɔ Ala! Nxu xunba Sɛnakɛribi yii, alogo bɔxɔ xɔnna yamanane birin xa a kolon a i tan keden peen nan Ala ra, Alatala!”<verse eid="ISA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛnakɛribi a fe yi kala</para>
  <para style="r">Mangane Firindena 19.20-37 Taruxune Firinden 32.20-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21"/>Nayi, Esayi, Amɔsi a dii xɛmɛn yi xɛraan nasiga a faladeni Xesekiya xa, a naxa, “Isirayilaa Ala, Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa: N bata i ya maxandi xuiin mɛ i naxan tixi n ma Sɛnakɛribi a fe yi, Asiriya mangana. <verse eid="ISA 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22"/>Alatala falani ito nan tixi Sɛnakɛribi xili ma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">‘Siyon taa faɲin bata i raɲaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">a i magelema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">Yerusalɛn kaane e xunna fitifitima i xanbi ra.<verse eid="ISA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23"/>I nde konbixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">i a rayelefu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">I xuini texi nde xili ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">I bata i yɛɛne rate kore Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin xili ma!<verse eid="ISA 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24"/>Fata i ya xɛrane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">n tan Marigina, i bata n konbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">I yi a fala, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">“N ma wontoro wuyaxine xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">n bata te geyane xuntagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">Liban yamanan danne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">N na a wudi kuyene sɛgɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">e nun a suman wudi faɲi faɲine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">N sa a xuntagin naɲanna li</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">e nun a fɔtɔn faɲina.<verse eid="ISA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25"/>N bata xɔɲinne ge yamana gbɛtɛne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:25">n yi e igen min.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:25">N Misiran baa igene birin xɔrima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:25">n na siga a xili ma waxatin naxan yi.”<verse eid="ISA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26"/>Koni, i tan Sɛnakɛribi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">i mi a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">a n feni itoe yɛlanxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">to mi na ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">N yi e yitɔn xabu waxati danguxine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">Iki, n bata yamarin fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">a rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">i xa taa makantanxine lu kalaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">alo gɛmɛ malanxine.<verse eid="ISA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27"/>E muxune sɛnbɛ mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">e gaxuxi, e yagixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">E bata lu alo xɛɛ ma sɛxɛne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">alo se sonle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">alo sɛxɛn fanyen ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">naxan xarama benun a xa gbo.<verse eid="ISA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28"/>Koni, n na a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:28">i na dɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:28">i na mini, i na so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:28">i na xɔlɔ n xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29"/>I bata xɔlɔ n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">n yi i konbi ti xuiin mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">Nanara, n nan n ma wuren birama nɛn i ɲɔɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">n yi n ma karafen bira i dɛ kidine yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">I faxi kiraan naxan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">n yi i raxɛtɛ na xɔn.’<verse eid="ISA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30"/>Ala ito nan falaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">i tan Xesekiya xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">‘Ito xa findi taxamasenna ra i xa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">Bogiseen naxanye solixi e yɛtɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">ɛ bata ne don ɲɛɛni ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">na nan mɔn ligama ɲɛɛ famatɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">koni ɲɛɛ saxandeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">ɛ seen sima nɛn, ɛ yi a xaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">ɛ yi manpa binle si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">ɛ yi e bogine don.<verse eid="ISA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31"/>Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxu dɔnxɛn naxanye na lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:31">ne mɔn e salenne raminima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:31">alo wudina, e bogi.<verse eid="ISA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32"/>A dɔnxɛne minima nɛn Yerusalɛn yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:32">a dɔnxɛne luma nɛn e nii ra Siyon geyane yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:32">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna na nan ligama a xanuntenyani.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛnakɛribi raɲanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33"/>Nanara, Alatala ito nan falaxi Asiriya Mangan ma iki, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">“A mi soɛ taani ito yi mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">A mi xalimakuli wolɛ be yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">A mi makantan wure lefa tima a xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">A mi gbingbin natema a xili ma.”<verse eid="ISA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34"/>Alatalaa falan ni ito ra. A naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:34">“A faxi kiraan naxan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:34">a xɛtɛma nɛn na xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:34">A mi soɛ taani ito yi mumɛ.<verse eid="ISA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35"/>N taani ito makantanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:35">n yi a rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:35">n tan ma fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:35">e nun Dawuda a fe ra, n ma walikɛna.”<verse eid="ISA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36"/>Na xanbi ra, Alatalaa malekan yi mini, a muxu wuli kɛmɛ tonge solomasɛxɛ wuli suulun faxa Asiriya kaane ganli. Yamaan to keli xɔtɔnni, e yi e binbine to. <verse eid="ISA 37:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37"/>Nayi, Asiriya mangan Sɛnakɛribi yi a ganla rakeli, a xɛtɛ Niniwa yi. <verse eid="ISA 37:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38"/>Lɔxɔna nde, Sɛnakɛribi yi xinbi sinxi a ala Nisiroki batu banxini a batudeni, a dii xɛmɛne Adarameleki nun Sareseri yi a faxa silanfanna ra, e yi e gi siga Ararati yamanani. A dii Esaraxadon yi dɔxɔ a ɲɔxɔni.<verse eid="ISA 37:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38"/>
  <para style="s">Xesekiyaa furena fe</para>
  <para style="r">Mangane Firinden 20.1-11 e nun Taruxune Firinden 32.24-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1"/>Na waxatini, saya furen yi Xesekiya suxu. Nabi Esayi, Amɔsi a diin yi fa a fɛma, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘I ya feene yitɔn, amasɔtɔ i faxamatɔɔn ni i ra, i mi fa siimaya sɔtɔma.’ ” <verse eid="ISA 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2"/>Xesekiya yi a yɛɛ rafindi banxin kanken ma, a maxandini ito ti Alatala ma, a naxa, <verse eid="ISA 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3"/>“Alatala, n ma fe xa rabira i ma fa fala, n sigan ti nɛn i yɛtagi lannayaan nun bɔɲɛ faɲiyani, naxan fan i yɛɛ ra yi, n yi na liga!” Xesekiya yi wuga han.<verse eid="ISA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4"/>Nayi, Alatala yi falan ti Esayi xa, a naxa, <verse eid="ISA 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5"/>“Siga, i sa a fala Xesekiya xa, i naxa, ‘I fafe Dawudaa Ala, Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa: N bata i ya maxandi xuiin mɛ, n bata i yɛɛgen to. N mɔn ɲɛɛ fu nun suulun sama nɛn i ya siimayaan fari. <verse eid="ISA 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6"/>N ni i tan nun i ya taan xunbama nɛn Asiriya mangan yii, n taani ito kantanma nɛn.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7"/>Esayi yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Alatala taxamasenni ito nan yitama i ra, alogo i xa a kolon fa fala Alatala naxan falaxi, a na ligama nɛn, a naxa, <verse eid="ISA 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8"/>‘N nininna raxɛtɛma nɛn xanbin na Axasi a banxin teden ma sanna yɛ fu.’ ” Nayi, nininna yi xɛtɛ xanbin na banxin teden ma sanna yɛ fu.<verse eid="ISA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xesekiyaa Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9"/>Yuda mangan Xesekiya bɛtini ito nan sɛbɛ, a to fura, a yi keli furen ma.<verse eid="ISA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10"/>N yi a falama nɛn, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:10">“N nɛɛn fa n ma siimayaan tagiin li tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:10">n sigama nɛn laxira so dɛɛne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:10">n yi bɔnɔ n ma siimayaan lɔxɔ dɔnxɛne yi!”<verse eid="ISA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11"/>N mɔn yi a falama nɛn, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">“N mi fa Alatala toma sɔnɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">niiramane tagi bɔxɔ xɔnna fari, Alatala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">N mɔn mi fa muxu yo toma sɔnɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">muxune yɛ dunuɲa yi!<verse eid="ISA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12"/>N fati bɛndɛna n niin yigiyadeni ito bata kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">a makuya n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">a lu alo xuruse rabana bubuna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">N bata n ma siimayaan mafilin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">alo gɛsɛ wurundunxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">N ma gɛsɛn bata bolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">Xɔtɔnna nun ɲinbanna tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">i n naɲanma nɛn!<verse eid="ISA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13"/>N bata n naxara han xɔtɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">koni alo yatana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">a bata n xɔnne birin yixin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">Yanyin nun kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">i bata n naɲan.<verse eid="ISA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14"/>N wuga xuiin mini nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">alo tuntunna nɛma tuganɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">n lu kutunɲɛ alo ganbana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">N yɛɛne lu nɛn tixi kore tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">n yi lu a falɛ, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">‘Marigina, n ɲaxankataxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">n mali!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15"/>N fa nanse falama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">A bata falan ti n xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">A tan yɛtɛɛn nan feni ito ligaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">N sigan tima nɛn yɛtɛ magodoni n ma siimayaan birin yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">n niin sɔxɔlɛni ito a fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16"/>Marigina, siimayaan sɔtɔma i ya fanna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">n mɔn n nii ra a tan nan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">I bata n sɛnbɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">i yi n nakɛndɛya.<verse eid="ISA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17"/>N ma tɔrɔyaan bata maxɛtɛ bɔɲɛ xunbenla ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">I tan nan n niin masigaxi sayaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">n to rafanxi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">i yi i xun xanbi so n yulubine birin yi.<verse eid="ISA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18"/>Laxira xa mi i tantunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">Sayaan xa mi i matɔxɔ bɛtin bama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">Faxa muxune nɛma sama gaburun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">ne yengi mi fa i ya lannayaan ma.<verse eid="ISA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19"/>Koni naxanye e nii ra, niiramane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:19">ne nan i tantunma alo n tan to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:19">Fafane i ya lannayana fe falama nɛn e diine xa.<verse eid="ISA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20"/>Alatala bata n nakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:20">Nayi, nxu nxɔ maxaseene xuiin naminima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:20">Alatala Batu Banxini nxu siin sogen dɔnxɛn birin yi.<verse eid="ISA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21"/>Esayi bata yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ xɔdɛ bogi yidinxina nde tongo, ɛ a sa a furen dɛ, a yalanma nɛn.” <verse eid="ISA 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22"/>Xesekiya bata yi a fala, a naxa, “N na kolonma taxamasenna mundun xɔn fa fala a n sigama Alatala Batu Banxini?”<verse eid="ISA 38:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39"/>
  <para style="s">Babilɔn xɛrane</para>
  <para style="r">Mangane Firinden 20.12-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1"/>Na waxatini, Babilɔn Manga Baladan ma dii xɛmɛn Merodaki-Baladan yi bataxin nun finma seen nasiga Xesekiya ma, amasɔtɔ a bata yi a fure feen nun a kɛndɛyana fe mɛ nun. <verse eid="ISA 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2"/>Xesekiya yi xɛrane rasɛnɛ, a yi a banxin kui seene birin yita e ra: gbeti fixɛn nun xɛmana, wudi bogi ture faɲine nun latikɔnɔnna nun a yɛngɛ so seene ramaradena, e nun naxan birin yi a nafulu ramaradeni. Sese mi lu Xesekiyaa banxini a mi naxan yita e ra e nun a bɔxɔn birin.<verse eid="ISA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3"/>Nabi Esayi mɔn yi fa Manga Xesekiya fɛma, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Muxuni itoe nanse falaxi i xa? E kelixi minɛn?” Xesekiya yi a yabi, a naxa, “E kelixi yamana makuyen nin, Babilɔn.” <verse eid="ISA 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4"/>Esayi mɔn yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “E i ya banxin to nɛn?” Xesekiya yi a yabi, a naxa, “Seen naxanye birin n ma banxin kui, e ne birin to nɛn. Sese mi n ma nafulu ramaradeni, n mi naxan yitaxi e ra.”<verse eid="ISA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5"/>Nayi, Esayi yi a fala Xesekiya xa, a naxa, “Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan namɛ! <verse eid="ISA 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6"/>Waxati fama, seen naxanye birin i ya banxini e nun i benbane naxanye fen han to, e ne birin xalima nɛn Babilɔn yi, sese mi luma. Alatalaa falan nan na ra. <verse eid="ISA 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7"/>E i ya dii xɛmɛna ndee tongoma nɛn, i yɛtɛɛn naxanye sɔtɔma, alogo e xa findi Babilɔn mangana banxin xɛmɛ tɛgɛnne ra.” <verse eid="ISA 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8"/>Xesekiya yi Esayi yabi, a naxa, “I Alatalaa falan naxan tixi, a fan.” A mirixi a ma, a naxa, “En luma nɛn bɔɲɛ xunbenli e nun marakantanni n ma siimayani.”<verse eid="ISA 39:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa yamaan xunba fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1"/>Ɛ Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:1">“Ɛ n ma yamaan madɛndɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:1">ɛ a madɛndɛn!<verse eid="ISA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2"/>Ɛ Yerusalɛn kaane ralimaniya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">ɛ a rali e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">a e ɲaxankata wanle bata ɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">A e bata mafelu e hakɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">e bata yelin e yulubine saranna sɔtɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">Alatala yii han dɔxɔ firin!”<verse eid="ISA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3"/>Muxuna nde xuiin minima, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:3">“Ɛ kirani tɔn Alatala yɛɛ ra tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:3">ɛ kira tinxinxin nafala en ma Ala xa burunna ra!<verse eid="ISA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4"/>Ɛ folone birin naxutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">ɛ geyane nun yire matexine birin wuru.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">Yire tintinxine yi matinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">gɛmɛ yirene yi findi lantane ra.<verse eid="ISA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5"/>Nayi, Alatalaa binyen minima nɛn kɛnɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:5">daala birin yi a to!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:5">Alatala dɛ xuiin nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6"/>Muxuna nde a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">a naxa, “I xui ramini!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">N yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">“N xa nanse fala?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">A naxa, “Adamadiine birin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">alo sɛxɛna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">e binyen birin yi lu alo se fugena.<verse eid="ISA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7"/>Alatala dɛ foyen na dangu sɛxɛne fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:7">e xarama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:7">e fugene yi yolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:7">Yamaan luxi nɛn alo sɛxɛna yati!<verse eid="ISA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8"/>Sɛxɛne xarama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:8">e fugene yi yolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:8">koni en ma Alaa falan luma nɛn habadan.”<verse eid="ISA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xibaru faɲina fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9"/>Ɛ tan Siyon kaan naxanye sa xibaru faɲin xɛrayani bama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">ɛ te geya matexin fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">ɛ xuini te han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">ɛ tan Yerusalɛn kaan naxanye sa xibaru faɲin xɛrayani bama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">Ɛ xuini te, ɛ nama gaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">Ɛ a fala Yuda yamanan taane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">ɛ naxa, “Ɛ Ala ni i ra!”<verse eid="ISA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10"/>A mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">Marigina Alatala fama fangani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">A mangayaan nabama a sɛnbɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">A fama a yama xunbaxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">a naxan sɔtɔxi a kɔntɔnna ra.<verse eid="ISA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11"/>A a yamaan masuxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">alo xuruse rabana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">A yɛxɛɛ diine tongoma nɛn a yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">a yi e xali a yii kanke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">a ti e ngane yɛɛ ra a fanni.<verse eid="ISA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala dangu seen birin na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12"/>Nde fɔxɔ igene saxi a yiin kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">a yi e maliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">a kore xɔnna danne maliga a yiin na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">Nde bɔxɔn bɛndɛn yatɛxi deben kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">a geyane yiliga sikeela ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">a yire matexine binyan yatɛn kolon ligaseen xɔn?<verse eid="ISA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13"/>Nde Alatala miriyane kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:13">Nde nɔɛ findɛ a kawandi muxun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:13">a yi a rakɔta?<verse eid="ISA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14"/>Ala nde maxɔdinxi a maxadi feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">alogo a xa xaxinla sɔtɔ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Nde a xaranxi kiti kɛndɛ saan ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Nde a xaranxi fekolonna ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Nde xaxilimayaan kiraan yitaxi a ra?<verse eid="ISA 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15"/>Siyane luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">alo igen dindinna palanna kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">E mi yatɛxi se ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">alo gbangbanna na sa sikeela fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">Fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne yelefu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">alo gbangbanna naxan tema.<verse eid="ISA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16"/>Liban yamanan subene birin xurun saraxan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:16">naxan yi daxa nun a ba Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:16">a wudine mi wuya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:16">naxanye findɛ saraxa gan tɛɛn yegene ra.<verse eid="ISA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17"/>Sese mi siyane ra a yɛɛ ra yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:17">Ala ne yatɛxi fufafuun nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:17">A yigenla fisa e xa!<verse eid="ISA 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18"/>Ɛ waxi Ala sa feni nde ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:18">Ɛ sawuran mundun yitɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:18">e nun naxan maliga?<verse eid="ISA 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19"/>Xabun nan sawuran nafalama suxuren na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">xɛma wanla yi xɛmaan sa a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">a yi kɔɛ bira yɔlɔnxɔn wure gbeti daxine rafala.<verse eid="ISA 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20"/>Yiigelitɔɔn naxan mi nɔɛ na sɔtɛ a gbee ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">na kanna wudi xɔdɛxɛn nan sugandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">a yi xabu kesuxin fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">na yi suxuren nafala a xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">naxan mi kalama.<verse eid="ISA 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21"/>Ɛ mi a kolon ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Ɛ mi a mɛxi ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">A mi ralixi ɛ ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">xabu a fɔlɔni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Bɔxɔn bɛtɛn saxi kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">ɛ munma na famu ba?<verse eid="ISA 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22"/>A tan nan dɔxi bɔxɔ xɔri digilinxin xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">muxune fan luxi a yɛɛ ra yi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">alo suɲɛne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">A kore xɔnni fulunma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">alo dugi yelefuxina xunna soon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">alo gagena a dɔxɔden na.<verse eid="ISA 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23"/>A tan nan kuntigine sɛnbɛn kalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:23">e lu fuyan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:23">a yi bɔxɔ xɔnna kitisane lu fuu.<verse eid="ISA 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24"/>E luxi nɛn alo sansina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">E nɛɛn fa si tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">e na woli xɛɛn ma tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">salen yɛtɛ mi e binle ma singen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">Alaa foyen yi fa e ma, e xara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">wuluwunla yi e xali alo se dagina.<verse eid="ISA 40:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25"/>Ala sariɲanxin naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:25">“Ɛ n misalima nde ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:25">nxu nun naxan lan?”<verse eid="ISA 40:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26"/>Ɛ yɛɛne rate kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">ɛ a mato!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Nde na seene daxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Nde e ganla dɛfexin naminima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">a yi e birin xili e xinla ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Fata a fanga gbeen nun a sɛnbɛ magaxuxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">keden peen mi dasama.<verse eid="ISA 40:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala nan fangan fima muxune ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27"/>Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">nanfera ɛ a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">Isirayila yixɛtɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">nanfera ɛ a falama, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">“Nxɔ kiraan bata luxun Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">nxɔ Ala mi fa nxu xun mafala kitin sama?”<verse eid="ISA 40:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28"/>I mi a kolon ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">I mi a mɛxi ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">Alatala nan habadan Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">naxan bɔxɔn danne birin daxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">A mi xadanma, a mi taganma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">A xaxilimayaan mi nɔɛ fɛsɛfɛsɛ!<verse eid="ISA 40:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29"/>A fangan fima muxu xadanxine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:29">a muxu taganxine sɛnbɛn xun masa.<verse eid="ISA 40:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30"/>Banxulanne yɛtɛɛn xadanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:30">e tagan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:30">foningene yi bira xadanni.<verse eid="ISA 40:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31"/>Koni naxanye xaxili tixi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">ne mɔn sɛnbɛn sɔtɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">E tuganma nɛn alo singbinna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">e yi e gi, e mi xadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">e lu sigan tiyɛ, e mi tagan.<verse eid="ISA 40:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nun suxurene fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1"/>Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">“Ɛ tan fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔn muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">ɛ dundu alogo ɛ xa n xuiin namɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">Ɛ tan yamanane muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">ɛ wɛkilɛn sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">ɛ maso, ɛ falan ti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">En kitin sa en tagi.<verse eid="ISA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2"/>Nde muxuna nde rakelixi sogeteden binni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">41.2</char> Yanyina nde, a Kirusi nan ma fe falama be, Perisene mangan naxan Babilɔn kaane nɔ yɛngɛni. Na feen mato Taruxune Firinden 36.22-23 kui.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">a yi a xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">a xa lu tinxinna fɔxɔ ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">Nde siyane soxi a yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">a mangane xuru a bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">a silanfanna yi e findi burunburunna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">a xanla yi e findi se dagin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">foyen naxan xalima!<verse eid="ISA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3"/>A muxune sagatanma yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:3">a mɔn yi dangu bɔɲɛ xunbenli kiraan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:3">a munma yi a sanna ti dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4"/>Nde feni itoe rakamalixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">a tan naxan yi mayixɛtɛne maxilima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">xabu a fɔlɔni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">N tan Alatala nan a fɔlɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">n mɔn luma nɛn a raɲanni.”<verse eid="ISA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5"/>Fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne muxune bata a to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:5">e gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:5">bɔxɔn danne muxune xuruxurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:5">e birin bata keli, e fama.<verse eid="ISA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6"/>Birin a bode malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:6">birin a falama a lanfaan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:6">a naxa, “I wɛkilɛ!”<verse eid="ISA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7"/>Yii rafalan fan xabun sɛnbɛ soma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">naxan wuren malaxunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">na xabun nawɛkilɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">a yi a fala suxuren nafala kiin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">a naxa, “A lanxi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">A yi suxuren gbangban</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">alogo a nama bira.<verse eid="ISA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marigin yi Isirayila xunba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8"/>Koni ɛ tan, Isirayila yixɛtɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">n ma walikɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">Yaxuba yixɛtɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">n naxanye sugandixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">ɛ tan Iburahima bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">n xɔyina,<verse eid="ISA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9"/>n sa ɛ tan nan fenxi bɔxɔn danne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">n sa ɛ tan nan xilixi bɔxɔn tongonne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">n na a falaxi ɛ tan nan xa, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">“N ma walikɛɛn nan ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">n bata ɛ sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">n mi n mɛxi ɛ ra.”<verse eid="ISA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10"/>Nayi, ɛ nama gaxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">amasɔtɔ n na ɛ xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">Ɛ nama kɔntɔfili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">amasɔtɔ ɛ Ala nan n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">N na ɛ sɛnbɛn gboma ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">n yi ɛ mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">n yi ti ɛ bun sɛnbɛn nun tinxinni.<verse eid="ISA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11"/>Naxanye birin yi kelixi ɛ xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">ne yagima nɛn e xun sin!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">Naxanye yɛngɛn nakelixi ɛ xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">ne luma nɛn fufafu, e raxɔri.<verse eid="ISA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12"/>Ɛ ɛ yɛngɛfane fenma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:12">koni ɛ mi fa e toma sɔnɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:12">Naxanye yi ɛ yɛngɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:12">ne luma nɛn fuu.<verse eid="ISA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13"/>Amasɔtɔ n tan nan Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">ɛ Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">naxan ɛ yiifari ma yiin suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">n yi a fala ɛ xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">n naxa, “Ɛ nama gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">n tan nan ɛ malima.”<verse eid="ISA 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14"/>Alatalaa falan ni ito ra, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">“Ɛ tan Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">ɛ tan naxanye luxi alo kunla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">ɛ nama gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">ɛ tan Isirayila muxudine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">n tan nan ɛ malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">n tan Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin naxan ɛ xunbama.<verse eid="ISA 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15"/>A mato, n bata i findi ɲingen xɛɛ ra bɔnbɔ seen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">wure ɲin wuyaxin naxan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">naxanye nɛnɛ a ra, e ɲɔɛ raminixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">I geyane wuruma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">i yi e raxuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">i yi yire matexine liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">alo se dagina.<verse eid="ISA 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16"/>I e yifema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">foyen yi siga e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">wuluwulu gbeen yi e raxuya ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">I tan ɲaxanma nɛn Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">i yi i kanba Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxini.”<verse eid="ISA 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tonbonna findima ige yiren na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17"/>Yiigelitɔne nun tɔrɔ muxune igen fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">koni sese mi na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">Min xɔnla bata e lɛnna maxara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">Koni n tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">Alatala, n na e yabima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">n tan, Isirayilaa Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">n mi e rabeɲinɲɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18"/>N baa igen nafama nɛn yire matexi magenle fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">n yi ige xunne ramini mɛrɛmɛrɛne tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">n tonbonne findi darane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">bɔxɔ xaren yi findi tigi yiren na.<verse eid="ISA 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19"/>N suman binle nun kasiya binle sima nɛn tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:19">e nun miriti binle nun oliwi binle.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:19">Ige mi yiren naxanye yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:19">n fɔfɔne nun gbinɲɛne nun xarinne si mɛnne yi e bode xɔn,<verse eid="ISA 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20"/>alogo e xa a to, e yi a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">e yi a rakɔrɔsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">e birin yi a famu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">a Alatala nan feni itoe birin ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">a Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin nan e rakamalixi.<verse eid="ISA 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suxurene tɔnɔ mi na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21"/>Alatala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:21">“Ɛ fa ɛ xun mafala kitini.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:21">Yaxubaa Mangan naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:21">“Ɛ fa ɛ xɔn ba.”<verse eid="ISA 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22"/>Ɛ suxurene xa fa a fala en xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">naxan fama ligadeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">Ɛ a fala nxu xa feen naxanye bata liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">alogo nxu xa nxu miri e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">nxu yi e raɲan kiin kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">Xanamu, ɛ a yita nxu ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">naxan fama ligadeni.<verse eid="ISA 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23"/>Ɛ waxati famatɔne fe fala nxu xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">Nayi nxu a kolonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">a alane nan ɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">Ɛ fena nde liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">xa a findi a faɲin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">hanma a ɲaxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">alogo nxu birin xa na to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">gaxun yi nxu suxu.<verse eid="ISA 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24"/>Koni na yigenla fisa ɛ xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:24">ɛ wanle mi sese ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:24">Naxan na ɛ sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:24">muxu haramuxin nan na kanna ra.<verse eid="ISA 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25"/>N bata muxuna nde rakeli sogeteden kɔmɛnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">a fama nɛn sa keli sogeteden binni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">naxan n maxandima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">A mangane yibodonma alo borona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">alo fɛɲɛ rafalan fɛɲɛ bɛndɛni bodonma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26"/>Nayi, nde bata yi na feen fala a fɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">alogo en xa a kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Nde a fala benun a xa liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">alogo en xa a fala, en naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">“A ɲɔndi”?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Muxu yo mi sese fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">feni ito mi falaxi benun a xa liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">muxe mi ɛ fala yo mɛxi.<verse eid="ISA 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27"/>Koni n singe nan a fala Siyon taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">n naxa, “A mato, e tan ni i ra!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">N bata xɛrana nde fi Yerusalɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">naxan fama xibaru faɲin na.<verse eid="ISA 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28"/>Anu n mi kawandi muxu yo toxi suxureni itoe yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">n na maxɔdinna ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">e mi n yabima.<verse eid="ISA 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29"/>A mato sese mi e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:29">E wanle mi sese ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:29">E suxurene findixi foyen nun fe fuun nan na.<verse eid="ISA 41:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa walikɛna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1"/>N ma walikɛɛn ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">n naxan sɛnbɛ soma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">n naxan sugandixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">naxan n kɛnɛnxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">N na n ma Nii Sariɲanxin sama nɛn a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">a yi kiti kɛndɛn sa siyane xun na.<verse eid="ISA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2"/>A mi sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:2">a mi a xuini tɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:2">a mi falan tiyɛ taan xun xɔn,<verse eid="ISA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3"/>a mi xaye yidɔxini girɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:3">A mi lɛnpun tumatɔɔn natuyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:3">Koni, a kiti kɛndɛn sama nɛn ɲɔndin xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4"/>A mi xadanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">a mi tunnaxɔlɔma a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">han a yi fa kiti kɛndɛn na bɔxɔ xɔnna fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">han fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne muxune fan yi e yigi sa a sariyani.<verse eid="ISA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, Ala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">naxan kore xɔnna daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">a yi a yibandun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">naxan bɔxɔn nun a yi seene daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">a niiraxinla bira adamadiine yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">naxanye dɔxi a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">a niin bira ne yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">naxanye sigan tima a fari, a naxa,<verse eid="ISA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6"/>“N tan Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">n tan nan i xilixi tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">n yi i suxu i yii ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">n yi i makantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">n yi n yengi lu i xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">N ni i findi n ma yamaan layirin xidi muxun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">e nun kɛnɛnna siyane xa,<verse eid="ISA 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7"/>alogo i xa danxutɔne yɛɛne rabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:7">i yi suxu muxune ramini kasoon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:7">i yi kasorasane xɔrɔya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:7">e mini dimini.”<verse eid="ISA 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8"/>“Alatala nan n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">n xinla nan na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">N mi n ma binyen soma gbɛtɛ yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">N mi n ma tantunna fiyɛ suxurene ma.<verse eid="ISA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9"/>Fe singene bata yelin kamalɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">n fe nɛnɛne nan ma fe ralima ɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">benun e xa fɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">n xa ɛ rakolon ne ma.”<verse eid="ISA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛti nɛnɛna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10"/>Ɛ bɛti nɛnɛn ba Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">bɔxɔn danne birin xa a tantun bɛtini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">ɛ tan naxanye sigama fɔxɔ igen xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">e nun a yi seene birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne nun e muxune birin.<verse eid="ISA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11"/>Tonbonna nun a taane xa e xuini te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">e nun Kedari bɔnsɔnna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">42.11</char> <char style="fk">Kedari</char> findixi Sumayilaa diin nan na. Na feen sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 25.13 kui.</note> dɔxɔdene!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">Sela kaane xa gbelegbele sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">e xa sɔnxɔ ɲaxaɲaxani geyane xuntagi!<verse eid="ISA 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12"/>Binyen xa fi Alatala ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:12">A xa tantun fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne birin yi!<verse eid="ISA 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13"/>Alatala minima nɛn alo sofa wɛkilɛxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">a bɔɲɛn tema nɛn alo yɛngɛ so sɛnbɛmana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">A sɔnxɔma nɛn yaxune xili ma yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">a yi e nɔ.<verse eid="ISA 42:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14"/>Xabu waxati xunkuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">n dunduxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">n naxaraxi, n na n yɛtɛ suxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">Koni iki, n sɔxɔlɛxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">alo ɲaxanla nɛma tinna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">n gbelegbelema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">n kutunma ɲaxankatani.<verse eid="ISA 42:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15"/>N geyane nun yire matexine kalama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">n yi e se ɲingine birin xara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">N baane findima nɛn tonbonne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">n yi darane xɔri.<verse eid="ISA 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16"/>N danxutɔne rasigama nɛn kiraan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">e mi naxan kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">E yengi mi kiraan naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">n yi ti e yɛɛ ra ne xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">n yi dimin findi kɛnɛnna ra e yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">n gɛmɛ yirene findi lantaan na e xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">N na nan ligama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">n mi e rabeɲinɲɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 42:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17"/>Koni naxanye e yigi sama suxurene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">e yi a fala sawurane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">e naxa, “Nxɔ alane nan ɛ ra,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">ne xɛtɛma nɛn e xanbi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">e yagi.<verse eid="ISA 42:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila yama tondixina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18"/>Ɛ tan tuli xɔrine, ɛ tuli mati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:18">Ɛ tan danxutɔne, ɛ yɛɛn ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:18">ɛ seen to!<verse eid="ISA 42:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19"/>Danxutɔna nde ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">xa n ma walikɛɛn xa mi a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Tuli xɔrina nde ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">alo n xɛraan naxan nasigaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Danxutɔna nde ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">alo n bɔɲɛ xunbenla fixi naxan ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Danxutɔna nde ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">alo Alatalaa walikɛna?<verse eid="ISA 42:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20"/>I bata fe gbegbe to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:20">koni i mi e famuxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:20">I tunle rabixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:20">koni e mi feen mɛma!<verse eid="ISA 42:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21"/>Alatalaa tinxinna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:21">a bata a kɛnɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:21">a xa a sariyan gboon nun a nɔrɔn makɛnɛn.<verse eid="ISA 42:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22"/>Anu, yama yiigelitɔ halagixini ito mato!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">E bata e birin suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">e birin balanxi yinle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">e birin saxi kasoon na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">E yii seene bata suxu yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">muxe mi na naxan e xunbɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">E yɛtɛɛn bata findi se suxin na yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">muxe mi na naxan a falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">a naxa, “Ne raxɛtɛ!”<verse eid="ISA 42:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23"/>Nde a tuli matima ito ra ɛ yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:23">Nde a ligama a yeren ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:23">to xanbi ra, a yi a tuli mati?<verse eid="ISA 42:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24"/>Nde Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna soxi a yaxune yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">a Isirayila so halagi tiine yii?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">Alatala xa mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">en naxan yulubi tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">en mi tin birɛ naxan ma kira fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">en tondi a sariyane suxɛ?<verse eid="ISA 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25"/>Nayi, a yi a xɔlɔ gbeen nagodo e fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">alo tɛɛna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">e nun yɛngɛn gbalone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">A yi e gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">koni e mi sese famuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">a yi e raxɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">koni e mi na feen yatɛ e bɔɲɛni.<verse eid="ISA 42:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43"/>
  <para style="s">Alatala nan Isirayila xunbama</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1"/>Ala naxan i daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">naxan i rafalaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">Isirayila bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">Alatala ito nan falaxi iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">a naxa, “I nama gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">amasɔtɔ n bata i xunba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">N bata i xili i xinla ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">N tan nan gbee i ra!<verse eid="ISA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2"/>Xa i danguma fɔxɔ igeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">n luma nɛn i xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">Xa i danguma baane yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">i mi i maminɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">Xa i danguma tɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">a mi i ganɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">tɛɛ dɛgɛn mi i raxɔrɛ.<verse eid="ISA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">i ya Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">i rakisimana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">N bata Misiran yamanan fi i xunbaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">n yi Kusi yamanan nun Sɛba yamanan findi i ɲɔxɔn na.<verse eid="ISA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4"/>Bayo i yatɛxi n xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">i binyaxi n yɛɛ ra yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">n bata i xanu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">N bata muxune findi i ɲɔxɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">n yi yamane fi i niin xunbaan na.”<verse eid="ISA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5"/>“I nama gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">amasɔtɔ n luma nɛn i xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">N fama nɛn i yixɛtɛne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">sa keli sogeteden binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">n yi sa e malan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">keli sogegododen binni.<verse eid="ISA 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6"/>N na a falama nɛn kɔmɛnna binna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">n naxa, ‘E beɲin!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">N yi a fala yiifanna binna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">n naxa, ‘I nama e makankan!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">Fa n ma dii xɛmɛne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">sa keli yire makuyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">e nun n ma dii tɛmɛne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">sa keli bɔxɔn danne ra,<verse eid="ISA 43:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7"/>n xinla falama naxanye birin xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:7">n naxanye daxi n ma binyena fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:7">n naxanye rafalaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:7">n yi e da.”<verse eid="ISA 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8"/>Yamani ito ramini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">naxanye danxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">anu e yɛɛne fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">tuli xɔrini itoe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">naxanye tunle fan.<verse eid="ISA 43:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9"/>Siyane birin xa e malan e bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">yamanane muxune birin!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Nde na fe falaxi e yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">benun a xa liga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Nde fe fonne ralixi en ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">E xa fa e serene ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">e yi a mayita a yoona e xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">En xa e xuiin namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">alogo muxune xa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">e naxa, “E ɲɔndi!”<verse eid="ISA 43:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10"/>Alatalaa falan ni ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">a naxa, “Ɛ tan nan n serene ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">ɛ tan naxanye findixi n ma walikɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">n naxanye sugandixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">alogo ɛ xa n kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">ɛ yi la n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">N tan yi na yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">benun suxure yo xa rafala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">ala gbɛtɛ yo mi na n tan xanbi.<verse eid="ISA 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11"/>N tan nan Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:11">n tan yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:11">Ba n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:11">marakisi ti gbɛtɛ yo mi na.<verse eid="ISA 43:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12"/>N tan nan feene makɛnɛnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">n muxune rakisi, n yi ɛ rakolon!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">Ala xɔɲɛ mi a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">naxan ɛ tagi fɔ n tan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">Nayi, n serene nan ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">fa fala n tan nan Ala ra.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 43:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13"/>“N tan yatigin nan na ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">xabu a fɔlɔni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">Muxu yo mi nɔɛ muxun bɛ n yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">N na naxan liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">nde nɔɛ a rakalɛ ayi?”<verse eid="ISA 43:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa kininkininna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, naxan ɛ xunbama, Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">“N muxuna nde rasigama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">Babilɔn yamanan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">ɛ tan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">N yi Babilɔn muxu gixine kunkine kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">e yi e mamin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">e yi e kanbama naxanye yi nun.<verse eid="ISA 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15"/>Alatala nan n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:15">ɛ Ala sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:15">naxan Isirayila daxi, ɛ mangana.”<verse eid="ISA 43:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:16">naxan kiraan sama baa igen xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:16">dangu ige gbeene yi,<verse eid="ISA 43:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17"/>naxan yɛngɛ so wontorone nun soone rasiga yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">e nun ganla nun sofa wɛkilɛxine e bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">e yi e sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">e mi fa kelima sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">e yi tu alo saraban na ɲan.<verse eid="ISA 43:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18"/>A naxa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:18">Fe singene nama fa rabira ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:18">ɛ ɲinan fe fonne xɔn!<verse eid="ISA 43:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19"/>Ɛ a mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">n fe nɛnɛn nan ligama!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">Na bata a fɔlɔ iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">ɛ mi a kolon ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">N kiraan sama nɛn tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">n yi baane ramini bɔxɔ xareni.<verse eid="ISA 43:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20"/>Burunna subene n binyama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">kankone nun dangaranfulene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">amasɔtɔ n bata igen namini tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">n yi baane ramini bɔxɔ xareni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">alogo n ma yamaan xa e min,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">n naxan sugandixi.<verse eid="ISA 43:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21"/>N yamaan naxan nafalaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:21">na n tantunma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 43:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala yamaan makitima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22"/>Ɛ tan Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:22">ɛ mi n tan xan xilixi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:22">Ɛ tan Isirayila kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:22">ɛ bata ɛ tunnaxɔlɔ ɛ ma n tan mabinni.<verse eid="ISA 43:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23"/>Ɛ mi ɛ yɛxɛɛne nun ɛ siine baxi n xa saraxa gan daxin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">Ɛ saraxane mi findixi n ma binyen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">N mi saraxane findixi goronna ra ɛ xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">n mi ɛ raxadanxi wusulan saraxane badeni.<verse eid="ISA 43:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24"/>Ɛ mi gbeti yikalaxi n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">alogo ɛ xa latikɔnɔnna sara n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">ɛ saraxa subene turen mi n wasaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">Koni ɛ yulubine bata findi goronna ra n xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">ɛ yi n naxadan hakɛne xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 43:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25"/>Koni n tan nan keden pe ɛ hakɛne xafarima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:25">n tan yɛtɛna fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:25">N mi fa n mirima ɛ yulubine fe ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 43:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26"/>Fe danguxine rabira n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:26">En kiti feni ito yɛba en bode xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:26">Ɛ falan ti, ɛ yi ɛ yɛtɛ xun mafala.<verse eid="ISA 43:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27"/>Ɛ benban nan singe yulubin liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:27">ɛ fala radangune yi murutɛ n xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 43:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28"/>Nanara, n bata yire sariɲanxin kuntigine yatɛ muxu haramuxine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">n yi halagin nagidi Yaxuba yixɛtɛne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">n yi marayarabin nagidi Isirayila kaane ma.<verse eid="ISA 43:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44"/>
  <para style="s">Alatala nan keden Ala ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1"/>Koni iki, Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:1">n ma walikɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:1">ɛ tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:1">n na Isirayila naxan sugandixi!<verse eid="ISA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">naxan i daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">naxan i rafalaxi i nga kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">naxan i malima, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">“Ɛ nama gaxu, n ma walikɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">i tan Isirayila tinxinxina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">n naxan sugandixi.<verse eid="ISA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3"/>Bayo n ni igen nafama nɛn bɔxɔ xareni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">n yi xudene radangu tonbonni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">N na n ma Nii Sariɲanxin nagodoma nɛn i bɔnsɔnne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">n yi barakan sa i yixɛtɛne fe yi.<verse eid="ISA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4"/>E sabatima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:4">alo sɛxɛne burunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:4">alo wudi faɲine xudene dɛ.<verse eid="ISA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5"/>Muxuna nde a falama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">a naxa, ‘Alatala nan gbee n na,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">boden yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">a a xili nɛn ‘Yaxuba,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">gbɛtɛ yi a sɛbɛ a yiin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">fa fala ‘Alatala gbeena,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">a yi a yɛtɛ xili ba a ‘Isirayila.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naxanye suxurene rafalama</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">Isirayila Mangan naxan a xunbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">“N tan nan a fɔlɔn nun a raɲanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">Ba n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">Ala gbɛtɛ mi na.<verse eid="ISA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7"/>Nde luxi alo n tan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">Na kanna xa a xuini te!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">A xa a yɛba n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">naxan birin bata dangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">xabu n singe ra muxune da waxatin naxan yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">A mɔn xa fe famatɔne fe fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">naxanye fama ligadeni!<verse eid="ISA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8"/>Ɛ nama gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">ɛ nama xuruxurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">n mi yi ɛ rakolonxi feni ito ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">n yi a rali ɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">xabu to mi na ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">N serene nan ɛ tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Ala gbɛtɛ na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">ba n tan na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Ɛ kantan fanye gbɛtɛ yo mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">ba n tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">N mi gbɛtɛ kolon.”<verse eid="ISA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9"/>Naxanye birin suxurene rafalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">fuyantenne nan ne birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">e se rafalaxi fisamantenne tɔnɔ yo mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">E yɛtɛ serene nan e ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">E mi se toma, e mi fe kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">e mɔn luma nɛn yagini.<verse eid="ISA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10"/>Muxun na alana nde rafala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:10">hanma suxurena nde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:10">na tɔnɔ mi na.<verse eid="ISA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11"/>Na kanna nun a sifan birin yagima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">Suxuren nafala muxune findixi adamadiine nan tun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">E birin xa e malan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">e xa e maso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">E gaxuma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">e yagi e bode xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12"/>Xabun nɛma bunbin xabuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">a walima tɛ wolonne nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">a yi a rafala dɛɛramaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">A a rawalima a sɛnbɛn nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">koni kamɛn na a suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">a sɛnbɛn yi ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">min xɔnla yi a suxu, a xadan.<verse eid="ISA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13"/>Kabintan lutin sama nɛn wudin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">a yi lutin funfun naba a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">a yi a masoli wali seen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">a yi a radigilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">a yi a rafala muxu sawuran na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">a lu adamadiyaan nɔrɔn birin yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">alogo a xa a ti a batu banxini.<verse eid="ISA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14"/>A sumanne nan sɛgɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">hanma xarinne hanma warine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">a naxanye raluxi fɔtɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">e gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">Xanamu, a fɔfɔna nde tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">a tan yɛtɛɛn naxan sixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">tule igen yi sa a ma, a gbo.<verse eid="ISA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15"/>Adamadiine na wudina ndee ganma yegen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">e yi nde tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">e yi e maxara a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">E na nan ndee mɔn tongoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">e yi kudin so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">e mɔn yi ndee tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">e yi e gbee alana nde rafala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">e yi e xinbi sin a bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">e suxuren nafala, e yi a batu.<verse eid="ISA 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16"/>E yi a wudi dɔnxɛn findi yegen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">a gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">e yi suben ɲin ndee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">e yi a gan ndee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">e yi a don han e lugo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">A mɔn yi a maxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">a yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">“N na n maxarama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">n tɛɛ dɛgɛn toma yati! ”<verse eid="ISA 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17"/>A wudin dɔnxɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">a yi na rafala a gbee ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">a suxurena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">a yi a xinbi sin a yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">a yi a batu, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">“N xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">bayo i tan nan n ma ala ra!”<verse eid="ISA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18"/>E mi fe kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">e xaxili mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">e yɛɛne raxixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">alogo e nama sese to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">E mi nɔɛ e mirɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">e feene famu.<verse eid="ISA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19"/>Muxune mi e mirima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">e xaxinla sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">e mi feene yɛɛ toɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">alogo e xa a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">“N bata wudina ndee gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">n kudin so a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">n yi suben gan ndee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">n yi a don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">N lan n xa a dɔnxɛn findi se haramuxin na ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">n yi n xinbi sin yegen bun?”<verse eid="ISA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20"/>E kankanma naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">xuben nan gbansan na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">E bɔɲɛn bata tantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">a e ralɔ ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">E niin mi xunbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">e mi a falama, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">“Seen naxan n yii ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">wulen xa mi a ra ba?”<verse eid="ISA 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tinxinna Ala xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21"/>Yaxuba bɔnsɔnne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">na feen xa rabira ɛ ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">Amasɔtɔ n ma walikɛɛn nan ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">Isirayila kaane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">N na ɛ rafalaxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">alogo ɛ xa findi n ma walikɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">Isirayila kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">n mi ɲinanma ɛ xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22"/>N bata ɛ hakɛne ba ɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">alo kundaan kore xɔnna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">e nun ɛ yulubine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">alo kundaan xɔtɔnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">Ɛ xun xɛtɛ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">amasɔtɔ n bata ɛ xunba.<verse eid="ISA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23"/>Kore xɔnna, gbelegbele sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">amasɔtɔ Alatala bata wali!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Bɔxɔn bunna, sɔnxɔ sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">geyane, ɛ xuini te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">e nun ɛ tan fɔtɔnne nun wudine birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Amasɔtɔ Alatala bata Yaxuba yixɛtɛne xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">a yi a binyen mayita Isirayila yi.<verse eid="ISA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">a tan naxan i xunbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">naxan i rafalaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">xabu i i nga kui, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">“N tan, Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">n bata feen birin liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">n tan nan keden kore xɔnni fulunxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">n tan yɛtɛɛn nan bɔxɔ xɔnna saxi.<verse eid="ISA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25"/>N tan nan waliyine wule mantaxane kalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">n yi yiimatone findi daxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">n yi fekolonne raxɛtɛ xanbin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">n yi e xaxilimayaan findi xaxilitareyaan na.<verse eid="ISA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26"/>N na n ma walikɛna falane rakamalima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">N ma xɛrane na fe famatɔɔn naxanye rali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">n na a rakamalima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">N bata a fala Yerusalɛn ma, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">‘Muxune mɔn dɔxɔma nɛn a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">Yuda taane mɔn tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">n mɔn yi taa kalaxine yitɔn.’<verse eid="ISA 44:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27"/>N nɔɛ a falɛ tilinna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:27">n naxa, ‘Xara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:27">n xa i ya igen xɔri.’<verse eid="ISA 44:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28"/>N yi a fala Kirusi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">n naxa, ‘N ma xuruse rabana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">A n waxɔn feene birin ligama nɛn.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">N na a fala Yerusalɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">n naxa, ‘A mɔn xa ti!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">E nun Ala Batu Banxin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">n naxa, ‘A mɔn xa bɛtɛn sa!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 44:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45"/>
  <para style="s">Ala yi Kirusi findi a walikɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi a muxu sugandixin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">a naxa, “Kirusi, n naxan yii suxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">alogo n xa siyane magodo a yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">n yi mangane yɛngɛ so seene ba e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">n yi dɛɛn fɔxɔ firinne rabi a yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">alogo taan so dɛɛne nama fa ragali sɔnɔn,<verse eid="ISA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2"/>n tan yɛtɛɛn tima nɛn i yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">n yi gbingbinne malaxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">n yi sulan dɛɛne kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">n yi dɛɛne balan wurene bolon.<verse eid="ISA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3"/>N bɔxɔ bun nafunla soma nɛn i yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">e nun nafulu luxunxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">alogo i xa a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">fa fala a n tan nan Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">naxan i xilima i xinla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">n tan Isirayilaa Ala.<verse eid="ISA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4"/>N bata i xili i xinla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">n yi tide binyen fi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">n ma walikɛɛn Yaxuba yixɛtɛne fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">Isirayila kaane, n naxanye sugandixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">koni i mi n kolon.<verse eid="ISA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5"/>Alatala nan n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">gbɛtɛ mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">Ba n tan na, Ala gbɛtɛ mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">N bata i yitɔn yɛngɛn xili yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">hali i to mi n kolon,<verse eid="ISA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6"/>alogo muxune xa a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">keli sogen teden ma han a gododena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">fa fala ba n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">se gbɛtɛ mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">N tan nan Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">gbɛtɛ mi na.<verse eid="ISA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7"/>N tan nan kɛnɛnna daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">n yi dimin da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">n yi bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">n yi tɔrɔn nafa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">N tan Alatala nan feen birin ligama.”<verse eid="ISA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8"/>“Tulen xa a yitɔn kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">tinxinna yi godo alo tulena!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">Bɔxɔn xa rasɔnɔya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">alogo kisin xa mini alo sansina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">e nun tinxinyaan yi sabati e bode xɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">N tan Alatala nan ne birin daxi.”<verse eid="ISA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9"/>Gbalon na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">naxan yɛngɛn nakelima a dali marigin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">muxun naxan luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">alo fɛɲɛna fɛɲɛne tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">Fɛɲɛ bɛndɛna a falɛ a rafala muxun ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">a naxa, “I nanse ligama?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">hanma a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">“Sese mi i ya wanla ra!”<verse eid="ISA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10"/>Gbalon na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">naxan a falama a fafe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">a naxa, “I nanse barixi ito ra?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">hanma a naxa a nga ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">“I diin barin nanfera?”<verse eid="ISA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">naxan Isirayila daxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">“Ɛ tan nan n maxɔdinma fe famatɔne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">lan n ma diine fe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">ɛ yi yamarine so n yii lan n yii fɔxɔn ma?<verse eid="ISA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12"/>N tan nan bɔxɔ xɔnna rafalaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">n adamadiine da a fari!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">N tan yɛtɛɛn nan kore xɔnni fulunxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">N tan nan a sarene birin yamarima.<verse eid="ISA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13"/>N tan nan Kirusi rakelixi n ma tinxinyana fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">n yi a ti kira yitɔnxin xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">A n ma taan tima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">N ma muxun naxanye yi suxi yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">a ne beɲinma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">e mi e xun saren fi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">“Misiran kaane nun Kusi yamanan yulaya seene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">na Sabe kaa muxu kuyene wanle tɔnɔn luma nɛn i xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">E fama nɛn i konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">e findi i gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">e bira i fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">e xidixi e bode ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">e yi e xinbi sin i yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">e yi i maxandi, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">‘Ala i tan nan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">Ala gbɛtɛ mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">sese mi ala gbɛtɛye ra!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15"/>I tan Isirayilaa Ala, Marakisi Tiina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:15">i findixi Ala luxunxin nan na.<verse eid="ISA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16"/>Suxure rafalane birin yagixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:16">e xun sinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:16">e birin xun sinxin sigama e bode xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 45:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17"/>Koni Isirayila kaane tan kisin sɔtɔma Alatala nan na habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:17">Ɛ mi fa yarabɛ, ɛ xun sin mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 45:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">a tan naxan kore xɔnna daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">a tan Ala, naxan bɔxɔ xɔnna daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">naxan a bɛtɛn saxi, a mi a magenla lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">koni a yi a da alogo muxune xa lu a yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">A naxa, “N tan nan Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">gbɛtɛ mi na.<verse eid="ISA 45:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19"/>N mi falan tixi luxunna xan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">dimini bɔxɔn yirena nde yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">N mi a falaxi Yaxuba yixɛtɛne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">n naxa, ‘Ɛ n fen fuyan!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">N tan Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">n ɲɔndin nan falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">n fe faɲin nan nalima.”<verse eid="ISA 45:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siyane tubi fena Ala ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20"/>“Ɛ tan siyane muxu gixine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">ɛ fa ɛ malan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">ɛ birin yi ɛ maso be!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">Xaxilitarene nan wudi suxurene tongoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">e yi batu seene maxandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">naxanye mi nɔɛ e rakisɛ.<verse eid="ISA 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21"/>Ɛ falane ti, ɛ yi ɛ xɔnba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Ɛ bode kawandi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Nde muxune rakolonxi feni ito ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">xabu a fɔlɔni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Nde bata yi a rali nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">xabu to mi na ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">N tan Alatala mi a ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Ba n tan na, Ala gbɛtɛ mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Ala naxan tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Marakisi Tiina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Ba n tan na, gbɛtɛ mi na.<verse eid="ISA 45:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22"/>Ɛ yɛɛ rafindi n ma, ɛ xa kisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">ɛ tan naxanye birin bɔxɔn danne ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">Bayo Ala nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">gbɛtɛ mi na.<verse eid="ISA 45:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23"/>N bata n kɔlɔ n yɛtɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">n yɛtɛɛn bata fala tinxinxini ito ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">falan naxan mi maxɛtɛma, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">‘Xinbin birin sinma nɛn n bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">lɛnna birin yi a kɔlɔ n yi.<verse eid="ISA 45:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24"/>E naxa: Tinxinna nun sɛnbɛna Alatala nan keden pe yi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">Naxanye birin yi xɔlɔxi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">ne birin yagixin fama nɛn a fɛma.<verse eid="ISA 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25"/>Isirayila kaane birin tinxinna sɔtɔma nɛn Alatala xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:25">e yi e kanba Ala yi.<verse eid="ISA 45:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46"/>
  <para style="s">Babilɔn suxurene halagi fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1"/>Beli suxuren bata a xinbi sin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">46.1</char> Babilɔn kaane gbee alane nan yi <char style="fk">Beli</char> nun <char style="fk">Nebo</char> ra.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">Nebo suxuren yi a felen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">Ɲingene nan e suxurene maxalima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">E yi e dɔxɔma e xun ma nɛn sali waxatine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">koni iki e bata findi goronna ra sube xadanxine xun ma.<verse eid="ISA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2"/>E bata e felen e bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">e yi e xinbi sin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">e mi nɔɛ e suxurene rakisɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">naxanye findixi goronna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">bayo e tan yɛtɛɛn sigama konyiyani.<verse eid="ISA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3"/>Yaxuba yixɛtɛne, ɛ tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">ɛ tan Isirayila yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">ɛ tan naxanye goron n xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">xabu ɛ nga kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">xabu ɛ xiɲɛn minma!<verse eid="ISA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4"/>N luma na ki kedenna nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">han ɛ fori waxatini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">N tima nɛn ɛ bun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">han ɛ xun sɛxɛne yi fixa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">N bata na liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">n mɔn waxi ɛ xali feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">n ti ɛ bun, n yi ɛ xɔrɔya.<verse eid="ISA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5"/>Ɛ n misalixi nde ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:5">Nxu nun nde lan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:5">Ɛ nxu nun nde saxi nxu bode ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:5">nxu nun naxan maliga?<verse eid="ISA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6"/>Muxune e xɛmane fima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">e gbeti fixɛni liga sikeela fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">e xabun saren fi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">alogo a xa ala sawurana nde rafala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">e xinbi sinɲɛ naxan bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">e yi a batu.<verse eid="ISA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7"/>E a tongo e tungunna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">e a maxali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">e sa a dɔxɔ a dɔxɔdeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">A mi nɔɛ kelɛ a funfuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">Hali e xui ramini a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">a mi e yabima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">A mi e ratangama e kɔntɔfinle ma.<verse eid="ISA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8"/>Feni ito xa rabira ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:8">ɛ yi ɛ wɛkilɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:8">Ɛ tan muxu murutɛxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:8">ɛ miri na ma ɛ bɔɲɛni.<verse eid="ISA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9"/>Feen naxanye danguxi a fɔlɔ fɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">ne xa rabira ɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">Amasɔtɔ Ala nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">gbɛtɛ mi na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">Ala nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">sese mi maliga n na!<verse eid="ISA 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10"/>Naxan fama ligadeni a raɲanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">n na ralima a fɔlɔn nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">Naxan munma liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">n na fe falama xabu waxati xunkuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">N naxa, n ma fe ragidixin nakamalima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">N wama naxan birin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">n yi na liga.<verse eid="ISA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11"/>N bata sɛnbɛmana nde xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">sa keli sogeteden binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">naxan luxi alo singbinna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">alogo a xa n ma fe ragidixin nakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">sa keli yamana makuyeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">N naxan falaxi, n yi na rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">n na naxan yitɔn, n yi na liga.<verse eid="ISA 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12"/>Ɛ tuli mati n xuiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:12">ɛ tan muxu bɔɲɛ xɔdɛxɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:12">ɛ tan naxanye makuya tinxinna ra!<verse eid="ISA 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13"/>N ma tinxinyaan somatɔɔn ni i ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">A mi fa makuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">N mi fa buma, n kisin nafa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">N kisin nasoma nɛn Siyon taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">n yi n ma nɔrɔn fi Isirayila ma.<verse eid="ISA 46:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47"/>
  <para style="s">Babilɔn taan kala fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1"/>Keli i ya mangaya gbɛdɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">i dɔxɔ bɔxɔni, Babilɔn taa faɲina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">Babilɔn kaane, ɛ dɔxɔ bɔxɔni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">A mi fa falama a ma sɔnɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">a taa ɲaxumɛ tofaɲina.<verse eid="ISA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2"/>Ɛ se din seene tongo alo konyine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:2">ɛ yi sansi kɛsɛne findi a fuɲin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:2">Ɛ doma gbeene mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:2">ɛ danbane xa to, ɛ xudene gidi.<verse eid="ISA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3"/>Ɛ ragenla toma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">ɛ yagixin yi to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">N nan n gbeen ɲɔxɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">muxu yo mi n yikalɛ.<verse eid="ISA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4"/>Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin nan en xunbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:4">a xili nɛn Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna.<verse eid="ISA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5"/>Ɛ dɔxɔ, ɛ dundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">ɛ siga dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">ɛ tan Babilɔn kaane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">A mi fa falama a ma sɔnɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">a yamanane mangana.<verse eid="ISA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6"/>N xɔlɔ nɛn n ma yamaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">n bata yi n kɛɛn nayarabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">n yi e rabeɲin ɛ yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">Ɛ mi kininkininxi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">ɛ konyi wanle ragboxi ayi hali fonne fari.<verse eid="ISA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7"/>Ɛ yi a falama nɛn, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">“N luma nɛn mangayani habadan!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">Koni ɛ mi na feene yatɛxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">ɛ mi ɛ mirixi feene raɲan kiin ma.<verse eid="ISA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8"/>Nayi, Babilɔn taana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">i tan naxan luxi alo ɲaxalan ɲaxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">i tuli mati ito ra iki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">Ɛ tan Babilɔn kaan naxanye dɔxi makantanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">ɛ tan naxanye a falama, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">“Nxu tan, nxu ɲɔxɔn mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">nxu mi findɛ kaɲa gilɛne ra mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">nxɔ diine mi faxɛ mumɛ!”<verse eid="ISA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9"/>Na fe firinne ɛ sɔtɔma nɛn lɔxɔ kedenni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">sanɲa ma kedenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">ɛ diine yi faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">ɛ findi kaɲa gilɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">Ne dɛfexin ligama nɛn ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">hali ɛ kɔɛ ra feene to gboxi ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">hali ɛ tirin feene sɛnbɛn yi gbo!<verse eid="ISA 47:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10"/>Ɛ bata ɛ yigi sa ɛ fe ɲaxine yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">Ɛ yi a falama nɛn ɛ yɛtɛ ma, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">“Muxu yo mi nxu toma!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">Ɛ xaxilimayaan nun ɛ fekolonna bata ɛ xunna firifiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">Ɛ yi a falama ɛ bɔɲɛni nɛn, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">“Nxu tan, nxu ɲɔxɔn mi na!”<verse eid="ISA 47:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11"/>Gbalon fama nɛn ɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">ɛ mi naxan nadangu xiriya kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">Halagin godoma nɛn ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">ɛ mi naxan nadangu saraxan nɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">Yihadin fama nɛn ɛ ma sanɲa ma kedenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">ɛ xaxili mi naxan ma.<verse eid="ISA 47:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12"/>Nayi, ɛ lu ɛ tirin feene fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">e nun ɛ kɔɛraya fe wuyaxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">ɛ yi ɛ yɛtɛ yixadanma naxanye fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">xabu ɛ dii ɲɔrɛ waxatina!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">Yanyina nde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">ɛ tɔnɔn sɔtɔma e yi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">yanyina nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">ɛ muxune magaxuma e yi nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13"/>Ɛ bata ɛ yɛtɛ yixadan suxurene maxɔdindeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">Awa, nayi, muxun naxanye xibarune toma sarene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">ne xa keli, e fa ɛ rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">e tan naxanye sarene rakɔrɔsima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">e fe famatɔne fala kike yo kike!<verse eid="ISA 47:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14"/>E luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">alo se dagina, tɛɛn yi e gan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">E niin mi tangama na tɛɛ dɛgɛn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">Anu a mi findima tɛɛ wolondin xan na de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">burun ganma naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">muxuna a maxarɛ naxan na!<verse eid="ISA 47:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15"/>Ɛ yixadanma muxun naxanye fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">xabu ɛ dii ɲɔrɛ waxatina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">ne raɲanna ligama na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">ɛ tɔrɔma naxanye fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">E birin sigama nɛn e xun xɔn e tantanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">e tan sese mi ɛ rakisɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 47:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48"/>
  <para style="s">Ala fe nɛnɛne ralima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1"/>Ɛ tan Yaxuba yixɛtɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">ɛ tuli mati ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">ɛ tan naxanye xili Isirayila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">ɛ tan naxanye barixi Yuda bɔnsɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">ɛ tan naxanye ɛ kɔlɔma Alatala xinli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">ɛ tan naxanye Isirayilaa Ala maxandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">koni ɲɔndin nun tinxinyaan mi a ra!<verse eid="ISA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ xili saxi taa sariɲanxin nan xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:2">Ɛ yengi saxi Isirayilaa Ala nan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:2">naxan xili Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna.<verse eid="ISA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3"/>Feen naxanye danguxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">n bata yi ne fala xabu waxati xunkuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">N yɛtɛɛn nan ne ralixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">n yi muxune rakolon ne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">na xanbi ra, sanɲa ma kedenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">n yi e liga, e yi rakamali.<verse eid="ISA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4"/>Amasɔtɔ n na a kolon nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:4">a yama tengbesenxin nan ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:4">ɛ kɔɛni balanxi alo wure gbelemɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:4">ɛ tigin xɔdɔxɔ alo sulana.<verse eid="ISA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5"/>Nanara, n feni itoe fala ɛ xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">xabu waxati xunkuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">n yi ɛ rakolon e ra benun e xa liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">alogo ɛ nama a fala, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">“Nxɔ suxurene nan e ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">nxɔ sawurana hanma nxɔ ala wure daxin nan e yamarixi.”<verse eid="ISA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6"/>Ɛ bata feni itoe mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">ɛ yi e birin to rakamalɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">Ɛ fan mi ɛ tiyɛ e ra ɛ dɛni ba?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">Iki, n fa ɛ rakolonma fe nɛnɛne nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">naxanye luxunxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">ɛ mi naxanye kolon.<verse eid="ISA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7"/>N baxi e yitɔndeni nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">fe fonne mi e tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">Benun to, ɛ munma yi e sese a fe mɛ nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">alogo ɛ nama a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">ɛ naxa, “Nxu yi na kolon.”<verse eid="ISA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8"/>Anu, ɛ mi yi sese mɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">ɛ mi yi sese kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">Ɛ tunla munma yi a mɛ singen waxati danguxine yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">Bayo n yi a kolon a yanfantenne nan ɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">Xabu ɛ yi ɛ nga kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">a yi falama ɛ ma a muxu murutɛxine.<verse eid="ISA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9"/>N bata n ma xɔlɛni suxu n xinla fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:9">N bata diɲa ɛ ma n tantunna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:9">alogo n nama ɛ halagi.<verse eid="ISA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10"/>N bata ɛ rasɛnsɛn tɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:10">alo gbeti wurena sulun tɛɛni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">48.10</char> <char style="fk">Sulun tɛɛn</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Furu tɛɛna</char>.”</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:10">N mi yi ɛ rasoxi sulun tɛɛn xan yi de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:10">koni n yi ɛ rasoxi ɲaxankata yinla nan na.<verse eid="ISA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11"/>N bata keli ito ligadeni n yɛtɛna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">n na a ligama n yɛtɛɛn yatin nan ma fe ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">Amasɔtɔ n tinɲɛ di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">n xinla yi rayelefu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">N mi n ma binyen fiyɛ gbɛtɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12"/>Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">ɛ tuli mati n na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">Isirayila kaane, n naxanye xilixi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">N tan na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">n tan nan a fɔlɔn nun a raɲanna ra.<verse eid="ISA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13"/>N tan nan bɔxɔ xɔnna bɛtɛn saxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">n yiifanna yi kore xɔnni fulun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">N na e xili, e fama nɛn mafurɛn!<verse eid="ISA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14"/>Ɛ birin xa ɛ malan, ɛ tuli mati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Nde feni ito falaxi suxurene yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Muxuna nde rafan Alatala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Na a waxɔn feene ligama nɛn Babilɔn taan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">a yiini tema nɛn Babilɔn kaane xili ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">48.14</char> Perise mangan Kirusi nan fama Babilɔn kaane yɛngɛdeni.</note><verse eid="ISA 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15"/>N tan nan keden pe falan tixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:15">n mɔn yi a xili, n yi a rafa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:15">A wanla sɔnɔyama nɛn!<verse eid="ISA 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16"/>Ɛ maso n na, ɛ tuli mati ito ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Xabu a fɔlɔni, n mi falan ti wundoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Xabu feni itoe fɔlɔna, n yi be.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Iki, Marigina Alatala bata nxu nun a Nii Sariɲanxin xɛ.<verse eid="ISA 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">naxan i xunbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">“Alatala nan n tan na, i ya Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">naxan i xaranma i yɛtɛ munanfanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">naxan tima i yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">a siga i ra kiraan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">naxan lanɲɛ i ma.<verse eid="ISA 48:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18"/>Xa i yi n ma yamarine ramɛ nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">i ya bɔɲɛ xunbenla yi luma nɛn nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">alo baana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">i ya tinxinna yi lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">alo fɔxɔ igen walanna,<verse eid="ISA 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19"/>i yixɛtɛne yi wuya ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">alo ɲɛmɛnsinna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">i ya diine yi gbo ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">alo ɲɛmɛnsin xɔnne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">I xinla mi bɛ n yɛtagi mumɛ!”<verse eid="ISA 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20"/>Ɛ mini Babilɔn yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">Ɛ ɛ gi Babilɔn kaane ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">Ɛ gbelegbele sɛwani, ɛ fa a rali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">a xa rawanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">Ɛ a fe raxuya ayi han bɔxɔn danne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">ɛ a fala, ɛ naxa, “Alatala bata a walikɛɛn Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna xunba!”<verse eid="ISA 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21"/>Min xɔnla mi e suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">a na ti e yɛɛ ra, dangu tonbonni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">A igen naminima nɛn fanyeni e xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">A fanyen bɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">ige gbeen yi mini keden na.<verse eid="ISA 48:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22"/>Alatala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:22">“Bɔɲɛ xunbeli mi muxu ɲaxine xa!”<verse eid="ISA 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49"/>
  <para style="s">Marigina walikɛɛn nan kɛnɛnna ra siyane xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1"/>Ɛ tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔn muxune.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">Yamana makuyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">ɛ ito ramɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">Benun n xa bari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">Alatala bata yi n xili.<verse eid="ISA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2"/>A bata n dɛɛn lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">alo silanfan xɛnxɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">a yi a yiin nininna ti n xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">a yi n findi xalimakuli ɲɔɛ ralemunxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">a n luxun a xalimakuli saseni.<verse eid="ISA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3"/>A yi a fala n xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:3">“N ma walikɛɛn nan i ra, Isirayila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:3">n ma binyen luma naxan yi.”<verse eid="ISA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4"/>Koni n tan yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">“N bata n yɛtɛ yixadan fufafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">n bata n fangani kala fuyan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">n mi se sɔtɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">Koni Alatala n ma kitin sama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">N saranna n ma Ala nan yii.<verse eid="ISA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5"/>Awa iki, Alatala bata falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">a tan naxan n daxi nga kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">alogo n xa findi a walikɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">alogo n xa Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna raxɛtɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">alogo Isirayila kaane mɔn xa malan a fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">n bata binyen sɔtɔ Alatala yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">Amasɔtɔ n ma Ala nan findixi n fangan na.<verse eid="ISA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6"/>A bata a fala n xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">‘I findi fena n ma walikɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">alogo i mɔn xa Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">i yi Isirayila yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne raxɛtɛ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">na xurun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">N ni i findima nɛn kɛnɛnna ra siyane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">alogo n ma marakisin xa makɛnɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">siga han bɔxɔn danne ra.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne xɛtɛ fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7"/>Alatala naxan i xunbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">na nan ito falaxi i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">i tan naxan naɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">i tan naxan yatɛxi muxu haramuxin na yamaan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">i tan naxan findixi kuntigine konyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">a naxa, “Mangane i toma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">e yi keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">kuntigine i toma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">e yi e xinbi sin i bun ma Alatalaa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">naxan tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">naxan i sugandixi.”<verse eid="ISA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">“N ma marafanna waxatin na a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">n ni i yabima nɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">I rakisin waxatin na a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">n ni i malima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">N na i ramarama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">n yi i findi layiri xidi muxun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">alogo yamanan mɔn xa yitɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">bɔxɔn kɛɛ rabeɲinxine mɔn yi yitaxun,<verse eid="ISA 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9"/>alogo a xa fala kasorasane xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">fa fala, ‘Ɛ mini!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">e nun naxanye luxi dimini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">fa fala, ‘Ɛ mini kɛnɛnni!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">E nɔɛ e dɛgɛ nɛn kirane xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">alo xuruse kuruna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">e xuruse rabaden toɛ nɛn geyane birin fari.<verse eid="ISA 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10"/>Kamɛn mi fa e suxuma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">min xɔnla mi e suxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">Kuye wolonna nun sogen mi e tɔrɛ mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">bayo naxan kininkininma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">na tima nɛn e yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">a yi e xali tigi yirene yi.<verse eid="ISA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11"/>N na n ma geyane birin findima nɛn kirane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:11">n ma kirane mɔn yi yitɔn.<verse eid="ISA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12"/>E mato, e fama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">sa keli yire makuyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">ndee kelima sogeteden kɔmɛnna binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">ndee sogegododen binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">ndee sa kelima Sinimi yamanani.”<verse eid="ISA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13"/>Kore xɔnna, gbelegbele sɛwani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">Bɔxɔ xɔnna, ɲaxan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">Geyane, ɛ sɛwa xuini te!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">Bayo, Alatala a yamaan madɛndɛnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">a kininkininma a tɔrɔ muxune ma.<verse eid="ISA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn taan mɔn tima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14"/>Siyon kaane yi a falama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:14">e naxa, “Alatala bata nxu rabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:14">Marigin bata ɲinan nxu xɔn.”<verse eid="ISA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15"/>Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">“Ɲaxanla ɲinanɲɛ a diin xɔn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">naxan xiɲɛn na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">A mi kininkininɲɛ a dii barixin ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">Hali a tan ɲinanɲɛ a xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">n tan mi ɲinanɲɛ i xɔn mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16"/>N bata i xinla kɛrɛndɛn n yiine kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:16">n na n ɲɔxɔ lu taan makantan yinne xɔn ma waxatin birin.<verse eid="ISA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17"/>I ya diine xɛtɛma e giyɛ i ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:17">i kala muxun naxanye yi i halagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:17">ne e gima i ma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18"/>I yɛɛ rakoɲin i rabilinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">i ya diine birin bata e malan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">e fama i fɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">Habadan Ala nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">n bata n kɔlɔ n yɛtɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">e findima nɛn i maxidi seen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">alo ɲɛrɛna i kɔɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">alo ɲaxalandina a maxidima kii naxan yi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">Alatalaa falan nan na ra!<verse eid="ISA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19"/>Hali taa xɔnne nun bɔxɔ rabeɲinxine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">nun yire kalaxine to gbo yamanani iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">e sa xurunma ayi nɛn dɔxɔden na i ya yamaan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">Naxanye yi i halagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">ne makuyama i ra nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20"/>E diin naxanye baxi i yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">ne mɔn a falama nɛn i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">e naxa, “Yireni ito xurun nxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">dɔxɔdena nde fen nxu xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">nxu xa ba yigbɛtɛnxi.”<verse eid="ISA 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21"/>Nayi, i a falama nɛn i bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">i naxa, “Nde itoe barixi n xa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Diine yi baxi n yii nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">n yi luxi alo gbantana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">N bata yi xali konyiyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">n namɛxin nan yi a ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Nde diini itoe maxuruxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">N kedenna bata yi lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">koni diini itoe sa kelixi minɛn?”<verse eid="ISA 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22"/>Marigina Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">“N na n yiin maligama nɛn siyane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">n na n ma taxamasenni tema nɛn yamanane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">e yi fa i ya dii xɛmɛne ra e yii kanke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">e yi i ya dii tɛmɛne maxali e tungunne ma.<verse eid="ISA 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23"/>Mangane nan i ya diine maxuruma i xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">mangane ɲaxanle yi i ya dii tɛmɛne balo i xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">E yi e xinbin sin i yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">e yɛtagin yi lan bɔxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">e yi i san ma lɔxɔne makɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">I a kolonma nɛn nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">a Alatala nan n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">naxanye e xaxili tixi n tan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">ne mi yagima.”<verse eid="ISA 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24"/>Sofaan seen naxan tongoxi yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:24">na bɛ a yii ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:24">Ɲaxankata tiina muxu suxin nɔɛ a futuxulɛ ba?<verse eid="ISA 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">“Sofana se tongoxin bama nɛn a yii yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">ɲaxankata tiina muxu suxin yi a futuxulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">N na i yɛngɛfane yɛngɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">n yi i ya diine rakisi.<verse eid="ISA 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26"/>Naxanye yi ɲaxu i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">n yi ne radin e bode ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">e balo e bode suben na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">e yi e bode wunla min</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">alo manpa nɛnɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">Nayi, adamadiine birin a kolonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">a Alatala nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">i rakisimaan naxan i xunbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">Yaxubaa Ala Sɛnbɛmana.”<verse eid="ISA 49:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan a yamaan nakisima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">“Futu kala kɛdin minɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">n na n mɛxi ɛ nga ra naxan xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">Hanma n na ɛ matixi n doli faane ma naxan xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">Ɛ matixi ɛ hakɛne nan ma fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">ɛ nga ramɛxi ɛ matandine nan ma fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2"/>N to fa, nanfera muxe mi yi be?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">N to xinla ti, nanfera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">muxe mi n yabi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">N yiin dungi nayi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">a yi muxune xunba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Sɛnbɛ mi n na ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">n yi muxune xɔrɔya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Anu, n baa igen xɔrima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">n na n kɔnkɔ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">n yi baane findi tonbonna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">e yɛxɛne yi kun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">bayo ige mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">e birin yi faxa min xɔnla ra.<verse eid="ISA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3"/>N yi dimin naso kore</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:3">alo sunu dugina.”<verse eid="ISA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marigina walikɛna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4"/>Marigina Alatala bata n xaran</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">alogo n xa a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">n naxan falɛ muxu xadanxine xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">e sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">A n naxulunma xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">alogo n xa a falan namɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">alo a xarandiina.<verse eid="ISA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5"/>Marigina Alatala bata n tunle rabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:5">n tan fan mi murutɛxi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:5">n mi xɛtɛxi xanbin na.<verse eid="ISA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6"/>N na n fanna ti nɛn n bɔnbɔ muxune xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">n yi n dɛɛn ti ne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">naxanye n dɛ xabene matalama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">N mi n yɛtagin baxi konbin nun dɛgen bun.<verse eid="ISA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7"/>Koni Marigina Alatala n mali nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">nanara n mi rayarabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">N bata n yɛtagin findi fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">n to a kolon a n mi fama yagideni.<verse eid="ISA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8"/>Naxan yoon fima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">na bata maso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Nde waxi n xun maxidi feni nayi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">En kitin yɛba en bode xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Nde mi tinxi n ma yoon ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">A xa fa n xili ma!<verse eid="ISA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9"/>Marigina Alatala n malima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">Nayi, nde n yalagima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">E birin kalama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">alo dugi fonna, kunle yi e don.<verse eid="ISA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10"/>Nde a tuli matiyɛ Alaa walikɛɛn na Alatala yɛɛragaxun ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">Naxan yo sigan tima dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">kɛnɛnna dasaxi naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">na xa a yigi sa Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">a yi a xaxili ti a Ala ra!<verse eid="ISA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11"/>Koni ɛ tan naxanye tɛɛne soma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">ɛ yi tanba radɛgɛxine tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">nba ɛ sigan ti ɛ yɛtɛna tɛɛ dɛgɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">ɛ tanban naxanye radɛgɛxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">Ɛ fa ito nan sɔtɔma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">ɛ faxama sɔxɔlɛn nin.<verse eid="ISA 50:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51"/>
  <para style="s">Kisin naxan dan mi na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1"/>Ɛ tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">ɛ tan naxanye tinxinyaan fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">ɛ tan naxanye Alatala fenma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">Ɛ yɛɛn ti fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">ɛ minixi naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">e nun gɛmɛna ɛ baxi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2"/>Ɛ yɛɛn ti Iburahima ra, ɛ fafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">e nun Saran, naxan ɛ barixi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">51.2</char> <char style="fk">Iburahima</char> nun <char style="fk">Saran</char> ma fe sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 17.14 kui.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">Amasɔtɔ n Iburahima xili waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">dii mi yi a yii nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">Koni n barakan sa nɛn a fe yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">n yi mayixɛtɛ wuyaxi fi a ma.<verse eid="ISA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3"/>Alatala Siyon taan masabarima na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">a yi kininkinin a yire kalaxine birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">A yi a tonbonna lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">alo Eden nakɔna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">51.3</char> <char style="fk">Eden</char> nakɔna fe sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 2.8-9 kui.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">A bɔxɔ xarene yi lu alo Alatalaa nakɔna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">Sɛwan nun ɲaxanna luma nɛn a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">bɛti xuine nun sigi xuine yi mɛ a yi.<verse eid="ISA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4"/>Ala naxa, “Ɛ tan n ma yamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">ɛ tuli mati n na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">Ɛ tan n ma yamanan muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">ɛ n xuiin namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">bayo n sariyan fima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">n ma kiti kɛndɛn yi findi kɛnɛnna ra siyane xa.<verse eid="ISA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5"/>N ma tinxinyaan somatɔɔn ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">n ma marakisin yi makɛnɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">N kiti kɛndɛn nafama nɛn siyane ma n sɛnbɛn xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">Fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne yi e yigi sa n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">e yi e xaxili ti n sɛnbɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6"/>Ɛ yɛɛ rate kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">ɛ mɔn xa bɔxɔn mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Kore xɔnna lɔma ayi nɛn alo tutina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">bɔxɔ xɔnna yi ɲan alo dugina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">a muxune yi faxa alo tugetugene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Koni n ma marakisin luma nɛn habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">n ma tinxinyaan mi ɲanɲɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7"/>Ɛ tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">ɛ tan naxanye tinxinna kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">Ɛ tan yamaan naxan n ma sariyan namaraxi ɛ bɔɲɛni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">Ɛ nama gaxu muxune mafala xuine yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">ɛ nama gaxu e konbine yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8"/>Bayo, e fatin kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">kunle yi e don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">alo domaan xiine bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">koni n ma tinxinna luma nɛn habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">n ma marakisin yi lu mayixɛtɛ nun mayixɛtɛne xa.”<verse eid="ISA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9"/>Keli Ala, keli! I sɛnbɛ so!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">Alatala, i fangan nakeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">alo lɔxɔ singene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">alo waxati danguxine yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">I tan xa mi Misiran yamanan kala ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">i yi na ige yi ninginangani sɔxɔn?<verse eid="ISA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10"/>I tan xa mi baa gbeen igen xara ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">tilin gbeen yi xɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">I tan xa mi kiraan sa baan xɔnna ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">51.10</char> Na feen sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 14.21 kui.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">alogo i ya muxu xunbaxine xa gidi?<verse eid="ISA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11"/>Alatala na naxanye xɔrɔya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">ne xɛtɛma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">E fama nɛn gbelegbelɛ ɲaxaɲaxani Siyon taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">habadan sɛwan yi e yɛtagini yalan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">Ɲaxaɲaxan nun sɛwan luma nɛn e yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">sunun nun kutunna yi ɲan fefe!<verse eid="ISA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12"/>N tan keden peen nan ɛ ralimaniyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">Nanfera ɛ gaxuma muxune yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">naxanye faxama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">Adamadiine raɲanna luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">alo sɛxɛna.<verse eid="ISA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13"/>I bata ɲinan Alatala xɔn naxan i daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">naxan kore xɔnni fulunxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">a bɔxɔ xɔnna bɛtɛn sa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">I luma nɛn gaxuni waxatin birin i ɲaxankata tiin bun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">alo a na a yitɔn i halagi xinla ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">Koni ɲaxankata tiina fitinan minɛn?<verse eid="ISA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14"/>A gbee mi fa luxi kasorasane xa beɲin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:14">E mi faxama kasoon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:14">donseen mi fa dasama e ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15"/>Alatala nan n tan na, i ya Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">naxan fɔxɔ igeni maxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">a mɔrɔnne yi xuxu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">51.15</char> <char style="fk">Igen mɔrɔnne:</char> alo foyen na so igeni.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">A xili nɛn Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna.<verse eid="ISA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16"/>N bata n ma falan naso i dɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">n yi n yiin nininna ti i xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">N tan naxan kore xɔnna sa a funfuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">n yi bɔxɔ xɔnna bɛtɛn sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">n yi a fala Siyon kaane xa, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">“N ma yamaan nan ɛ tan na.”<verse eid="ISA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala Yerusalɛn sɛnbɛ soma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17"/>Ɛ xulun, ɛ xulun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">Yerusalɛn kaane ɛ keli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">Ɛ tan naxanye ɛ minxi Alatalaa xɔlɔn dɔlɔ lengenna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">ɛ tan naxanye a xɔlɔ igelengenna rafexin minxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">han ɛ yi a ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">a yi ɛ xunna firifiri!<verse eid="ISA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18"/>Ɛ diin naxanye birin barixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">keden mi na naxan tiyɛ ɛ yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">Ɛ diin naxanye birin maxuruxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">keden mi na naxan ɛ yii rasuxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19"/>Tɔrɔn bata ɛ sɔtɔ firin firin yɛɛn ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">gbalon nun halagina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">fitina kamɛn nun yɛngɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">Anu, nde i ralimaniyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">nde i masabarɛ?<verse eid="ISA 51:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20"/>Ɛ banxulanne bata bira bɔxɔn ma kira xunne birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">e fugaxi a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">alo bolen na a suxu lutin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">e saxi Alatalaa xɔlɔn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">ɛ Ala bata a kɔnkɔ e ma.<verse eid="ISA 51:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21"/>Nanara, i tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:21">taa tɔrɔxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:21">i tan naxan xunna firifirixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:21">koni i mi dɔlɔ minxi!<verse eid="ISA 51:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22"/>Marigina Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">i ya Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">naxan a yamaan xun mayɛngɛma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">“N ni igelengenna bama nɛn i yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">naxan i xun magima a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">n ma xɔlɔ igelengenna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">I mi fa a minma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 51:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23"/>N na a soma nɛn muxune yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">naxanye yi i tɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">naxanye yi a falama i ma, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">‘I felen nxu xa dangu!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">I yi i fanna ti e xa alo bɔxɔna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">alo kirana dangu muxune xa.”<verse eid="ISA 51:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn xunba fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1"/>Ɛ xulun, ɛ xulun Siyon kaane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Ɛ mɔn xa sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Yerusalɛn taa sariɲanxin muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">ɛ dugi faɲine tongo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Bayo, xɔɲɛ sariɲantaren mi fa soma ɛ konni.<verse eid="ISA 52:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2"/>Ɛ yikunkun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">ɛ gbangbanna ba ɛ ma Siyon kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">Ɛ mɔn xa keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">ɛ dɔxɔ ɛ funfu fonni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">Ɛ lutine ba ɛ kɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">ɛ tan Yerusalɛn taan muxu suxine!<verse eid="ISA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:3">“Bayo ɛ matixi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:3">ɛ sare mi fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:3">ɛ mɔn xunbama nɛn, se mi fi.”<verse eid="ISA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4"/>Marigina Alatala mɔn ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:4">“N ma yamaan sigaxi nɛn Misiran yamanani singen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:4">a sa lu konyiyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:4">koni dɔnxɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:4">Asiriya kaane nan e ɲaxankata.”<verse eid="ISA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5"/>Alatalaa falan ni ito ra, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">“Iki, n fa nanse ligama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">N ma yamaan bata xali konyiyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">e mi sara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">Naxanye bata nɔɔn sɔtɔ e xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">ne sɔnxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">e n xinla rayelefuma waxatin birin.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6"/>“Nanara, n ma yamana n xinla kolonma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:6">nanara e a kolonma nɛn na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:6">a n tan nan falan tixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:6">n naxa, ‘N tan ni i ra!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7"/>Xɛra faɲi yibane faan lanxi geyane fari han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">naxanye bɔɲɛ xunbenla fe ralima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">naxanye fama sɛwa feen xibarun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">naxanye marakisina fe falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">naxanye a falama Siyon kaane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">e naxa, “Ɛ Ala nan mangan na!”<verse eid="ISA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8"/>Ɛ tuli mati ɛ taan kantan muxune xuiin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">E xuini tema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">e birin yi sɔnxɔ sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">bayo e Alatala toma fɛ Siyon taani e yɛtagi.<verse eid="ISA 52:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9"/>Ɛ xuini te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">ɛ gbelegbele sɛwani ɛ bode xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">Yerusalɛn taa kalaxin muxune!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">Bayo Alatala a yamaan masabarima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">a Yerusalɛn taan xunbama nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 52:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10"/>Alatala bata a yii sariɲanxin sɛnbɛn makɛnɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:10">siyane birin yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:10">bɔxɔn danne birin en ma Alaa marakisin toma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 52:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11"/>Ɛ siga, ɛ siga, ɛ mini na yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Ɛ nama din se sariɲantare yo ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Ɛ masiga e ra, ɛ yi sariɲan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">ɛ tan naxanye Alatalaa goronne maxalima!<verse eid="ISA 52:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12"/>Ɛ mafuraxin nama mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">ɛ nama siga ɛ giyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">bayo Alatala tixi ɛ yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">Isirayilaa Ala mɔn luma nɛn ɛ xanbi ra ɛ kantandeni.<verse eid="ISA 52:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alatalaa walikɛna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13"/>N ma walikɛna fe sabatima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:13">a fe yi mate, a yi tide gbeen sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:13">a binyen sɔtɔ,<verse eid="ISA 52:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14"/>hali a fe to findixi tɛrɛna feen na muxu wuyaxi xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:14">bayo a yɛtagin mi yi fa luxi alo muxuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:14">a kiin mi yi fa maliga adamadiin na.<verse eid="ISA 52:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15"/>Anu, a siya wuyaxine rasariɲanma nɛn wuli raxuyaxin xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">Falan yi ɲan mangane dɛ a yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">bayo e bata feen to naxan munma yi fala e xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">e munma yi naxan mɛ nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">e yi na famu.<verse eid="ISA 52:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1"/>Feen naxan nalixi en ma, nde laxi na ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:1">Alatala a sɛnbɛn makɛnɛn nde xa?<verse eid="ISA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2"/>Alaa walikɛɛn sabati nɛn a yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">alo sansi sonla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">alo wudi salenna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">naxan minima bɔxɔ xareni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">A mi yi tofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">a mi yi nɔrɔxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">naxan a ligɛ en yabu a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">A to ki yo mi yi en mabandunma.<verse eid="ISA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3"/>A yi raɲaxuxi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">muxune yi e mɛ a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">Muxu sɔxɔlɛxin nan yi a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">naxan bata yi dari tɔrɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">muxe mi yi wama naxan mato feni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">A yi raɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">en mi yi a yatɛxi se ra.<verse eid="ISA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4"/>Anu, a en ma furene sɔxɔlɛn nan tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">a yi a ti en ma tɔrɔne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">Koni, en yi mirixi a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">fa fala a Ala nan a ratɔrɔnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">a yi a ɲaxankata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">a yi a rayarabi.<verse eid="ISA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5"/>Anu, muxune a sɔxɔn en yulubine nan ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">a yi rahalagi en hakɛne fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">Maratɔrɔnna naxan bɔɲɛ xunbenla fiyɛ en ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">na yi sa a fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">en kɛndɛyaan sɔtɔxi a maxɔlɔne nan xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6"/>En birin bata yi lɔ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">alo xuruseene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">birin yi sigama a gbee kira nan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">koni Alatala yi en birin hakɛn goronna dɔxɔ a tan xun ma.<verse eid="ISA 53:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7"/>E a ɲaxankata nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">e a rayarabi, a mi sese fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">A yi lu alo yɛxɛɛ diin naxan xalima a faxadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">alo yɛxɛɛn naxan a dunduma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">e nɛma a fati ma xabene maxabɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">a mi sese fala.<verse eid="ISA 53:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8"/>A xali nɛn gbaloni, a makiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">koni nde yi kɔntɔfilixi na feen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">a waxatin muxune yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">Amasɔtɔ a ba nɛn ɲɛɲɛ muxune yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">ɲaxankatan yi sa a fari n ma yamaan yulubine fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 53:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9"/>A gaburun lu nɛn muxu ɲaxine yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">a maluxun nafulu kanne fɛma,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">53.9</char> Na feen sɛbɛxi Matiyu 27.57-60 kui.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">hali a to mi gbalo fe yo liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">a mi yanfa fala yo ti.<verse eid="ISA 53:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10"/>Alatala tin nɛn a xa halagi xɔlɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">bayo xa a niin ba tagi yitɔnna saraxan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">a mayixɛtɛne toma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">a siimayaan yi xunkuya ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">Alatala yi a sagoon nakamali a xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 53:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11"/>A niin sɔxɔlɛne dangu xanbini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">a kɛnɛnna toma nɛn, a wasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">A kolonna xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">n ma walikɛ tinxinxin muxu wuyaxi ratinxinma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">a yi e hakɛne goronna tongo.<verse eid="ISA 53:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12"/>Nanara, n tide gbeen soma a yii nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">a yi yɛngɛ se tongoxine yitaxun e nun sɛnbɛmane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">Amasɔtɔ a tin nɛn a sayaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">a yatɛ nɛn alo fe ɲaxi rabane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">a yi muxu wuyaxi yulubin goronna tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">a yi solonaan ti hakɛ kanne xa.<verse eid="ISA 53:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn mi fa rabeɲinxi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1"/>I tan Yerusalɛn taan naxan luxi alo gbantana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">i xa sɛwa, i tan naxan mi dii barixi!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">54.1</char> Yerusalɛn taan yatɛxi <char style="fk">gbantan</char> na nɛn bayo a muxune bata yi siga konyiyani yɛngɛn xɔn.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">I xa ɲaxan i sɔnxɔ sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">i tan naxan mi dii sɔtɔn xɔlɛn kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">Bayo ɲaxalan nabeɲinxina diine wuyama ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">dangu xɛmɛ taa ra dɔxɔn gbeene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">Alatala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 54:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2"/>I ya bubuni gbo, i yi a fari sa han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">I nama sikɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">i ya bubun lutine rakuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">i yi a sɛnbɛtɛnne xɔn din.<verse eid="ISA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ sabatima nɛn yiifanna nun kɔmɛnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:3">yamanane yi findi ɛ yixɛtɛne gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:3">e yi taa yigenle rafe.<verse eid="ISA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4"/>Ɛ nama gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">amasɔtɔ ɛ mi yagin sɔtɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">Ɛ nama kɔntɔfili amasɔtɔ ɛ mi rayagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">koni ɛ ɲinanma nɛn ɛ dii ɲɔrɛyaan yagin xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">ɛ mi fa ɛ mirima ɛ kaɲa gilɛyaan yagine ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 54:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5"/>Amasɔtɔ naxan ɛ daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">na luxi nɛn alo ɛ xɛmɛn nan na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">A xili nɛn Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin nan ɛ xunbama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">A xili nɛn bɔxɔn birin ma Ala.<verse eid="ISA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala mɔn ɛ xilima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">alo ɲaxanla naxan yi rabeɲinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">naxan sunuxi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">Muxun mi nɔɛ a foninge waxatin ɲaxanla ramɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">Ɛ Ala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7"/>N na ɛ rabeɲin nɛn waxatidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:7">koni n mɔn yi ɛ xɔn suxu kininkinin gbeeni.<verse eid="ISA 54:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8"/>N na n yɛtagin luxun nɛn ɛ ma waxatidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">n ma xɔlɔ gbeeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">Koni n kininkininma ɛ ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">n ma habadan hinanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">Alatala na nan falaxi naxan ɛ xunbama.<verse eid="ISA 54:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9"/>Ala naxa, “N na a ligama nɛn to</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">alo Nuhan waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">n na n kɔlɔ waxatin naxan yi fa fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">fufa gbeen mi fa sama bɔxɔ xɔnna xun ma sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">N mɔn bata n kɔlɔ na kiini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">n mi fa xɔlɔma ɛ xili ma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">n mi fa n kɔnkɔma ɛ ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 54:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10"/>Hali geyane xuruxurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">hali yire matexine yimaxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">n ma hinanna mi a makuyɛ ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">n ma bɔɲɛ xunbeli layirin mi kalɛ en tagi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">Alatala naxa na kiini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">naxan kininkininxi ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 54:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala mɔn Yerusalɛn tima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11"/>Yerusalɛn taa tɔrɔxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">foye gbeen naxan yimaxaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">muxu yo mi naxan madɛndɛnxi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">Awa, n tan, Ala, n mɔn Yerusalɛn taan tima nɛn gɛmɛ tofaɲine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">n mɔn yi a bɛtɛn sa gɛmɛ mamiloxi faɲine ra.<verse eid="ISA 54:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12"/>N taan makantan sangansone findima nɛn gɛmɛ gbeeli faɲine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:12">n yi taan so dɛɛne ti gɛmɛ fixɛ mayilenxine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:12">n taan nabilinna yinna ti bɔxɔ bun nafunle ra.<verse eid="ISA 54:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13"/>Ɛ diine birin findima nɛn Alatalaa xarandiine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:13">e bɔɲɛ xunbenla yi gbo ayi.<verse eid="ISA 54:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14"/>Ɛ sabatima nɛn tinxinyani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">Ɲaxankatan masigama ɛ ra nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">Ɛ mi fa gaxuma sese yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">gaxun masigama ɛ ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">a mi fa a masoma ɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 54:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15"/>Xa muxune ɛ yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">na mi kelixi n tan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">naxan yo na ɛ yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">na birama nɛn ɛ sanna bun!<verse eid="ISA 54:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16"/>A mato, n bata xabun da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">naxan tigen tɛɛn nafema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">naxan yɛngɛ so seen nafalama a kiini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">Koni n tan nan mɔn halagi tiin daxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">naxan a kalama.<verse eid="ISA 54:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17"/>Yɛngɛ so se yo na rafala ɛ xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">na mi fefe ligɛ ɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Naxan yo na ɛ tɔɲɛgɛ kitisadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">ɛ yoon sɔtɔma na ma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Alatalaa walikɛne na nan sɔtɔma e kɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">n bata na kitin sa e xun mayɛngɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 54:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa marakisin sare mi na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1"/>Min xɔnla ɛ tan naxanye birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">ɛ birin xa fa, igen ni i ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">Hali gbeti mi ɛ yii, ɛ fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">ɛ fa donseen sara, ɛ a don!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">Ɛ fa minseen nun nɔnɔn sara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">gbeti mi fima, a sare mi fima.<verse eid="ISA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2"/>Nanfera ɛ seen sarama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">donse mi naxan na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">Nanfera ɛ yɛtɛ yixadanma seene fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">naxanye mi ɛ wasama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">Nayi, ɛ tuli mati n na ki faɲi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">ɛ yi donse kɛndɛn don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">donse ɲaxumɛne yi ɛ nii yifan ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3"/>Ɛ tuli mati, ɛ fa n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">ɛ n xuiin namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">ɛ nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">N habadan layirin xidima en tagi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">alo n hinanna nun tinxinna naxan yita Dawuda ra.<verse eid="ISA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4"/>N bata Dawuda findi seren na siyane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:4">e nun mangana siyane xun na.<verse eid="ISA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5"/>Ɛ siyana ndee xilima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">ɛ mi naxanye kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">siyaan naxanye mi ɛ kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">ne yi e gi e fa ɛ fɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">Alatalaa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">ɛ Ala Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">naxan xunnayerenna fima ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6"/>Ɛ Alatala fen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:6">a tinma ɛ xa a to waxatin naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:6">Ɛ a xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:6">a maso ɛ ra waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7"/>Muxu ɲaxin xa xɛtɛ a kiraan fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">hakɛ kanna xa a miriyane lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">a tubi Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">naxan kininkininma a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">en ma Ala naxan a mafeluma hinanni.<verse eid="ISA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8"/>Alatalaa falan ni ito ra, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:8">“Bayo n ma miriyane mi ɛ miriyane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:8">ɛ kirane mi lanxi n ma kiraan ma.<verse eid="ISA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9"/>Kore xɔnna matexi bɔxɔn xun ma kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">n fan ma kirane fisa ɛ kirane xa na kii nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">n ma miriyane fan yi fisa ɛ miriyane xa na kiini.”<verse eid="ISA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10"/>Tulen nun balabalan kɛsɛne godoma keli kore</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">anu, e wuyenna mi tɛ kore</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">fɔ bɔxɔ xɔnni kun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">e yi seene rasoli, e sabati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">e yi findi sansi bogine ra xɛɛ biine xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">e findi donseen na kamɛtɔne xa.<verse eid="ISA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11"/>N ma falan fan na kii nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">naxan minima n dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">A yigenla mi xɛtɛ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">fɔ a n waxɔn feen liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">a n ma fe ragidixin nakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">n na a rasigaxi naxan na.<verse eid="ISA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12"/>Ɛ minima konyiyani sɛwan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">ɛ yi rafa bɔɲɛ xunbenli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">geyane nun yire matexine sɔnxɔma nɛn ɲaxanni ɛ yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">burunna wudine birin yi e yiine bɔnbɔ.<verse eid="ISA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13"/>Ɲali yirene yi findi fɔfɔ yirene ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">tansin yirene yi findi miriti wudi xiri ɲaxumɛ yirene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">Na findima nɛn xinla ra Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">habadan taxamasenna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">naxan mi kalama mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 55:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56"/>
  <para style="s">Ala Batu Banxin siyane birin xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">“Ɛ kiti kɛndɛn sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">ɛ tinxinyaan liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">amasɔtɔ n ma marakisin bata maso</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">n ma tinxinyaan makɛnɛnmatɔɔn ni i ra.<verse eid="ISA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2"/>Sɛwan na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">naxan na ligama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">adamadiin naxan na suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">a yi Matabu Lɔxɔn binya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">a mi a rayelefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">a yi a yiin ba fe ɲaxin birin yi.”<verse eid="ISA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3"/>Xɔɲɛn naxan findima Alatala gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">na nama a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">“Alatala n bama nɛn a yamaan yɛ!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">Hanma xɛmɛ tɛgɛnna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">56.3</char> <char style="fk">Xɛmɛ tɛgɛnna</char>: Na waxatini, mangane yi xɛmɛna ndee tɛgɛnma nɛn alogo e xa e yengi dɔxɔ mangana feene xɔn, e mi bira mangana ɲaxanle fɔxɔ ra. Be a sunuxi bayo a kolon a xinla lɔma ayi nɛn, a to mi diin barima. </note> yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">“Wudi xaren nan tun n tan na!”<verse eid="ISA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">“Naxanye n ma Matabu Lɔxɔn binyama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">e yi n nafan feen sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">e lu n ma layirin bun ki faɲi,<verse eid="ISA 56:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5"/>n yirena nde luma nɛn e xa n Batu Banxin nun a yinna kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">n yi e xinle sɛbɛ mɛnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">alogo ɲinan nama ti e xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">Na tɔnɔna e ma dangu dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">N xinla naxan fima e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">na luma nɛn habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">sese mi a bɛ na.<verse eid="ISA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6"/>Xɔɲɛn naxanye findixi Alatala gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">alogo e xa a batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">Alatala xinla rafan naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">naxanye birin Matabu Lɔxɔn binyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">e mi a rayelefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">e lu n ma layirin bun ki faɲi,<verse eid="ISA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7"/>n ne xalima nɛn n ma geya sariɲanxin fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">n yi e rasɛwa n xinla maxandi banxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">E saraxa gan daxine nun e saraxane rasuxuma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">n ma saraxa ganden fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">amasɔtɔ n ma banxin xili bama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">Ala maxandi banxina siyane birin xa.”<verse eid="ISA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8"/>Marigina Alatalaa falan ni ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">a tan naxan Isirayila muxu suxine malanma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">“N bata ndee malan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">n mɔn gbɛtɛye malanma nɛn sa ne fari.”<verse eid="ISA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Manga ɲaxine fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9"/>Ɛ tan burunna subene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:9">ɛ tan fɔtɔn yi subene, ɛ fa ɛ dɛge!<verse eid="ISA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10"/>Isirayila xun makantanne bata findi danxutɔne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">e mi sese kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">e bata findi bare bobone ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">naxanye mi nɔɛ wonwonɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">E luma saxi nɛn, e lu xiye sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">xixɔnla yi rafan e ma.<verse eid="ISA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11"/>Barene nan ne ra naxanye seni bɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">naxanye mi wasama mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">Xuruse rabane nan ne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">naxanye mi sese famuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">E birin sigama e gbee kiraan nan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">Birin biraxi a yɛtɛ tɔnɔn nan fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="ISA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12"/>E naxa, “Ɛ fa, nxu xa sa dɔlɔn fen!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">En dɔlɔn min han en xunna yi keli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">Tila fan luma nɛn alo to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">bayo a gbegbe mɔn luxi.”<verse eid="ISA 56:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1"/>Tinxindene halagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">koni muxu yo mi a mirima na feen ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">Lannaya muxune faxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">muxu yo mi a famuma fa fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">tinxindene faxama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">alogo e xa ba gbalo famatɔɔn yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2"/>Bayo naxanye sigan tima ɲɔndini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:2">ne soma bɔɲɛ xunbeli yiren nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:2">e matabuden sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3"/>Ɛ tan kɔɛramuxu diine, ɛ maso be,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:3">yalunde bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:3">naxan yalunyaan ligama!<verse eid="ISA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4"/>Ɛ nde magelema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">ɛ dɛɛn bandunma nde ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">ɛ lɛnna raminima nde ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">Ɛ mi findixi dii murutɛxine xan na ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">wule fala bɔnsɔnne,<verse eid="ISA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5"/>ɛ tan naxanye kunfan nagboma ayi wudine kideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">e nun wudi yifɔtɔnxine birin bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">ɛ tan naxanye ɛ diine kɔɛ raxaban darane kideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">e nun gɛmɛ longonne ra?<verse eid="ISA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6"/>Gɛmɛ malaxunxine nan ɛ kɛɛn na ɛ xude kidene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">ɛ gbeen ne nan na Isirayila kaane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">Ɛ minse saraxane bɔxɔnxi ne nan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">ɛ yi bogi se saraxane ba e xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">N nɔɛ diɲɛ na birin bun ba?<verse eid="ISA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7"/>Ɛ sa ɛ sadene tixi geya matexine nan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:7">ɛ tema mɛnna nin ɛ sa saraxane ba.<verse eid="ISA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8"/>Ɛ bata ɛ suxurene singan ɛ banxin dɛɛn nun a ti wudine xanbi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">Ɛ bata ɛ masiga n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">ɛ ragenla yi lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">ɛ te ɛ sade xungbeen ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">ɛ nun muxune yi lanna raso ɛ tagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">a rafan ɛ ma ɛ nun naxanye xa kafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">ɛ yi lu ne matoɛ.<verse eid="ISA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9"/>Ɛ bata siga turen na manga gbeen kideni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">57.9</char> Waxatina nde, <char style="fk">Manga gbeeni</char> ito findixi suxurena nde nan na.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">ɛ yi latikɔnɔnna ragbo ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">Ɛ bata ɛ xɛrane rasiga pon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">ɛ yi godo han laxira yi.<verse eid="ISA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10"/>Ɛ bata ɛ yixadan na sigatine yi han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">koni ɛ mi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">ɛ naxa, “A lu na!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">Ɛ mɔn ɛ sɛnbɛ soxi, ɛ mi xadanxi.<verse eid="ISA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11"/>Nayi, ɛ yi gaxuxi nde yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">naxan a liga, ɛ n yanfa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">n ma fe mi fa rabiraxi ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">ɛ mɔn mi ɛ mirima n ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">N to dunduxi xabu to mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">na nan a ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">ɛ mi fa gaxuma n yɛɛ ra ba?<verse eid="ISA 57:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12"/>Koni n na ɛ gbee tinxinna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:12">nun ɛ kɛwanle raminima nɛn kɛnɛnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:12">E tɔnɔ mi luma ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 57:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13"/>Ɛ na ɛ xui ramini malina fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">ɛ suxure kurun xa ɛ xunba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Foyena e birin xalima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">foyedi xurun yi e tongo a siga e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Koni naxan na a yigiya n tan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">na yamanan sɔtɔma nɛn a kɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">n ma geya sariɲanxin yi findi a gbeen na.<verse eid="ISA 57:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala a yamaan nakɛndɛyama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14"/>A falama nɛn nayi, fa fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:14">“Ɛ kirani tɔn ki faɲi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:14">ɛ kiraan kalaxi yirene birin nafala n ma yamaan yɛɛ ra.”<verse eid="ISA 57:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15"/>Amasɔtɔ kore xɔnna Ala matexina ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">naxan na yi habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">naxan xili sariɲan, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">“N dɔxi yire matexi sariɲanxin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">koni n mɔn muxu ɲaxankataxine xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">naxanye e yɛtɛ magodoxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">alogo n xa muxu nii sɔxɔlɛxine rasɛwa.<verse eid="ISA 57:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16"/>N mi luma yalagin tiyɛ waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">n mi luyɛ xɔlɔxi habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">bayo muxune niin bama nɛn n yɛtagi nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">n naxanye daxi, ne yi raxɔri.<verse eid="ISA 57:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17"/>N bɔɲɛn bata te Isirayila kaane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">lan e hakɛ tongoxine fe ma milɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">n yi e ɲaxankata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">n yi n yɛtagin luxun e ma n ma xɔlɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">Anu, e tengbesenxin bata lu e bɔɲɛna kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 57:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18"/>N bata e kɛwanle to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:18">koni n na e yiyalanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:18">n yi ti e yɛɛ ra, n mɔn yi e madɛndɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:18">e nun naxanye sunuxi e fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="ISA 57:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19"/>N tantun falan sama nɛn e dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">Bɔɲɛ xunbeli dɛfexin yi lu muxune xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">naxanye makuya e nun naxanye maso!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">N na e rakɛndɛyama nɛn.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">Alatala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 57:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20"/>Koni muxu ɲaxine luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:20">alo fɔxɔ igen naxan walanxi ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:20">naxan mi nɔɛ a raxarɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:20">naxan walanye boron nun lɔxɔn nakelima.<verse eid="ISA 57:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21"/>N ma Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:21">“Bɔɲɛ xunbeli mi muxu ɲaxine xa!”<verse eid="ISA 57:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58"/>
  <para style="s">Sunna naxan nafan Ala ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1"/>Sɔnxɔ i xuini texin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">I xuini te han alo xɔta xuina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">i n ma yamana murutɛna fe rali e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">i yi Yaxuba yixɛtɛne yulubina fe fala e xa!<verse eid="ISA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2"/>E waxi n tan nan fen fe yi lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">e sɔbɛ soxi n ma kiraan kolon feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">alo yamaan naxanye yi tinxinyaan ligama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">naxanye mi e mɛxi e Alaa kiti kɛndɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">E n maxɔdinma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">a n xa kiti tinxinxine sa e xa.<verse eid="ISA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3"/>E naxa, “Nxu sunna suxuma nanfera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">xa i mi a toma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">Nxu nxu yɛtɛ tɔrɔma nanfera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">xa i mi na yatɛxi?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">Anu, ɛ na sunna suxu lɔxɔn naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">ɛ ɛ rafan feene nan ligama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">ɛ yi ɛ walikɛne ɲaxankata.<verse eid="ISA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4"/>Ɛ nɛma sunni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔn nun yɛngɛne na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">ɛ bɔnbɔn ti a ɲaxin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">Koni xa ɛ sunna suxu alo to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">ɛ xuiin mi Ala lima.<verse eid="ISA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5"/>N na ɛ xaranxi na sunna sifan nan ma ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">alogo tun muxun xa a yɛtɛ tɔrɔ lɔxɔna nde yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">alogo tun muxun xa a xun sin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">alo sɛxɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">a yi sunu dugine ragodo a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">a yi a sa xubeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Ɛ na nan ma ba, a sunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">lɔxɔn naxan nafan Alatala ma?<verse eid="ISA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6"/>N na ɛ xaranxi sun suxu kiini ito nan ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">Ɛ yɔlɔnxɔn ɲaxine ba muxune ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">ɛ konyine fulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">ɛ muxu ɲaxankataxine xɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">ɛ xun xidi wudine birin kala.<verse eid="ISA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7"/>Feni itoe xa mi a ra ba:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">Ɛ donseni taxun ɛ nun kamɛtɔne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">ɛ yiigelitɔne yigiya ɛ konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">yigiyade mi naxanye yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">ɛ dugin so muxune yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">marabɛnna naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">ɛ ba ɛ xun xanbi soɛ ɛ ngaxakedenne yi?<verse eid="ISA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8"/>Nayi, ɛ yanbanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">alo kuye bamatɔna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">ɛ yi kɛndɛya mafurɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">ɛ tinxinyaan yi ti ɛ yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">Alatalaa binyen yi ɛ kantan ɛ xanbi ra.<verse eid="ISA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9"/>Nayi, ɛ xinla tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">Alatala yi ɛ yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">ɛ xui raminima nɛn a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">a yi a fala, a naxa, “N tan ni i ra!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">Xa ɛ konyiya feene masiga ɛ konna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">ɛ ba ɛ yii sonla tiyɛ bonne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">ɛ ba fala ɲaxine tiyɛ,<verse eid="ISA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10"/>xa ɛ ɛ yɛtɛ fi kamɛtɔne fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">ɛ muxu ɲaxankataxine ralugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">nayi, ɛ yanbanma nɛn dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">kɔɛɛn yi lu ɛ xa alo yanyi tagina.<verse eid="ISA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11"/>Alatala tima nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">a yi ɛ rawasa tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">a yi ɛ fati bɛndɛn sɛnbɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">Nayi, ɛ luma nɛn alo nakɔ ige saxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">alo tigin naxan mi xarama.<verse eid="ISA 58:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12"/>Yire kalaxi fonne mɔn tima nɛn ɛ barakani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">ɛ benbane banxi kalaxine mɔn yi bɛtɛn sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">a yi fala ɛ ma, a “Yinna yinle yitɔn muxun naxanye kirane nun dɔxɔdene rafalama.”<verse eid="ISA 58:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Matabu Lɔxɔna fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13"/>Xa i yɛtɛ suxu Matabu Lɔxɔn kala feen ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">i ba i yɛtɛ rafan feene ligɛ n ma lɔxɔ sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">xa i a fala Matabu Lɔxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">a “sɛwa lɔxɔna,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">i yi a fala Alatalaa lɔxɔ sariɲanxin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">a “lɔxɔ binyena,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">i yi a binya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">i mi siga i yɛtɛ a kiraan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">i mi i yɛtɛ rafan fe liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">hanma i fala fuune ti,<verse eid="ISA 58:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14"/>nayi, i sɛwama nɛn Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">n yi i rate bɔxɔn yire matexine fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">n yi i balo i benba Yaxuba kɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">Alatala dɛ xuiin nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 58:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59"/>
  <para style="s">Yulubin naxanye ɛ masigama Alatala ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1"/>Alatala yiin mi dungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:1">a yi ɛ rakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:1">Tuli xɔri mi a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:1">naxan mi ɛ xuiin namɛ.<verse eid="ISA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2"/>Koni ɛ hakɛne nan ɛ masigama ɛ Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:2">ɛ yulubine nan a yɛtagin luxunma ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:2">naxan a ligama a mi ɛ xuiin namɛma.<verse eid="ISA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3"/>Bayo faxa ti wunla ɛ yiine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">ɛ yiine hakɛ feene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">wulena ɛ dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">tinxintareya falan nan ɛ lɛnna ma.<verse eid="ISA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4"/>Muxu yo mi a mawugama tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">muxu yo mi kitin yɛbama ɲɔndini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">muxune yigi saxi e fala fuune nun wule falane nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">Fe kobin muxune kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">alo e fudi kanna na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">e yi lu hakɛne barɛ.<verse eid="ISA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5"/>E koso xɛlɛne birama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">e yalane yitɔnma muxune yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">alo simisamana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">Naxan na e xɛlɛne don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">na yi faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">anu xa keden bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">saɲi ɲaxin nan minima a kui.<verse eid="ISA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6"/>E fan mi yalani tɔnma dugin xan na de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">e mi nɔɛ e ragenla luxunɲɛ e yii fɔxɔne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">Hakɛne nan ne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">gbalon nan tun e yiine ra.<verse eid="ISA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7"/>E sanne e rasigan fe ɲaxini mafurɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">E mafura sɔntarene wunla raminɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">e miriyane ɲaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">gbalon nun kalan nan e kirane xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8"/>E mi bɔɲɛ xunbenla kiraan kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">Kiti kɛndɛn mi e kiraan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">E kira yifuxine nan nafalama e yɛtɛ xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">naxan yo na siga e xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">na mi bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔma.<verse eid="ISA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa yamaan yi e ti e yulubine ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9"/>Nanara, kiti kɛndɛn makuya en na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">tinxinna mi a masoma en na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">En yengi kɛnɛnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">koni en dimin nin!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">Kɛnɛnna na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">koni en sigan tima banban dimin nin.<verse eid="ISA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10"/>En tantanma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">alo danxutɔne nɛma sigan tiyɛ banxin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">a luxi alo en yɛɛ mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">en tantanma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">En na en sanna radinma yanyin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">alo fitirin na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">En luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">alo faxa muxune niiramane yɛ.<verse eid="ISA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11"/>En sɔnxɔma alo kanko xaɲɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">en kutunma alo ganbane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">En yengi a ma kiti kɛndɛn xa sa en xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">koni na mi ligama!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">En yengi kisin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">koni a makuya en na!<verse eid="ISA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12"/>Amasɔtɔ nxɔ matandine gbo i tan Ala yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">nxɔ yulubine sereyaan bama nxu xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">nxɔ matandine nxu fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">nxu nxu hakɛne kolon:<verse eid="ISA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13"/>Nxu bata murutɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">nxu Alatala yanfa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">nxu yi nxu masiga nxɔ Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">Nxu gbalo feene nun murutɛ feene nan falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">nxu wulene fala nxu bata naxanye yitɔn nxu bɔɲɛni.<verse eid="ISA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14"/>Nanara, nxu nxu mɛma kiti kɛndɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">tinxinyaan yi masiga nxu ra pon!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">Lannayaan bata kala yamani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">ɲɔndi fala mi na.<verse eid="ISA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15"/>Lannayaan bata lɔ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">naxan na a mɛ fe ɲaxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">na yi findi muxu kansun daxin na.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ISA 59:15">Ala fama Yerusalɛn yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">Alatala yi a to a kiti kɛndɛn mi fa na mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">na yi raɲaxu a ma.<verse eid="ISA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16"/>A yi a to a muxu faɲi keden peen mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">Na yi a ratɛrɛna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">fa fala a solona muxu mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">Nayi, a yɛtɛɛn yi marakisin ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">a tinxinyaan yi findi a mali seen na.<verse eid="ISA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17"/>A yi tinxinyaan findi a kanke yɛ masansanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">a yi kisin findi a xunna makantan wure kɔmɔtin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">a gbee ɲɔxɔn yatɛ a dugin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">a yi a yɛtɛ rabilin a xanuntenya gbeen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">alo doma gbeena.<verse eid="ISA 59:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18"/>A muxune birin kɛwanla saranma e ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">a yi fitinan nagidi a yɛngɛ faane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">a yi a gbeen ɲɔxɔ a yaxune ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">a yi ige tagi bɔxɔne saran</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">alo a lan e ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 59:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19"/>Nayi, muxune gaxuma nɛn Alatala xinla yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">sa keli sogeteden ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">han sa dɔxɔ sogegododen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">Yaxune na fa alo baana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">Alatala dɛ foyena e radinma ayi nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 59:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20"/>Xunba tiin fama nɛn Siyon taani Yaxuba yixɛtɛne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:20">naxanye na xɛtɛ e Ala matandine fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:20">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 59:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21"/>Alatala naxa, “N ma layirin ni ito ra nxu nun ne tagi: N ma Nii Sariɲanxin naxan ɛ ma, e nun n ma falane n naxanye rasoxi ɛ dɛ, ne mi bama ɛ dɛ, e mɔn mi bama ɛ diine dɛ, e mɔn mi bama ɛ diine yixɛtɛne dɛ keli iki ma han habadan!” Alatala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 59:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60"/>
  <para style="s">Alatalaa binyen Yerusalɛn yi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1"/>Ɛ keli, ɛ yanban,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:1">amasɔtɔ ɛ kɛnɛnna bata fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:1">Alatalaa binyen bata te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:1">alo sogena, a dɛgɛma ɛ xun ma.<verse eid="ISA 60:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2"/>Ɛ a mato, dimin bata sin bɔxɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">e nun dimin gbeen yamanane xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">koni Alatala bata mini kɛnɛnni ɛ tan xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">a binyen yi godo ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3"/>Siyane sigan tima ɛ kɛnɛnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:3">ɛ mayiyalanna yi kɛnɛnna fi mangane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:3">alo sogen tematɔna.<verse eid="ISA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4"/>Ɛ yɛɛ rakoɲin ɛ rabilinni:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">birin e malanma, e fama ɛ fɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">Ɛ dii xɛmɛne fama sa keli yire makuyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">ɛ dii tɛmɛne maxalima muxune yii kanke.<verse eid="ISA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5"/>Ɛ na a to, ɛ sɛwan gboma ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">ɛ bɔɲɛn dinma nɛn sɛwani, ɛ ɲaxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">bayo fɔxɔ igen nafunle e xun sama ɛ ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">siyane nafunle yi fa ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6"/>Ɲɔgɔmɛ kurune luma nɛn ɛ yamanan birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">Midiyan nun Efa bɔnsɔnne ɲɔgɔmɛ kɛndɛne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">Muxune birin fama nɛn xɛmaan nun wusulanna ra ɛ xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">sa keli Saba yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">e fa Alatalaa binyen naliyɛ.<verse eid="ISA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7"/>Kedari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">60.7</char> <char style="fk">Kedari</char> findixi Sumayilaa diin nan na. Na feen sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 25.13 kui.</note> bɔnsɔnna xuruse kurune birin malanma nɛn ɛ konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">Nebayoti bɔnsɔnna xuruseene luma nɛn ɛ sagoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">e ba saraxa gan daxine ra n ma saraxa ganden fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">e yi rafan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">N yi a liga n ma banxi nɔrɔxin yi nɔrɔ han!<verse eid="ISA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8"/>Ndee ne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:8">naxanye tuganma alo kundana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:8">alo ganban naxanye tuganma siga e tɛɛn ma?<verse eid="ISA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9"/>Ige tagi bɔxɔne yigi saxi n tan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">Tarasisi kunkine sigama kunkin bonne yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">sa fa ɛ diine ra sa keli yire makuyeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">e nun e gbeti fixɛn nun e xɛmana Alatalaa xinla fe ra, ɛ Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">naxan nɔrɔn fixi ɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10"/>Xɔɲɛne mɔn ɛ taan makantan yinna tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">e mangane yi findi ɛ walikɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">bayo n na ɛ ɲaxankata nɛn n ma xɔlɔ gbeeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">koni n kininkininma nɛn ɛ ma n ma hinanni.<verse eid="ISA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11"/>Ɛ taan so dɛɛne luma nɛn nabixi habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">e mi balanɲɛ kɔɛɛn na e mi balanɲɛ yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">alogo siyane nafunle xa so ɛ konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">e nun e mangane nun e fɔxɔ ra birane.<verse eid="ISA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12"/>Bayo, siyaan nun yamanan naxanye mi walɛ ɛ tan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:12">ne halagima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:12">E raxɔrima nɛn fefe!<verse eid="ISA 60:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13"/>Liban yamanan binyen fama nɛn ɛ konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">fɔfɔne nun gbinɲɛne nun xarinne birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">alogo e xa fa n ma yire sariɲanxin nayabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">alogo n xa n san tiden binyen nagbo ayi.<verse eid="ISA 60:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14"/>Ɛ ɲaxankata muxune diine fama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">e fa e felen ɛ yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">muxun naxanye ɛ raɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">ne birin yi fa e xinbi sin ɛ bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">E yi a fala ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">a “Alatalaa taana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxina taana, Siyon.”<verse eid="ISA 60:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15"/>Ɛ yi rabeɲinxi, ɛ raɲaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">muxu yo mi yi fa danguma ɛ konni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">Iki, n xunna kenla fima ɛ ma nɛn habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">n yi ɛ findi sɛwa xunna ra mayixɛtɛ nun mayixɛtɛne xa.<verse eid="ISA 60:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16"/>Ɛ siyane nun e mangane nafunle donma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">nayi, ɛ yi a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">a n tan nan Alatala ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">naxan ɛ rakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">ɛ xunbamana, Yaxubaa Ala Sɛnbɛmana.<verse eid="ISA 60:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17"/>N xɛmaan nafama nɛn ɛ ma sulan ɲɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">e nun wure gbetina wure fɔrɛn ɲɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">N sulan nafama ɛ ma nɛn wudin ɲɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">e nun wuren na gɛmɛn ɲɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">N yɛɛratine nun kuntigine fi ɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">naxanye bɔɲɛ xunbenla nun tinxinyaan nasoma.<verse eid="ISA 60:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18"/>Gbalona fe mi fa mɛma ɛ yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">hanma kalana hanma halagina ɛ bɔxɔn danne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">ɛ yi ɛ taan makantan yinna xili sa “Marakisina,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">ɛ yi ɛ taan so dɛɛne xili sa “Tantunna.”<verse eid="ISA 60:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19"/>Sogen xa mi fa findima kɛnɛnna ra ɛ xa yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">hanma kike dɛgɛna kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">koni Alatala nan fa findima kɛnɛnna ra ɛ xa habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">ɛ Ala yi findi ɛ binyen na.<verse eid="ISA 60:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20"/>Sogen mi fa birama ɛ konni sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">kiken mi fa godoma ɛ konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">bayo Alatala nan findima kɛnɛnna ra ɛ xa habadan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">ɛ sunu lɔxɔne yi ɲan.<verse eid="ISA 60:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21"/>Nayi, tinxin muxune nan tun fa luma ɛ yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">yamanan findima nɛn e gbeen na habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">E tan findima nɛn n ma sansi sonla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">n naxan sixi n yiine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">alogo e xa n ma binyen makɛnɛn.<verse eid="ISA 60:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22"/>Naxan xurun ɛ tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">na muxu wuli keden naminima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">muxudina ɛ tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">na bɔnsɔnna yi findi siya sɛnbɛmaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">N tan Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">n na feene rabama nɛn mafurɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">e waxatin na a li.<verse eid="ISA 60:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61"/>
  <para style="s">Marakisi xɛrana</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1"/>Marigina Alatalaa Niina n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">bayo Alatala bata n sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">a n xa Xibaru Faɲin nali yiigelitɔne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">a bata n nasiga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">a n xa muxu bɔɲɛ kalaxine mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">a n xa xɔrɔya feen kawandin ba suxu muxune xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">e nun kasorasane beɲin fena.<verse eid="ISA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2"/>N yi Alatalaa hinan ɲɛɛna fe rali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:2">e nun en ma Ala gbeeɲɔxɔ lɔxɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:2">alogo n xa muxu sunuxine madɛndɛn,<verse eid="ISA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3"/>naxanye wugama Siyon taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">n yi ne ralimaniya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">Benun e xa xuben sa e xunni sununi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">n yi mangaya kɔmɔti faɲin so e xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">n sɛwa turen sa e xunni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">benun a xa findi sunun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">n tantun dugin nagodo e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">benun a xa findi xaxili kalan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">alogo muxune xa a fala e ma misaala ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">fa fala muxu tinxinxine alo warine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">Alatala muxun naxanye rasabatixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">alogo a binyen xa makɛnɛn.<verse eid="ISA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4"/>E mɔn singe ra fonne taa xɔnne tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">e yire kalaxi fonne yitɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">e yi taa rabeɲinxine ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">dɛnaxanye kalaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">xabu mayixɛtɛ danguxine.<verse eid="ISA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5"/>Xɔɲɛne findima nɛn ɛ xuruse rabane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:5">siya gbɛtɛne diine yi findi ɛ xɛɛ biine nun manpa bili nakɔ walikɛne ra.<verse eid="ISA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6"/>Koni a falama ɛ tan ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">a Alatalaa saraxaraline,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">a fala ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">a en ma Ala batu muxune.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">Ɛ baloma nɛn siyane nafunle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">ɛ yi ɛ kanba e binyeni.<verse eid="ISA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7"/>Benun ɛ xa yagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">ɛ seene dɔxɔde firin sɔtɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">Benun ɛ xa rayarabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">ɛ gbelegbelema nɛn sɛwani ɛ kɛɛna fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">Ɛ yi kɛɛn dɔxɔde firin sɔtɔ ɛ yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">ɛ yi habadan sɛwan sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8"/>Bayo, kiti kɛndɛn nafan n tan Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">muɲan nun tinxintareyaan naɲaxu n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">N na ɛ saranma nɛn n ma tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">n yi habadan layirin xidi en tagi.<verse eid="ISA 61:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9"/>Ɛ bɔnsɔnna kolonma nɛn siyane tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">ɛ yixɛtɛne yi kolon yamanan muxune birin yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">Naxan yo na e to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">a a kolonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">a Alatalaa duba diine nan e ra.<verse eid="ISA 61:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala wali faɲi kolon bɛtina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10"/>N sɛwama nɛn Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">n niin yi sɛwa n ma Ala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">bayo a bata n maxidi marakisi dugine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">a yi tinxinyaan nagodo n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">alo domana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">alo xɛmɛn ɲaxalandi kanna a xunna maxidima kii naxan yi alo saraxaralina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">alo ɲaxalandina a maxidi seene soma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 61:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11"/>Marigina Alatala tinxinyaan nun tantunna raminima nɛn siyane birin yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:11">alo bɔxɔn soli seene raminin kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:11">alo nakɔɔn sansine ramini kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 61:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn taan nakisi fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1"/>Siyon taana fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">n mi n dunduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">Yerusalɛn ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">n mi n naxarama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">han a tinxinyaan yi makɛnɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">alo sogen tematɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">a marakisin yi mayilen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">alo xaye xidi dɛgɛne dimini.<verse eid="ISA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2"/>Nayi, siyane ɛ tinxinna toma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">mangane birin yi ɛ binyen to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">ɛ yi xili nɛnɛn sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">Alatala na naxan fala a dɛɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3"/>Ɛ findima nɛn manga kɔmɔti mayilenxin na Alatala yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:3">e nun mangaya taxamaseri namuna ɛ Ala yii.<verse eid="ISA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4"/>A mi fa falama ɛ ma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">fa fala “Yama rabeɲinxina.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">A mi fa falama ɛ bɔxɔn ma sɔnɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">fa fala “Bɔxɔ raxɔrixina.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">Koni ɛ xili bama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">fa fala “N nafan yirena,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">a fala ɛ bɔxɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">fa fala “Ɲaxalan futuxina.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">Bayo ɛ rafan Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">a findima nɛn ɛ bɔxɔn kanna ra.<verse eid="ISA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5"/>Ɛ diine ɛ yamanan masuxuma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">alo banxulanna sungutunna futuma kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">ɛ yi findi sɛwan na ɛ Ala xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">alo ɲaxalandina a xɛmɛn nasɛwama kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ISA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6"/>Yerusalɛn kaane, n bata kantan tiine dɔxɔ ɛ taan makantan yinna xuntagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">e mi e dunduma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">Ɛ tan naxanye taana fe rabirama Alatala ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">ɛ nɛma a maxandɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">ɛ nama ɛ matabu de!<verse eid="ISA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7"/>Ɛ mɔn nama tin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">a fan xa a raxara</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">han a yi Yerusalɛn rasabati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">bɔxɔ xɔnna muxune birin yi a tantun.<verse eid="ISA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8"/>Alatala bata a kɔlɔ a yiifanna nun a sɛnbɛ gbeeni, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">“N mi fa ɛ bogi seene soma ɛ yaxune yii e balon na mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">xɔɲɛne mi fa ɛ manpa nɛnɛn minɲɛ mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">ɛ wali xɔnna.<verse eid="ISA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9"/>Koni naxanye bogi seene xabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">ne nan e donma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">e Alatala tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">naxanye na manpa bogine malan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">ne nan e igen minma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">n ma yire sariɲanxin yinna kui.”<verse eid="ISA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10"/>Ɛ mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">ɛ mini taan so dɛɛne ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">Ɛ kirani tɔn yamaan yɛɛ ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">Ɛ kiraan nafala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">ɛ a rafala, ɛ gɛmɛne ba a xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">ɛ taxamasenni te, a siyane xa fa.<verse eid="ISA 62:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11"/>Ɛ a mato, Alatala a xuiin naminima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">han bɔxɔn danne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">a naxa, “Ɛ a fala Siyon kaane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">ɛ naxa, ‘Ɛ a mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">ɛ rakisimaan fama!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">Ɛ a mato, a fama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">e nun a muxu sɔtɔxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">a kɔntɔnna biraxi a fɔxɔ ra.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12"/>A falama nɛn ne ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">a “Yama Sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">Alatalaa Muxu Xunbaxine.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">A falama nɛn ne ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">a “Ala Yamaan Naxan Xɔn Fenxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">Taan Naxan Mi Fa Rabeɲinxi.”<verse eid="ISA 62:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63"/>
  <para style="s">Ala gbeeɲɔxɔ lɔxɔna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1"/>Nde ito ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">naxan fama sa keli Edɔn yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">naxan keli Bosara taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">dugi gbeela ragodoxi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">a maxidixi dugi mayilenxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">a sigan tima xunna kenli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">a sɛnbɛn binyeni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">Ala naxa, “N tan na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">naxan falan tima tinxinni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">naxan muxune rakisima a sɛnbɛni.”<verse eid="ISA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2"/>Nanfera i ya dugine gbeeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:2">alo naxanye manpa bogine yibodonma manpa ige badeni?<verse eid="ISA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3"/>Ala naxa, “N kedenna nan yi manpa bogine yibodonma manpa ige badeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">siyane muxu yo mi yi n fɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">Nayi, n yi e yidin n ma xɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">n fitinaxin yi e yibodon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">e wunla yi xuya n ma dugine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">e yi gbeeli.<verse eid="ISA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4"/>Bayo gbeeɲɔxɔ lɔxɔna fe yi n bɔɲɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:4">N ma yamaan xunba ɲɛɛn bata a li.<verse eid="ISA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5"/>N muxune fen nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">koni muxu yo mi fa n mali!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">N kabɛ na feen ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">fa fala muxu yo mi fa n sɛnbɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">Nayi, n yɛtɛɛn yiin nan marakisini tɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">n ma xɔlɔn yi findi n sɛnbɛn na.<verse eid="ISA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6"/>N yi yamanane yibodon n ma xɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:6">n fitinaxin yi e halagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:6">n yi e wunla xuya bɔxɔn ma.”<verse eid="ISA 63:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marabirana Alaa wali faɲine ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7"/>N na Alatala hinan wanle rabirama nɛn muxune ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">a lan a xa tantun naxanye fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">Alatala feen naxanye birin ligaxi en xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">a fanna Isirayila yamaan xa naxan gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">a naxan birin ligaxi a kininkininna nun a hinan gbeeni.<verse eid="ISA 63:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8"/>Bayo, a bata yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">“N ma yamaan nan e ra yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">n ma diin naxanye mi n yanfɛ!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">A yi findi e rakisimaan na.<verse eid="ISA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9"/>E tɔrɔne birin yi a fan tɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">malekan naxan a yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">na yi e rakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">A yɛtɛɛn yi e xunba a xanuntenyaan nun a kininkininni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">A tan nan e tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">a e mali waxati danguxine birin yi.<verse eid="ISA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10"/>Koni e murutɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">e yi a Nii Sariɲanxin nafɔrɔ a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">A yi findi e yaxun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">a tan yɛtɛɛn yi e yɛngɛ.<verse eid="ISA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11"/>Nayi, waxati danguxine fe yi rabira a yamaan ma, Musaa waxatina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">e yi a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">“Ala minɛn naxan e ragidi baani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">e nun a yamaan yɛɛratine?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">A minɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">naxan yi a Nii Sariɲanxin nagodoma e tagi?<verse eid="ISA 63:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12"/>Naxan a yii sɛnbɛmaan makɛnɛn Musa xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">a yi lu a xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">a yi igeni taxun e yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">alogo a xinla xa lu habadan.<verse eid="ISA 63:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13"/>Nde yi tixi e yɛɛ ra dangu tilinna xɔnna ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:13">E mi e sanna radin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:13">alo soon nɛma a giyɛ tonbonni.<verse eid="ISA 63:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14"/>Alatalaa Nii Sariɲanxin yi e xali matabuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">alo xuruseen naxan godoma lanbanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">I tixi i ya yamaan yɛɛ ra na kii nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">i yi xili binyen sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="ISA 63:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamana Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15"/>Ala, i yɛɛ masa nxu ma keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">i nxu mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">sa keli i dɔxɔde sariɲanxi nɔrɔxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">I ya xanuntenya gbeen nun i sɛnbɛ gbeen minɛn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">Nxu mi fa i ya marafanna nun i ya kininkininna toma.<verse eid="ISA 63:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16"/>Anu, i tan nan nxu fafe ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">Hali xa nxu benba Iburahima mi nxu kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">xa nxu benba Isirayila fan mi nxu kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">i tan Alatala, i tan nan nxu fafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">i xili nɛn, Nxu Xunbamana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">xabu to mi na ra.<verse eid="ISA 63:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17"/>Nanfera Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">i nxu makuyama i ya kiraan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">i nxu bɔɲɛni xɔdɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">alogo nxu nama gaxu i yɛɛ ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">I mɔn xa fa i ya walikɛne fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">i kɛɛ bɔnsɔnna fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 63:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18"/>Yamanan findixi nɛn i ya yama sariɲanxin gbeen na waxatidi tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:18">nxu yaxune yi i ya yire sariɲanxini bodon.<verse eid="ISA 63:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19"/>Xabu waxati xunkuye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">nxu luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">alo i mi yi muxun naxanye kari ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">e nun i xinla mi falama naxanye xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">Xa i yi kuyeni bɔɛ nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">xa i yi godɛ nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">geyane yi yimaxama i bun ma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 63:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1"/>Alo tɛɛ dɛgɛn tɛɛ wolonna ganma kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:1">igen yi a ramini tɛɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:1">i yaxune i xinla kolonma na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:1">siyane birin yi xuruxurun i yɛtagi.<verse eid="ISA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2"/>I fe magaxuxine liga nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">nxu yengi mi yi naxanye ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">i godo nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">geyane yi yimaxa i yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3"/>Xabu a rakuya, a munma kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">tuli yo munma a mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">yɛɛn munma a to singen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">fa fala alana nde na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">ba i tan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">muxuna a yigi sɛ naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">a yi a mali.<verse eid="ISA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4"/>I muxuni suxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">naxan tinxinna ligama sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">naxan a xaxili luma i ya kiraan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">Koni i bata xɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">bayo nxu luxi yulubin nan ligɛ waxatin birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">Nayi, nxu kisima di?<verse eid="ISA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5"/>Nxu birin bata lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">alo se haramuxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">nxu kɛwali tinxinxine birin luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">alo dunkobi xɔsixina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">Nxu birin xarama ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">alo ɲɔxɔnde xarene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">nxu yulubine nxu xalima alo foyena.<verse eid="ISA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6"/>Muxu yo mi na naxan i xinla xandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">a yi kata, a bira i fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">Bayo i bata i yɛtagin luxun nxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">i yi nxu lu halagini nxu yulubine fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7"/>Anu, Alatala, i tan nan nxu fafe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">Fɛɲɛ bɛndɛn nan nxu tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">fɛɲɛ rafalan nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">I tan nan yii fɔxɔ nxu tan birin na.<verse eid="ISA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8"/>Alatala, i nama xɔlɔ han a dangu ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">nxu yulubine fe nama rabira i ma han habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">Yandi, nxu mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">i ya yamaan nan nxu birin na!<verse eid="ISA 64:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9"/>I ya taa sariɲanxine bata findi tonbonne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:9">Siyon taan bata findi tonbonna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:9">Yerusalɛn taan bata findi yire rabeɲinxin na.<verse eid="ISA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10"/>Nxɔ Ala Batu Banxi sariɲanxi nɔrɔxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:10">nxu benbane yi i tantunma dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:10">tɛɛn bata na gan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:10">Nxu rafan se kɛndɛne birin bata kala.<verse eid="ISA 64:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11"/>Alatala, tɔrɔni ito birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">i mɔn mi fe ligama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">I mɔn luma dunduxi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">i yi nxu ratɔrɔn han a dangu ayi ba?<verse eid="ISA 64:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65"/>
  <para style="s">Kiti famatɔna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1"/>Naxanye mi yi n maxɔdinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">n bata n yɛtɛ yita ne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">Naxanye mi yi n fenma, ne bata n to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">Yamaan naxan mi yi n maxandima n xinli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">n yi a fala ne xa, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">“N tan ni i ra! N tan ni i ra!”<verse eid="ISA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2"/>N na n yiini bandunma yama murutɛxin xa fɛriɲɛn gbɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">naxanye sigan tima kiraan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">naxan mi fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">e lu e yɛtɛ miriyane fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="ISA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3"/>Yamaan na a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">naxan n naxɔlɔma n yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">e saraxane bama kide nakɔne yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">e wusulanne gan saraxa gande bitikidi daxine fari,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">65.3</char> <char style="fk">Bitikidin</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Birikidina</char>.”</note><verse eid="ISA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4"/>e dɔxɔma gaburu yirene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:4">e kɔɛɛn nadangu faranne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:4">e xɔsɛ subene don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:4">Donse haramuxine nan e goronne kui.<verse eid="ISA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5"/>E a falama, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">“I masiga, i nama i yiin din n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">n ma sariɲanna nɔrɔn gbo i ma.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">Na falana n tɔrɔma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">alo tɛɛ tutina n ɲɔɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">tɛɛn naxan luma dɛgɛ waxatin birin.<verse eid="ISA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6"/>Koni ito nan sɛbɛxi n yɛtagi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">N mi n dundɛ na feene ma mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">n na e saranma nɛn a dɛfexin na yati!<verse eid="ISA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7"/>N na e hakɛne yatɛma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">e nun e benbane hakɛne!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">E to wusulanna gan saraxan na geyane fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">e n naxɔlɔ yire matexine fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">n na e saranma nɛn e kɛwali fonne ra a dɛfexin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">N tan Alatala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">“Ige ɲaxumɛn na to manpa bogi tɔnsɔnna naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">muxune a falama nɛn, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">‘I nama a kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">bayo se faɲina nde a yi!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">N tan fan a ligama na kii nin n ma walikɛne fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">alogo e birin nama halagi.<verse eid="ISA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9"/>N mayixɛtɛna nde raminima nɛn Yaxuba bɔnsɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">n yi n ma geyane findi Yuda bɔnsɔnna ndee gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">n naxanye sugandixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">e yi findi ne kɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">n ma walikɛne yi dɔxɔ e yi.<verse eid="ISA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10"/>Sarɔn yamanan yi findi xuruse rabaden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">Akori lanbanna yi findi ɲinge kurune saden na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">n ma yamaan xa naxan n fenma.”<verse eid="ISA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11"/>“Koni ɛ tan naxanye ɛ mɛma Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">ɛ ɲinan n ma geya sariɲanxin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">ɛ yi donseene rafala Gadi suxuren xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">ɛ yi igelengenne rafe dɔlɔ basanxine ra Meni suxuren xa,<verse eid="ISA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12"/>n sayaan nan nagidima ɛ ma silanfanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">Ɛ birin ɛ xinbi sinma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">ɛ kɔɛ raxaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">bayo n bata xinla ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">ɛ mi n yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">n falan ti, ɛ mi ɛ tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">Naxan ɲaxu Ala yɛɛ ra yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">ɛ yi na liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">naxan mi rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">ɛ yi na sugandi.”<verse eid="ISA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13"/>Nanara, Marigina Alatala ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">a naxa, “N ma walikɛne e dɛgema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">koni kamɛna ɛ tan suxuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">N ma walikɛne e minma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">koni min xɔnla ɛ tan suxuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">N ma walikɛne sɛwama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">koni ɛ tan yarabima nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 65:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14"/>N ma walikɛne e xuini tema nɛn ɲaxanni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:14">e bɔɲɛn sɛwaxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:14">koni ɛ tan, ɛ xuini tema nɛn sɔxɔlɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:14">ɛ bɔɲɛ kalaxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:14">ɛ gbelegbele nii rafɔrɛni.<verse eid="ISA 65:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15"/>Ɛ xinla findima nɛn danga ti seen na n ma muxu sugandixine xa, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:15">‘Marigina Alatala xa i fan faxa alo ne!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:15">Koni n ma walikɛne tan xili gbɛtɛ sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 65:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16"/>Naxan na duban ti yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">na duban tima nɛn Ala ɲɔndin kanna xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">Naxan na a kɔlɔ yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">na a kɔlɔma Ala ɲɔndin kanna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">bayo ɲinan tima nɛn tɔrɔ danguxine xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">e bama nɛn n yɛtagi.<verse eid="ISA 65:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17"/>Amasɔtɔ n kore xɔri nɛnɛn nun bɔxɔ xɔri nɛnɛn dama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:17">ɲinan yi ti waxati danguxin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:17">miri mi fa tima a xɔn mumɛ!<verse eid="ISA 65:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18"/>Koni ɛ sɛwama nɛn han habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">ɛ lu ɲaxanni na fe ra n naxan dama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">Bayo, n Yerusalɛn dama sɛwan nan xili yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">a muxune yi lu ɲaxanni.<verse eid="ISA 65:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19"/>N Yerusalɛn findima nɛn sɛwan na n xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">n yi ɲaxan n ma yamani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">Wuga xuiin nun gbelegbele xuiin mi fa mɛma a yi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 65:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20"/>A mi fa ligama mɛnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">diin bari nɛnɛn yi faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">a na xii dando ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">hanma fonne mi e siimayaan dɛfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">bayo muxun naxan mi forixi e tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">na mi faxɛ ɲɛɛ kɛmɛn xanbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">Yulubi kanna naxan ma siimayaan mi danguma ɲɛɛ kɛmɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">na yatɛma dangatɔɔn nan na.<verse eid="ISA 65:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21"/>E banxine tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:21">e dɔxɔ e kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:21">e sansine sima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:21">e yi e bogine don.<verse eid="ISA 65:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22"/>E mi fa banxine tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">muxu gbɛtɛ yi dɔxɔ e kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">E mi fa sansine sima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">muxu gbɛtɛ yi e bogin don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">bayo n ma muxune siimayaan luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">alo wudina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">n ma muxu sugandixine sɛwama nɛn e wali xɔnne fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 65:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23"/>E mi fa walima fuuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">e mi fa diine barima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">gbalon yi e sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">bayo e findima yamaan nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">Alatala barakan sama naxanye fe yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">e tan nun e yixɛtɛne.<verse eid="ISA 65:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24"/>Nayi, benun e xa n maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:24">n bata e yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:24">e nɛma falan ti, n bata e xuiin namɛ.<verse eid="ISA 65:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25"/>Kankon nun yɛxɛɛ diina e dɛgema nɛn e bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">yatan sɛxɛn donma nɛn alo ɲingena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">burunburunna yi findi saɲin balon na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">E mi fe ɲaxi yo ligama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">kala yo mi fa tiyɛ n ma geya sariɲanxin yire yo yi!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">Alatala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 65:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66"/>
  <para style="s">Ala batu ki kɛndɛna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">“Kore xɔnna nan n ma manga gbɛdɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">bɔxɔn yi findi n san tiden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">Ɛ nɔɛ banxin mundun tiyɛ n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">n ma matabuden findɛ minɛn na?<verse eid="ISA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2"/>N tan nan seni itoe birin daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">e yi lu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">Nayi, n na n yɛɛn tima muxun sifani ito nan na:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">tɔrɔ muxun naxan niin sɔxɔlɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">naxan xuruxurunma gaxuni n ma falan bun.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3"/>Naxan na ɲingen ba saraxan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na yatɛma nɛn alo muxu faxana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">naxan na yɛxɛɛn ba saraxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na luxi nɛn alo a baren nan faxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">naxan na bogi se saraxan ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">alo a xɔsɛn wunla nan nalima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">naxan na wusulanna gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">alo a suxuren nan kima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na muxune birin biraxi e yɛtɛ kirane nan fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">e haramu feene yi rafan e ma.<verse eid="ISA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4"/>N fan fe xɔdɛxɛn nan nagidima e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">N na e gaxu feen nafama nɛn e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">bayo n bata xinla ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">muxu yo mi a ratin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">bayo n bata falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">muxu yo mi a tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">Koni naxan naɲaxu n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">e yi na liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">naxan yo mi rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">e yi na sugandi.<verse eid="ISA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala a yamaan madɛndɛnma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5"/>Ɛ tuli mati Alatalaa falan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">ɛ tan naxanye xuruxurunma gaxuni a falan bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">A naxa, “Ɛ ngaxakedenne ito nan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">ɛ raɲaxu naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">naxanye e mɛma ɛ ra n xinla fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">e naxa, ‘Alatala xa a binyen mayita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">nxu yi ɛ sɛwan to!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">Koni e tan nan yagima.<verse eid="ISA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6"/>Sɔnxɔ xuiin minima nɛn taani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">Gbelegbele xuiin yi mini Ala Batu Banxini!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">Alatala nan a yaxune saranma e kɛwanle ra.”<verse eid="ISA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7"/>“Benun a kuiin xa keli a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">a bata diin xali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">benun a xa diin barin xɔlɛn kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">a bata a dii xɛmɛn bari!<verse eid="ISA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8"/>Nde bata na fe sifan mɛ singen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Nde bata na fe sifan to singen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Yamanan tiyɛ lɔxɔ kedenni ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Siyana nde nɔɛ sɔtɛ lɔxɔ kedenni ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Anu, Siyon taan luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">alo ɲaxalan fudikanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">a kuina a xɔlɔ fɔlɔxi nɛn tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">a yi a yamaan bari!”<verse eid="ISA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9"/>Alatala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">“N tan dii bari waxatin nafɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">diin mi bari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">Xa n tan nan diin barin nagidixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">n tondɛ na ma ba?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">Ɛ Ala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 66:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10"/>Ɛ ɲaxan Yerusalɛn kaane xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">a xa findi ɛ sɛwa xunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">a rafan ɛ tan naxanye birin ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">Ɛ ɲaxan Yerusalɛn kaane xɔn han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">ɛ tan naxanye birin sunuxi a fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11"/>Amasɔtɔ, a luma nɛn alo ɛ nga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">ɛ yi a xiɲɛn min, a yi ɛ madɛndɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">Ɛ lugoma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">ɛ yi a fanna nun a binyen kolon.<verse eid="ISA 66:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12"/>Bayo Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">“N bɔɲɛ xunbenla rasigama Yerusalɛn ma nɛn alo baana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">e nun siyane nafunla alo fufana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">Ɛ xiɲɛn minma nɛn, ɛ yi banba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">ɛ masugusugu xinbin fari,<verse eid="ISA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13"/>alo muxuna nga a madɛndɛnma kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:13">n fan ɛ madɛndɛnma na kii nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:13">Ɛ madɛndɛnma nɛn Yerusalɛn taani.”<verse eid="ISA 66:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14"/>Ɛ na toma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">ɛ bɔɲɛn yi lu sɛwaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">ɛ mɔn yi sabati alo sɛxɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">Alatala a sɛnbɛn yitama nɛn a walikɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">a yi a xɔlɔn yita a yaxune ra.<verse eid="ISA 66:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15"/>Bayo Alatala fama tɛɛn nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">a yɛngɛ so wontorone luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">alo wuluwunla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">alogo a fitinaxin xa a xɔlɔn nakamali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">a kɔnkɔ xuiin yi rakamali tɛɛ dɛgɛ gbeen na.<verse eid="ISA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16"/>Alatala muxune birin makitima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:16">tɛɛn nun silanfanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:16">Alatala muxu faxaxine rawuyama ayi nɛn.<verse eid="ISA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17"/>Naxanye e yitɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:17">e yɛtɛ rasariɲan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:17">alogo e xa siga kide nakɔne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:17">e biraxi e bode fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:17">siga nakɔɔn tagini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:17">e tan naxanye xɔsɛ subene nun sulumɛne nun haramu seene donma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:17">ne birin halagima nɛn e bode xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:17">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ISA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala siyane birin malanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18"/>Ala naxa, “N na e kɛwanle nun e miriyane kolon. Siyane nun xuine birin malan waxatin bata a li. E fama nɛn, e yi n ma binyen to. <verse eid="ISA 66:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19"/>N taxamasenna sama nɛn e tagi: yamaan muxu dɔnxɛn naxanye luxi e nii ra, n na ndee rasigama nɛn siyane ma, siga Tarasisi kaane nun Pulone ma e nun Ludu kaane, xali woli kɛndɛne. Ndee mɔn yi siga Tubali nun Girɛki yamanani e nun fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔ makuyene, naxanye mi n xinla fe mɛxi, naxanye mi n ma binyen toxi, e yi n ma binyena fe fala siyane tagi. <verse eid="ISA 66:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20"/>E fama nɛn ɛ ngaxakedenne birin na, keli siyane birin yi, e findi kiseene ra Alatala xa, e fa soone fari e nun wontorone nun wontoro xunna soxine kui e nun sofanle nun ɲɔgɔmɛne fari, fa n ma geya sariɲanxin fari Yerusalɛn yi. Alatala naxa na kiini. E fama e ra nɛn alo Isirayila kaane fama e bogi se saraxane ra Alatala Batu Banxini kii naxan yi goron sariɲanxine kui. <verse eid="ISA 66:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21"/>N mɔn e tan ndee findima nɛn saraxaraline nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune ra.” Alatala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 66:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22"/>“Ɛ xinla nun ɛ yixɛtɛne luma nɛn n yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:22">alo kore xɔri nɛnɛn nun bɔxɔ xɔri nɛnɛn luma n yɛtagi kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:22">n fama naxanye dadeni.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:22">Alatalaa falan nan na ra<verse eid="ISA 66:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23"/>“Nayi, kike nɛnɛ yo kike nɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:23">Matabu Lɔxɔ yo Matabu Lɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:23">adamadiine birin fama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:23">e fa e xinbi sin n bun ma.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:23">Alatala naxa na kiini.<verse eid="ISA 66:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24"/>“E na mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:24">e yi muxune binbine to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:24">naxanye murutɛxi n xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:24">Kunla naxanye e donma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:24">ne mi faxɛ mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:24">tɛɛn naxan e ganma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:24">na mi tuyɛ mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:24">Adamadiine birin yi kabɛ e tɔrɔyaan ma.”<verse eid="ISA 66:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66"/>
</usx>
